<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Samuel Kukũ Kasale</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">SAMUEL KUKŨ KASALE</para>
  <para style="mt2">SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKI OTUO</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Samuel Kukũ Kasale</char> kotuo dikyi le niawa ni di Israel, diayɔ ni di batunletɛ obe kamɛ dialaadu ni baka obe kamɛ. Dikyi le mmle di Israel kale latɛ diafe di basuɔtɔ batiɛ suoto: Mma niale Samuel, batunletɛ kplɛ nwu ɔyɛntɛle; Saul, Israel batii ɔka kasale; ku Dawid wɔ sɛkambi sɛsaabla lale ni katũ fiɛ aabale ni sɛka lakpee kanya di Samuel ku Saul sɛsaabla kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kukũ ko mmle disi ɔlaa nte fɛle sekofo-laa akpanasaa bamba ya ninsi ni di Kanya Ninii Kofole kamɛ. Nni ninle alɛ onukwale ole ɔta Yaa nwako lelenkee, obe wɔ di otokopĩ nwako ni nimiina. Bɛɛkpasa nle mmle kamɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ aata ni oletatɛ Eli alɛ: “Mba niɛtɛɛ ni dibu kamabu ma, kafɔɔ mba niekyidi mi nii, kamanyu ma nyakatãa.” (2:30)</para>
  <para style="ip">Kukũ nwu lɛkpana mmle di asibu ateate lawɛ ni di sɛka ose kamɛ. SAATE nwu omu baayɔ alɛ ale Israel ɔka omuomu. Kafɔɔ di mmle aatuna aata ni batii nwu dibiesaa oso yi, SAATE nwu ladiki ɔka aata ma. Ɔlaa finle wɔ niawɛ ni niale alɛ ɔka ku Israel batii, akyuu lɛma anyɔ lasiɛ di SAATE kplɛ nwu ku Yaa lɛkanko kalɔ (2:7-10). Di Yaa afiofa nwu ole kamɛ yi, kute alɛ batii nwu bamuu ɔsaabla kule alɛ basaawɛntɛ ku bapiitɛ lele afiofa nwu kyɛkyɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Samuel fɛle Israel tunletɛ di Israel 1.1-7.17</para>
  <para style="io1">Saul labale ɔka 8.1-10.27</para>
  <para style="io1">Saul sɛka ole alɛɛ kasale 11.1-15.35</para>
  <para style="io1">Dawid ku Saul 16.1-30.31</para>
  <para style="io1">Saul ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ kukpi 31.1-13</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Elkana Ku Leyo Nɔɔ Batii Lakyɛ Silo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Efraim osuɔtɔ onwii lawɛ, aakye ni Ramataim, aale ni Sufi otii di Efraim kale lekpenkpe, leyooto nɔɔ niale Elkana nɛ. Yeroham obisuɔtɔbi aale, ɔwa nɔɔ niale Elihu. Elihu kafɔɔ niale Tohu obisuɔtɔbi, ɔwa nɔɔ niale Suf, Efriam otii aale. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Elkana lawɛ basɔfɔ banyɔ; onwii leyooto niale Hana, ɔnyɔɔfa kafɔɔ niale Penina. Penina lawɛ babi, kafɔɔ Hana ditawɛ kuonwii.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Lɛlɛɛ biala osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle nkata ankyɛ okpoo nɔɔ anaasumu, anta oleɔta anta SAATE wɔ Ninlenke nii di Silo, nfũ di Eli babisuɔtɔbi nwu banyɔ Hofni ku Pinehas lale ni SAATE nwu olebatatɛ. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Obe lele di dii lewo alɛ Elkana kata oleɔta yi, anta ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Penina ku babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi nɔɔ bamuu sina dikudi, dikudi. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Kafɔɔ Hana nnwɔɔ, Elkana ntɔɔ akudi anyɔ, diekye ambɔmbɔ nwɔ, kafɔɔ SAATE nwu lasɛɛ nwɔ olofofɔtɔ. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Ta SAATE nwu lasɛɛ nwɔ ni olofofɔtɔ oso yi, ɔsɔfɔwo nɔɔ ntoowolaa nwɔ kaanya, alɛ ookpee nwɔ ɔblɔ. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Nle mmle latɔɔwa lɛlɛɛ biala. Obe lele di Hana lɛkata ɛɛkyɛ SAATE nwu leyo, ɔsɔfɔwo nɔɔ nkpee nwɔ ɔblɔ ninta anwi, ansinle alesaa. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Ɔsa nɔɔ Elkana nkaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Hana, obe oso foowi? Obe oso fonoole alesaa? Obe oso feebuo nyaami nkpo? Ninlenke babisuɔtɔbi lefosi nta fɔ?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hana Ku Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Dii ninwii, baaloo ni ole ku onyi di Silo, Hana lataka aayila. Obe nwu oletatɛ Eli lasiɛ leekpomii di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kayoko owoso ɔlɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Ni di Hana labuo nyaami, aawi nwaa, ni aapɛ ɔlaa aata SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Ni aaka ntam aabuɛ alɛ, “Oo SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni, nse fabanyu kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ dibuo fannyuma mi, fanan-yee kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, kafɔɔ fɛɛtɔɔ obisuɔtɔbi yi, ni kamayɔ nwɔ nta SAATE nwu, di nkpa nɔɔ ayi amuu kamɛ. Disi kakpaasupamii kukanwii dilɔbakyɛ nwɔ disi diidii.”<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Di Hana latɔɔpɛ ɔlaa aatɔɔta ni SAATE nwu yi, Eli latoonyu nwɔ kaanya. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana latɔɔpɛ ɔlaa di otu nɔɔ kamɛ, kafɔɔ anyasibi nɔɔ latɔɔpɛpɛɛ, kafɔɔ batanu nwɔ sɛlɔ. Nioso Eli lanyu alɛ nta oosiɛ, <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Ɔmɛmbe fabasiɛ nta fanaase? Diɛ nta onyi.”<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Ni di Hana ladiki kanya alɛ, “Diele nkpo kute, saate nii, ɔsanko wɔ nikonu ni dibuo osie kanya nle. Ninnyi nta ee nta siene; otu nii kamɛ ɔlaa kodiki ntɔkɔ SAATE nwu. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Tannyu falɛ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nle ɔsanko ditiipɛ; kɔpɛ ɔlaa ninfũ nkyeko dibuo kplɛ ninyinyi kamɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Ni di Eli ladiki kanya alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ, di Israel Yaa nwu ata fɔ lɛsaa le fɛɛkaalɛ nwɔ ni.”<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Ni di Hana labuɛ alɛ, “Ta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ awɛ sibualɛ di anu lɛfɔ.” Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu lasifi aalaale alesaa, ni di anu nɔɔ lafukuti nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samuel Lelofo Ku Ɔyɔ Ɔta Yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Kaleesɛ kuyitatũ, Elkana ku leyo nɔɔ batii lataka baasumu di SAATE nwu anu, ni baakple baasifi leyo lɛma di Rama nɛ. Ninfɛ di Elkana latenko ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Hana, ni di SAATE nwu lanyuma nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Nioso di obe nwu kamɛ Hana lalaka lɛmɛ ni aalofo obisuɔtɔbi nɛ. Ni aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Samuel, aabuɛ alɛ, “Diekye SAATE nwu nfũ lakaalɛ nwɔ lakyeko.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Obe wɔ di osuɔtɔ nwu, Elkana ku leyo nɔɔ batii lakata baakyɛ alɛ bɔɔlata ni lɛlɛɛ oleɔta manta ni SAATE nwu, ambla ni di ntam nɔɔ be aaka nii kanya yi, <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Hana ditakyɛ. Ni aatɔkɔ ɔsa nɔɔ alɛ, “Nse osuɔtɔbi nwu ntoobudi lɛnyɛɛ yi, kamakpaa nwɔ nkyɛnko di SAATE nwu anu, ansiɛ ninfa obe lele.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Ni di ɔsa Elkana latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Bla nle nimalɛ ninta fɔ ni, siɛ ninfũ dilaase di obe wɔ fatoobudisɔɔ ni lɛnyɛɛ; SAATE nwu ablako ɔlaa nɔɔ nwu ɔkpɛ nwaa.” Nioso Hana lasiɛ leeyo aaklee obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ diaalase di obe wɔ aabudisɔɔ ni lɛnyɛɛ.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Aabudisɔɔ lɛnyɛɛ aaloo nii, aakpaa osuɔtɔbi nwu ale ni obisɔ, aaklee kafɔɔ nankyue-suɔtɔ wɔ niafũ ni alɛɛ atiɛ ku nnaafũ efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.36</char><char style="ft" closed="false">efa lɛbla bakilo lefosi</char></note> onwii ku nta dikuuku aakyɛnko SAATE nwu leyo di Silo. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Baalo nankyue nwu baaloo nii, ni baakpaa osuɔtɔbi nwu baawako Eli, <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />ni di Hana latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Di nwaako saate nii, fɛɛnya fakpe ni nkpa, ami ninle ɔsanko wɔ niayila ni ninfũ di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛfɔ latɔɔpɛ ɔlaa latɔɔta ni SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Lapɛ ɔlaa lakaalɛ obi wɔ mmle, ni di SAATE nwu latɛɛ lɛsaa le lakaalɛ nwɔ ni nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Nioso kanunua lɛyɔ nwɔ lɛta SAATE nwu. Nkpa nɔɔ mmuu babayɔ nwɔ manta SAATE nwu.” Ni di Elkana ku leyo nɔɔ batii lasumu SAATE nwu ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Hana Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Ninfɛ di Hana lapɛ ɔlaa aabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">“Otu nii, nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ di SAATE nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">di SAATE nwu kamɛ bɛɛtakatɛsa lɛkya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lɛkya ɔlaa wɔ mmle kotuo osie</char></note> nii katoo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Kanya nii kɔkanta di balo nii suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">diekye mmpɔ di didiki lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />“Kuonwii nnaa ate ni klekle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Klekletɛ Nwu</char></note> fɛle SAATE nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">kuonwii nnaa fɛ afɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">Difuɔnkpaa kuninwii nnaa fɛle Yaa loo.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />“Tantɔɔkakatɛ lɛkanta kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">ee fata kanya lɛfɔ katantoobuɛ sɛkanta-laa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">diekye SAATE nwu nle Yaa wɔ nin-ye nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ nimbudisa ɔlaa anta batii nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />“Batoofefee bakpɛtɛ ataa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:4">kafɔɔ mankpee mba ninaa ni ɔnyɛɛ osie.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Mba niale baamiɛ ni saa, ntɔɔkyɛ bɔɔbla sɛkpɛ manta batii manfũ alɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">kafɔɔ kɔka diesinkle mba di kɔka laklee nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Ɔsanko wɔ niale ni ɔlɛma ntoolofo babi bakuɛnsĩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">kafɔɔ ɔsanko wɔ niawɛ ni babisuɔtɔbi kpinwu nfɛ kɔsɔɔ anloo.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />“SAATE nwu nwako kukpi, anta kafɔɔ mansiɛ nkpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">nnwɔɔ ninkpaa batii ankpee di ɔkya kamɛ, antakatɛsa ma kafɔɔ.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />SAATE nwu nta dipii ku lɛsaawɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">nnwɔɔ ninwakosa batii kasɔ, nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ nintakatɛsa ma katoo.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Nnwɔɔ nintakatɛsa bapiitɛ di kudu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">ankɛnkɛ mba diefĩ ni kafɔɔ di ntɔ ditii suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">nnwɔɔ ninsiɛsa ma ku banɔɔfotii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">anta ma kafɔɔ mansiɛ di dibu lɛkakpomii suoto.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:8" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">“Diekye kasɔ nwu asɔse nle SAATE nwu ale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">nnya suoto ɛɛtɛ kayi nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Abanyu baklekletɛ nɔɔ nkpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">kafɔɔ abata basiensietɛ nlokanana di ditunu kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">“Diele suoto osie ninta otii nlenkee.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Bababibiɛ mba niesĩ ni SAATE nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Abakpududuu ankyeko osi ankpete ma di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">SAATE nwu kamakanko kasɔ nwu nyɛntɛlekɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">“Abata ɔka nɔɔ osie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">antakatɛsa nnwɔ ɛɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ lɛkya katoo.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Ninfɛ di Elkana lasifi leyo nɔɔ di Rama, kafɔɔ osuɔtɔbi nwu latɔɔbla ɔkpɛ di SAATE nwu anu, di Eli ɔletatɛ nwu kalɔ.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eli Babisuɔtɔbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Eli babisuɔtɔbi lale basuɔtɔ kpile; batawɛ dibu kuninwii baata SAATE nwu. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Ɔsaabla kuale kuata olebatatɛ ba mmle ku batii nɔɔ alɛ, obe lele di otii owo lɛta oleɔta, bɔɔwa ni sina nwu yi, oletatɛ kpɛmblatɛ nklee ɔwɛfɛ-futuwɛ nnya ntiɛ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ anwako. <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />An-yɔ ankpee di bɛɛsi ee ɔkakutu ee ladisɛ ee dibukii andiki sina. Oletatɛ kafɔɔ n-yɔ sina lele di ɔwɛfɛ nwu lediki nii. Nkpo mambla Israel batii bamuu ba ninwa ni Silo nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Kafɔɔ fiɛ bia babafiɛ ni lɛla nwu, oletatɛ kpɛmblatɛ nwu nkyɛ anaatɔkɔ otii wɔ nikɔta ni oleɔta alɛ, “Ta oletatɛ nwu sina sewo afiɛ; ɔlɔbafũ sina wanne di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ, kafɔɔ sɛkɔnne lete.”<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Nse otii wɔ nikɔta ni oleɔta nwu lɛtɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Ta bakasa lɛla nwu ofiɛ, fiɛ nfɛ faadiki selele foomiɛ yi,” kpɛmblatɛ nwu ndiki kanya alɛ, “Oowo, yɔ sĩ fatɛɛ nunua; nse faatuna, kamayɔ osie ndiki sĩ.”<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Bakosopo ba mmle okpile latɛ kuamuɔ di SAATE nwu anu, diekye batatɔɔyɔ dibu baatɔɔta SAATE nwu asaaɔta.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samuel Di Silo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Kafɔɔ Samuel latɔɔbla ɔkpɛ di SAATE nwu anu-osuɔtɔbi wɔ niekpee ni simu akpeele fɛnɛnɛɛ. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Lɛlɛɛ biala Samuel ɔya nkaa akpeele kyɔ biibii ankyɛnko nwɔ, nse ɔɔkata ankyɛ nfa ku ɔsa manaata lɛlɛɛ kaanya oleɔta. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Eli nwii Elkana ku ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ lɛtɔtrɔ ambuɛ alɛ, <char style="nd">“Saate</char> nwu ata fɔ babi di ɔsanko wɔ mmle suoto, di nnwɔ aapɛ ɔlaa aakaalɛ ni aayɔ nwɔ aata ni SAATE nwu kanya.” Nse batoosifi leyo. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Ni di SAATE nwu lale Hana sibualɛ nɛ; ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi batiɛ ku babisankobi banyɔ nɛ. Di obe nwu kamɛ, osuɔtɔbi Samuel nwu latoomuɔ di SAATE nwu anu.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eli Ku Babisuɔtɔbi Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Ni di Eli wɔ nintoobe ni nwaa lanu lɛsaa biala le di babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ latɔɔbla ni di Israel batii bamuu suoto nɛ. Mmle mantenko ni basanko ba nintɔɔbla ni ɔkpɛ di Lɛkpaayo le Mansi ni kayoko. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Nioso aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Obe oso biɔbla asaa nwu nkpo okle? Konu nkyeko batii bamuu nfũ di ɔsaabla kpile lee wɔ mmle suoto. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Oowo, babisuɔtɔbi nii; diele ɔlaa biene konu, kuɔkpɛ kunkyaka ni di SAATE nwu batii kamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Nse otii lɛbla okpile di otii bamba suoto, Yaa nle kpanaatɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yaa nka antɔɔ</char></note> antɔɔ; kafɔɔ nse otii lɛbla okpile di SAATE nwu suoto, owe nimale kpanaatɛ antɔɔ?” Kafɔɔ babi nwu ditanu ote lɛma kɔkà, diekye SAATE nwu dibiesaa diale alɛ aalo ma.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Ni di osuɔtɔbi Samuel nwu latoomuɔ di suoto sina kamɛ, ni aabuo SAATE nwu ku batii anu nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Obuɛɔtɛ Oyila Di Eli Leyo Batii Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Ninfɛ di Yaa otii onwii lawa Eli nfũ aabatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Ntatɛ ladiki suoto nii latuo teefɔ leyo, di obe wɔ baasiɛ ni di Egipte di Farao kalɔ? <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Ladiki teefɔ lakyeko ana nwu amuu kamɛ di Israel nlɛ ale mi oletatɛ, alɛ aakata ankyɛ oleɔta akyikye nii anaafiɛ olufui, ankpee kafɔɔ simu akpeele di anu nii. Layɔ kafɔɔ asaaɔta ya di Israel batii lata ni ku ɔtɔ amuu lata teefɔ leyo. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Obe oso minoobu oleɔta ku asaaɔta nii wɔ lɛbla lɛta ni kasiɛkɔ nii? Obe oso foobu babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ fanlenkee mi, minle aba ya ninlɛ ye ni di asaaɔta biala ya di Israel batii nii kɔta ni, minwɛ suoto?’<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />“Nioso SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa nwu lebuɛ alɛ: ‘Laka ntam nlɛ teefɔ leyo ku leyo lɛfɔ kamabla ɔkpɛ di anu nii dinaa ni kaloo.’ Kafɔɔ kanunua SAATE nwu kobuɛ alɛ: ‘Dikyɛ di okyo di suoto nii! Mba niɛtɛɛ ni dibu kamabu ma, kafɔɔ mba niekyidi mi nii, kamasĩ ma. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Obe kɔwa kamabudi osie lɛfɔ ku teefɔ leyo osie kakuu, alɛ ɔnɔɔfo beene dilɔbasinwɛ di leyo lɛfɔ batii kamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Fabanya kafɔɔ dibuo di kasiɛkɔ nii. Nu bababla dibiene manta Israel yi, leyo lɛfɔ kamɛ nni, ɔnɔɔfo beene dilɔbawɛ diidii. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Olele lee ninambudi ndiki di oleɔta akyikye nii suoto, kamawɛ nkpa alɛ aata anu lɛfɔ n-yii ku nnumɛɛ, ninta otu lɛfɔ mbuo sɛnyaami. Banantii lɛfɔ bamuu kamakpi di sekosopo lɛma obe kamɛ.<verse eid="1SA 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />“‘Lɛsaa le kafɔɔ nimabla ni babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ banyɔ nwu, Hofni ku Pinehas, kamale dituosaa ninta fɔ-banyɔ lɛma nwu kamakpi dii ninwii. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Kamadiki onukwale oletatɛ nta suoto nii, nnwɔ nimabla ni di lɛsaa le ninsi ni di otu nii ku disibu nii kamɛ. Kamase leyo nɔɔ kpinkpĩ, ababla ɔkpɛ kafɔɔ di nnwɔ lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ anu obe lele. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Nse otii biala niebu ni di leyo lɛfɔ kamɛ ntɔɔwa ɛɛbawa kasɔ di anu nɔɔ ɛɛkaalɛ koto fututu ku alesaa akloo, antikiti kafɔɔ lekoto alɛ, “Tɛɛ oletatɛ ɔkpɛ owo mbla, alɛ kawɛ alesaa nle.”’”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Ladiki Suoto Aatuo Samuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Osuɔtɔbi Samuel nwu latɔɔbla ɔkpɛ di SAATE nwu anu di Eli kalɔ. Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ, SAATE nwu ɔlaa ditatɛ kuawɛ; odiki otuo kpinwu ditawɛ.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Dii ninwii kakyɛ, Eli wɔ di anu nɔɔ nfɛ nte ni tutufuu, alɛ sebe fiɛ nfɛ ɔɔnya nii, late di katenkɔ nɔɔ. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Yaa ɔtɔ nwu kafɔɔ diinii, Samuel kafɔɔ late di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ, di nfũ di Yaa lɛlakaa nwu n-yɛ nii. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lalɛɛ Samuel nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:4">Samuel latuna alɛ, “Nnyɛɛ.” <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Ni aatoso aakyɛ Eli nfũ aalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Fɛɛlɛɛ mi; nnyɛɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Kafɔɔ Eli labuɛ alɛ, “Ami ninlɛɛ fɔ; kple faatɔɔkyɛ falaate.” Nioso Samuel lasifi aalaate.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />SAATE nwu lakple aalɛɛ alɛ, “Samuel!” Ni di Samuel lataka aakyɛ Eli nfũ aalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Fɛɛlɛɛ mi; nnyɛɛ.” Ni di Eli labuɛ alɛ, “Obi nii, ninlɛɛ fɔ; kple faatɔɔkyɛ falaate.”<verse eid="1SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Obe nwu Samuel diitofo SAATE nwu: Badidiki SAATE nwu ɔlaa batuo nwɔ.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />SAATE nwu lalɛɛ Samuel ditiɛfa, ni di Samuel lataka aakyɛ Eli nfũ aalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Fɛɛlɛɛ mi; nnyɛɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Ninfɛ di Eli latofo alɛ SAATE nwu nikɔlɛɛ osuɔtɔbi nwu nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Nioso Eli latɔkɔ Samuel alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ faalaate, nse eekple ɛɛlɛɛ fɔ, faabuɛ falɛ, ‘SAATE, kakatɛ, diekye kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ konu.’ ” Nioso Samuel lakple aalaate di katenkɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Ni di SAATE nwu labayila ninfa, aatɔɔlɛɛ fɛ obe nwu alɛ, “Samuel! Samuel!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Ninfɛ di Samuel labuɛ alɛ, “Kakatɛ, kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ konu.”<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Samuel alɛ: “Nyu, kɔwa lɛsaa ninwii ɔbabla di Israel nimata alɛ ɔfɔɔ kamasifi otii biala atoko nienu nwu nii. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Di obe nwu kamɛ kamabla lɛsaa biala le labuɛ layila ni di Eli leyo batii suoto- diɛyɔ ni di kasɔ kakyekɔ diɛlaase ni di kayɛntɛkɔ. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Diekye latɔkɔ nwɔ nlɛ kamakanko leyo nɔɔ batii dinaa ni kaloo, ta sikpile se aatofo sĩ ni ole; babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ lɛbla suoto lɛma mbusuo lɛsaa, kafɔɔ aasĩ, ataka ma. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Nioso, lɛka ntam lɛta Eli leyo nlɛ, ‘Oleɔta ee asaaɔta dilɔbafuo Eli leyo sikpile ɔkpanaa diidii.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samuel late dialaadu olesɛ fiɛ aasɛkɛtɛ SAATE nwu leyo n-yoko. Aayɛkɛ odiki otuo nwu ɔtɔkɔ Eli. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Kafɔɔ Eli lalɛɛ nwɔ aatɔkɔ alɛ, “Obisuɔtɔbi nii, Samuel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Ni di Samuel latuna alɛ, “Nnyɛɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Ninfɛ di Eli lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Obe di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ fɔ? Tan-yɔ nwu faawofasɛɛ. Yaa ananfi fɔ kootoko, aata ni diwɛ osie nwaa, nse fɛɛyɔ lɛsaa lele aatɔkɔ fɔ feewofasɛɛ.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Nioso Samuel latɔkɔ nwɔ lɛsaa biala, atayɔ lɛsalɛsaa aawofasɔɔ. Ninfɛ di Eli labuɛ alɛ, “Nnwɔɔ ninle SAATE nwu nɛ, ta abla nle ninlɛ nwɔ ni di anu nɔɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Di Samuel lamuɔ nii, SAATE nwu lasiɛko nwɔ, aata ɔlaa nɔɔ biala lawa kaanya. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Nioso Israel omuu, diayɔ ni di Dan dialaadu ni Beerseba latofo alɛ beese Samuel fɛle SAATE nwu ɔlaa buɛtɛtɛ. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />SAATE nwu lakple aatoodiki suoto aatootuo di Silo, nfa kafɔɔ aatoodiki suoto nɔɔ aatootuo Samuel diafe ni di ɔlaa nɔɔ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Filisti Batii Lafũ Kanya Ninii Lɛlakaa Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Ninfɛ di Samuel ɔlaa nwu laladu Israel omuu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Ni di Israel batii ladie baalaakpɛko Filisti batii nɛ. Israel batii lasi di Ebeneser, Filisti batii kafɔɔ lasi di Afek. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Filisti batii ladiki bakpɛtɛ lɛma baalaakyakako Israel, di kakpɛ nwu kanya lawɛ ni osie, Filisti batii lalenkee Israel. Baalo Israel batii fɛle nkpe nna di kakpɛ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Obe wɔ di bakpɛtɛ nwu lakple baawa ni kasiɛkɔ lɛma, Israel banɔɔfo lakaalɛ alɛ, “Obe oso di SAATE nwu lɛta beelenkee wo miɛ di Filisti batii anu? Bita budieko SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu di Silo, alɛ diatikanko wo, nindiki wo kafɔɔ di balo loo nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Nioso bakpɛtɛ nwu lakpee batii baakyɛ Silo, ni baalaakplesa SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni, oole ni sɛka di kerubim obo, kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu baawako nɛ. Eli babisuɔtɔbi banyɔ nwu, Hofni ku Finehas kafɔɔ lawɛ ninfa ku Yaa kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Obe wɔ di SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛkaa lababuo ni kasiɛkɔ nwu, Israel batii bamuu layiisa kudu osie kanya diata alɛ kasɔ latũkũ. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Filisti batii lanu kudu nwu, ni baakaalɛ alɛ, “Obe ninle kudu ko mmle dudu di Hebri batii kasiɛkɔ nwu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:6">Obe wɔ baanu ni alɛ SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛkaa nintɔɔwa ni kasikɔ nwu yi, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Filisti batii layɛkɛ. Ni baabuɛ alɛ, “Afiɔ ntɔɔwa kasiɛkɔ nwu, nfɛ busi di ɔlaa! Lɛsaa le mmle okle diiwa diidii. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Buyɔɔsa! Owe nimadiki wo di afiɔ kplɛ ya mmle nnɛɛ? Nnya ninle afiɔ ya niapɛ ni Egipte batii ku sifiɛ kpile ateate di ɔfaafuu nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Filisti batii biwɛ osie! Bile basuɔtɔ, nse diele nkpo bibale balanle minta Hebri batii, fɛ mmle batoodile bɛɛta ye nii. Bile basuɔtɔ, biɛkpɛ!”<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Nioso Filisti batii lakpɛ, ni baalenkee Israel batii nɛ, otii biala latoso aasifi lɛkpaayo nɔɔ. Mba baalo ni latɛ baapɔ; Israel bakpɛtɛ ba ninkyɛ ni ninkpaa nkpe afosi-atiɛ baalo. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Filisti batii lafũ Yaa lɛlakaa nwu, Eli babisuɔtɔbi banyɔ nwu, Hofni ku Finehas kafɔɔ lakpi.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eli Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Di dii nwu nkpo kale, Benyamin otii onwii latoso di kakpɛ kanya aasifi Silo. Akpeele nɔɔ labɛbɛɛ, kudu kafɔɔ latika nwɔ diisi. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Obe wɔ aabuo nii, Eli lasiɛ di lekpomii nɔɔ di osuku kotoko aatoonyu, diekye otu nɔɔ latɔɔyɛkɛ kuatɔɔta Yaa lɛlakaa nwu. Obe wɔ di osuɔtɔ nwu labuo ni okpoo, aabuɛ ni lɛsaa le niawa nii, okpoo omuu lafaa kaku.<verse eid="1SA 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli lanu kaku nwu, ni aakaalɛ alɛ, “Kudú nwu nkpo kasɔ mɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:14">Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu lapɛsɛwa aaladu Eli <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />wɔ nintoofũ ni alɛɛ afosi-anaasĩ-anɛ, anu kafɔɔ ntoobiɛ nwɔ oso oloosinnya. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Ni aatɔkɔ Eli alɛ, “Kanunua ntookye kakpɛ kanya lɛwa nɛ; letoso kakpɛ di miɛ dii le mmle.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Ni di Eli lakaalɛ alɛ, “Obisuɔtɔbi nii, obe niɛwa?”<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ wɔ niawako ni kanya labuɛ alɛ, “Israel letoso di Filisti batii anu, bakpɛtɛ kpinwu lɛnɔɔ. Ni kafɔɔ babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ banyɔ nwu, Hofni ku Finehas lekpi. Beefũ kafɔɔ Yaa lɛlakaa nwu.”<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Obe wɔ aalɛɛ ni Yaa lɛlakaa nwu, Eli nianɔɔ sɛmaa, sɛmaa di lekpomii nɔɔ di kayoko nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ. Simu nɔɔ lafee, ni aakpi nɛ. Diekye ɔnɔɔfo benne aale, aawɛ onutũ kafɔɔ. Aaleko Israel katũ alɛɛ afosi-ana.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Finehas Kpisɔfɔ Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Eli obi-sɔfɔ, Finehas ɔsɔfɔ lalaka lɛmɛ di olofobee nɔɔ kafɔɔ ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ nii. Obe wɔ aanu ni ɔlaa nwu alɛ beefũ ni Yaa lɛlakaa nwu, di ɔsa-nɔɔ-ote ku ɔsa ntookpi nii, kolofo lanu nwɔ, ni aalofo nɛ, kafɔɔ aakpi ta kolofo dibuo oso. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Aatookpi nii, basanko ba niatoolofosɔɔ ni labuɛ alɛ, “Tan-yɛkɛ; fatoolofo obisuɔtɔbi.” Kafɔɔ atatuna ee akpanko suoto.<verse eid="1SA 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Aatika obi nwu leyooto alɛ Akabod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akabod lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ lɛkpa nsinnaa</char></note>, aabuɛ alɛ, “Lɛkpa ntoodie di Israel”- ta mmle beefũ ni Yaa lɛlakaa nwu ku ɔsa-nɔɔ-ote ku ɔsa kukpi oso. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Aabuɛ alɛ, “Lɛkpa nwu ntoodie di Israel kamɛ, diekye batoofũ Yaa lɛlakaa nwu.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kanya Ninii Lɛlakaa Nwu Di Filisti Batii Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Di Filisti batii lafũ ni Yaa lɛlakaa nwu sɛmaa, baayɔ ni di Ebeneser baasifiko Asdod. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Ninfɛ baatuka lɛlakaa nwu baalaabuoko di Dagon afiɔ olekatakɔ, baayɔ ni baase di Dagon afiɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Di Asdod batii lataka ni kaleesɛ kuyitatũ yi, baanya alɛ Dagon nwu lanɔɔ, anu nɔɔ nfuu kaasɔ di SAATE nwu lɛlakaa anu! Ni baayɔ Dagon baakplesa baase di kayilakɔ nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Kafɔɔ kaleesɛ oyita, obe wɔ baataka nii, baanya alɛ Dagon lanɔɔ, anu nɔɔ nfuu kaasɔ di SAATE nwu lɛlakaa anu! Disi ku nnɛɛ lafefee diate di kayokontũ; suoto nɔɔ lete niabu. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Nioso diɛbase bia miɛ dii le mmle Dagon olebatatɛ ee otii lele niebuo Dagon olekatakɔ nwu di Asdod ninafu kayokontũ nwu.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />SAATE nwu letoko nanfi lawɛ osie di Asdod batii ku batii ba niasiɛ ni di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma suoto. Aata difu lapɛ ma, ni aata kawɔɔ ku adiesaa lawa ma di suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Di Asdod batii lanya ni lɛsaa le nikɔwa nii, ni baabuɛ alɛ, “Diɛkaatɛ Israel batii afiɔ lɛlakaa nwu n-yila di ɔkyɛ loo. Diekye letoko nanfi nɔɔ nkpe osie di awo ku afiɔ loo Dagon suoto.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Nioso baalɛɛ Filisti batii batunletɛ bamuu baasiisa baakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Obe bubablako Israel afiɔ lɛlakaa nwu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Bita bakyisa Israel afiɔ lɛlakaa nwu basifiko Gat.” Nioso baakyisa Israel Yaa nwu lɛlakaa baasifiko nfa.<verse eid="1SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Kafɔɔ baakyisa ni baasifiko ni nfa, SAATE nwu letoko nanfi lawa di Gat okpoo nwu suoto, aata difu kplɛ labuo nwu kaamɛ. Aata adiesaa ladidie batii nwu di okpoo nwu, babisɔ ku banɔɔfo akyuu lɛma anyɔ. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Nkpo oso baayɔ Yaa lɛlakaa nwu baasifiko Ekron.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:10">Di Yaa lɛlakaa nwu latoobuo ni Ekron, Ekron batii lafaa baabuɛ alɛ, “Batɔɔyɔ Israel afiɔ lɛlakaa bɛɛwako ɔkyɛ loo alɛ abalo wo ku batii loo.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Nioso baalɛɛ Filisti batii batunletɛ bamuu baasiisa baatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Biyɔ Israel afiɔ lɛlakaa nwu bisifiko; bita ni disifi kayilakɔ nini nimu, se diele nkpo dibalo wo ku batii loo.” Diekye kukpi ntooyii okpoo kplɛ nwu ku lɛyɛkɛ. Yaa letoko nanfi latɛ diawɛ osie niinwu suoto. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Mba nitakpi nii, adiesaa ladidie ma, ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu lɛfaa lakata diasifi Yaa nfũ di osi nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kanya Ninii Lɛlakaa Nwu Okplesa Ɔwako Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Obe wɔ di SAATE nwu lɛlakaa lawɛ ni di Filisti batii kasɔ awɛntɛ akuɛnsĩ yi, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />ni di Filisti batii lalɛɛ olebatatɛ ku babɔmpɛtɛ baatɔkɔ alɛ, “Be bubablako SAATE nwu lɛlakaa? Bitɔkɔ wo mmle bubakplesa ni munsifiko ni kayilakɔ nini.”<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Nse biokplesa Israel afiɔ lɛlakaa nwu yi, bitankplesa ni biasifiko difukuti. Kafɔɔ dikpeni biɛkyɛnko nwɔ lɛpɔɔ okpi asaaɔta. Ni babakya ye sifiɛ, mintofo kafɔɔ lɛsaa le oso di letoko nanfi nɔɔ diitekete ni di suoto lee.”<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Ninfɛ di Filisti batii nwu lakaalɛ babɔmpɛtɛ nwu alɛ, “Be lɛpɔɔ okpi asaaɔta buɔkyɛnko nwɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Bibla koto sɛɛle adiesaa atembi anɔɔ ku koto sɛɛle nfusu atembi anɔɔ, di Filisti batii batunletɛ lɛpɔ kanya. Diekye ofiɛ kpile nwu onwii niapɛ aye ku batunletɛ nwu akyuu lee anyɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Bibla adiesaa nwu ku nfusu nwu atembi nikɔwɔɔsa ni kale nwu, biɛyɔ dibu bita Israel afiɔ nwu. Loobia abatekete letoko nanfi nɔɔ nwu di suoto lee ku afiɔ lee ku kasɔ lee. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Be oso biɔwɛnsa situ lee osie fɛ mmle di Egipte batii ku Farao labla ni? Obe wɔ aabla ma ni amumu osie kanya, batadiki Israel batii osuku alɛ basifi osuku lɛma?<verse eid="1SA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />“Nunua, bimiɛ keke wɔ mannafi ni ɔfɔle bise, ku banankyue banyɔ ba ninkle ni abi, manadita ma babla ni ɔkpɛ diidii. Binii banankyue nwu bikaasa di keke nwu, kafɔɔ bikpaa abi lɛma nwu bilaakpee di kakpeekɔ lɛma. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Biyɔ SAATE nwu lɛlakaa bitika di keke nwu suoto, biɛyɔ koto sɛɛle asaa nwu biɛbla bilɛ biokplesa minkyɛnko nwɔ ni fɛ lɛpɔɔ okpi asaaɔta bikpee di kalɛkɛɛ ka nintika ni di lɛlakaa nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ. Bidiki ni osuku diɛtɔɔkyɛ, <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />kafɔɔ bitoonyu ni. Nse diɛkata diesifi nni nimu kasɔ, diofe ni Bet Semes yi, ni SAATE nwu niata letoko nanfi kplɛ nwu lawa di suoto loo. Kafɔɔ nse diesifi, ni bubatofo bulɛ diele SAATE nwu niɛnanfi wo kootoko, kafɔɔ ɔwa ko diawa wo di suoto.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Nioso baabla nle mmle. Baayɔ banankyue nwu banyɔ baanii di keke suoto ni baakpee abi nwu di leyo lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Baayɔ SAATE nwu lɛlakaa baatika di keke nwu ku kalɛkɛɛ ka di koto sɛɛle nfusu ku koto sɛɛle adiesaa atembi ya baabla ni lasiɛ ni kaamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Ninfɛ di banankyue nwu lakata baakyɛ tinini baakyɔɔ anu Bet Semes, baatoowi di osuku. Batakɛ baafe oletanɛɛkyɛ ee ɔmɛntukyɛ. Filisti batii batunletɛ nwu latikanko ma baalaadu bia Bet Semes kɔmɛ.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Bet Semes batii latoofee akpaa lɛma di ɔtaata nwu, obe wɔ baatakatɛsa ni anu katoo, baanya ni lɛlakaa nwu yi, baanya suoto lɛyɔɔ ninfa. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Keke nwu lakyɛ aawa Yosua, Bet Semes otii nwu kofe, aabayila ninfa di difuɔ kplɛ ninwii ɔlɔɔkɔ. Ni di batii nwu labɛbɛɛ keke nwu sewoso, baayɔ banankyue nwu baata oleɔta fɛ ofiɛ asaaɔta baata SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Ninfɛ di Lewi batii latekete SAATE nwu lɛlakaa ku kalɛkɛɛ nwu di koto sɛɛle asaa nwu lasiɛ ni kaamɛ baase kaasɔ, ni baakɛnkɛ nya baatika di difuɔ kplɛ nwu suoto nɛ. Di dii nwu nkpo, Bet Semes batii lata ofiɛ asaaɔta oleɔta baata SAATE nwu. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Filisti batii batunletɛ nwu banɔɔ lanya nle mmle nimuu, ni baakple baasifi Ekron di dii nwu nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />N-ya mmle ninle koto sɛɛle adiesaa atembi ya di Filisti batii lakyɛnko ni SAATE nwu fɛ lɛpɔɔ okpi asaaɔta nɛ- okpoo biala lawɛ ninwii, ninwii, Asdod, Gasa, Askelon, Gat ku Ekron. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Koto sɛɛle nfusu atembi nwu kafɔɔ di Filisti batii sekpoo lɛpɔ kanya, sile ni batunletɛ banɔɔ nwu sele- sekpoo se beetofo seyoyiɛ beekyisa ni ku nnle lɛma kokpoenyii. Difuɔ kplɛ le suoto baatika ni SAATE nwu lɛlakaa nle kamaadiyilasaa diabadu dii le baakpana ni kukũ ko mmle di Yosua, Bet Semes otii nwu kofe.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Kafɔɔ Yaa lalo Bet Semes batii bawo. Aalo afosi-akuɛnsĩ lɛma ta baanyu ni SAATE nwu lɛlakaa kamɛ oso. Batii nwu lawi ta mmle di SAATE nwu labla ma ni oso.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Ni di Bet Semes batii lakaalɛ alɛ, “Owe nimafuo oyila di SAATE nwu anu, Yaa klekle wɔ mmle? Owe ɔkyɛ di lɛlakaa le mmle kamakata ninkyɛ, nse diedie ninfũ?”<verse eid="1SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanya Ninii Lɛlakaa Nwu Di Kiriat Yearim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Ninfɛ baakpee batɔkyɛntɛ di Kiriat Yearim batii nfũ baabuɛ alɛ, “Filisti batii ntookplesa SAATE nwu lɛlakaa bɛɛwako. Bisoo biwa biɛbayɔ ni bikatako bisifiko ɔkyɛ lee.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Nioso Kiriat Yearim batii lakyɛ baalaayɔ SAATE nwu lɛlakaa. Ni baayɔ ni baasifiko Abinadab leyo di lekpenkpe osi, ni baakleklesa obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Eleasar suoto alɛ atoonyu SAATE nwu lɛlakaa nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samuel Layila Di Israel Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Diale obe kpinwu, omuu labla alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ di lɛlakaa nwu lawɛ ni di Kiriat Yearim. Ni di Israel batii bamuu lawi baalɛɛ SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Ninfɛ di Samuel latɔkɔ Israel leyo nimuu alɛ, “Nse biokple minwa SAATE nwu nfũ ku situ lee simuu, ni bikyisa anu lee di bafɔɔ afiɔ ku Astarot suoto, biɛyɔ suoto lee bita SAATE nwu, biesumu nnwɔɔ lete, ni abadiki ye ankyeko Filisti batii nnɛɛ.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Nioso Israel batii lakyisa Baal ku Astarot lɛma baatɛ, ni baasumu SAATE nwu lete nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Ninfɛ di Samuel labuɛ alɛ, “Bisiisa Israel batii bamuu di Mispa nimpɛ ɔlaa nta SAATE nwu nta ye.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Obe wɔ baasi ni di Mispa, baadu ntu baanyɛɛnɛ baatɛ di SAATE nwu anu. Di dii nwu nkpo baanii kanya, baadiki sikpile lɛma baabuɛ ninfa alɛ, "Buɔbla okpile di SAATE nwu suoto.” Samuel niale Israel tunletɛ di Mispa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Obe wɔ di Filisti batii lanu alɛ Israel batii ntoosi ni di Mispa, ni di Filisti batii batunletɛ lawa alɛ bɔɔbadieko ma nɛ. Di Israel batii lanu nwu ni ole yi, baayɛkɛ, ta Filisti batii nwu oso. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Ni baatɔkɔ Samuel alɛ, “Tandiɛ ɔlaa ɔpɛ ɔta SAATE, Yaa loo ɔta wo, alɛ aadiki wo ankyeko Filisti batii nnɛɛ.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Ninfɛ di Samuel layɔ lefosobi le nikɔnyɛɛfu ni, aayɔ ni aata SAATE nwu fɛ ofiɛ asaaɔta aata nɛ. Aapɛ ɔlaa aalɛɛ SAATE nwu di Israel batii disi, ni di SAATE nwu latuna aatɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Obe wɔ di Samuel n-yɛ ɔɔta ni ofiɛ asaaɔta nwu, Filisti batii lakpukuti baatɛɛtɛɛ Israel batii alɛ bɔɔkpɛko ma. Kafɔɔ dii nwu nkpo SAATE nwu lakplalaa ku ɔplalaa osie kanya di Filisti batii suoto, diata alɛ baakpɔkpɔtɔ, baanɔnɔɔ di Israel batii anu. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Ni di Israel batii lakusa baadie di Mispa baatikanko Filisti batii, baaloloo ma baatɛ di osuku baalaadu Bet Kar okpoo kalɔ.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Ninfɛ di Samuel layɔ difuɔ aatɛ di Mispa ku Sen ntɛɛ nɛ. Ni aatika ni leyooto alɛ, Ebeneser,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebeneser lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ, Difuɔ kyakaakotɛ</char></note> aabuɛ alɛ, “Nfũ di SAATE nwu lɛkyakaako wo ɛɛbadu nɛ.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Nioso baalenkee Filisti batii, batasinkple baataka di Israel batii kasɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 7:13">Di Samuel nkpa mmuu osiɛ kamɛ, SAATE nwu letoko naanfi latika di Filisti batii suoto. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Baakplesa sekpoo se di Filisti batii lafũ ni di Israel batii nnɛɛ, diayɔ ni di Ekron dialaase ni di Gat baata Israel. Israel batii lafũ kafɔɔ nsɔ be niɛtɛɛtɛɛ ma ni di Filisti batii nnɛɛ. Nioso atoko ɔkyɛ ole lawɛ di Israel batii ku Amori batii ntɛɛ.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samuel lakple aatoole tunletɛ di Israel suoto di nkpa nɔɔ ayi amuu kamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Lɛlɛɛ biala Samuel nkyɛ ankyi diayɔ ni di Betel dialaadu ni Gilgal, diesifi ni Mispa anaantɔɔka aka antɔɔta Israel di aba ya mmle amuu. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Kafɔɔ obe lele ankple ansifi Rama, nfũ niale ni okpoo nɔɔ. Nfa kafɔɔ aatɔɔka aka aatɔɔta Israel nɛ. Ni aapɛ oleɔta akyikye ninfa aata SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Batii Lakaalɛ Alɛ Base Ɔka Bata Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Obe wɔ di Samuel ntoobe nii, aayɔ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ aase batunletɛ aata Israel. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Obi nɔɔ kasale leyooto niale Yoel, ɔnyɔɔfa leyooto kafɔɔ niale Abiya, baale batunletɛ di Beerseba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Kafɔɔ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nwu ditakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ suoto. Baatikanko lɛlɛ, baatoofũ ditunu kamɛ asaa, baasĩ aka tinini ɔka.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Nioso Israel banɔɔfo bamuu lasi kanya baawa Samuel nfũ di Rama. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />Baabatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Fatoobe, babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ kafɔɔ diɛkyɛ di sisuku lɛfɔ suoto; nioso nunua se ɔka, aaleko wo katũ, fɛ mmle di nnle bamba mmuu nkpe ni baka.”<verse eid="1SA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Kafɔɔ baabuɛ ni alɛ, “Ta wo ni ɔka aaleko wo ni katũ,” yi, ɔlaa nwu ditamɛnɛmɛnɛ Samuel; nioso aapɛ ɔlaa aata SAATE nwu. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nu ɔlaa wɔ omuu di batii nwu kɔtɔkɔ fɔ ni; diele afɔ beesĩ, kafɔɔ batoosĩ mi fɛ ɔka lɛma. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Fɛ mmle baabla ni diayɔ ni di dii le lakpaa ma ladieko ni di Egipte diɛbadu ni miɛ dii le mmle, baasĩ mi nii, baakyɛ baalaatoosumu ni afiɔ bamba yi, nkpo bɔɔyɔ mambla fɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Nunua nu ma ɔlaa; kafɔɔ funaa ma nwaa, faata ma batofo lɛsaa le di ɔka wɔ nimale ni sɛka di suoto lɛma kamabla ni.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Samuel labuɛ SAATE nwu sɛlaa simuu aatɔkɔ batii ba niatɔɔkaalɛ nwɔ alɛ ata ma ni ɔka. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Aabuɛ alɛ, “Nnya lɛsaa le di ɔka wɔ nimale ni sɛka di suoto lee kamabla ni: Abakpaa babisuɔtɔbi lee, anta ma mambla ɔkpɛ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni, ku bapɔnkɔ nɔɔ, babatoso kafɔɔ manle bakeke nɔɔ ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni katũ. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Abata bawo mbla kanya bayilatɛ manta nkpe ku afosi-anɔɔ. Babamba mafuu kasɔ nɔɔ manfee alesa nɔɔ, fiɛ di babamba kafɔɔ kamabla kakpɛ akpɛsaa ku akpɛnsaa manta bakeke nɔɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi nii. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Abayɔ babisankobi lee manle nnɔnyi kɔnɔkɔnɔ bablatɛ ku alesaa bawantɛ ku bloblo bafiɛtɛ. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Abafũ afe lee biene ku nta awosobi afe ku nnɔnyi awoso afe an-yɔ anta bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Abafũ atitabi lee dikyuu fosile ku nta lee an-yɔ anta banɔɔfotii ku bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Anfũ basuɔtɔ bakpɛmblatɛ ku basanko bakpɛmblatɛ lee ku banankyue ku babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo biene lee anta nnwɔɔ omu ɔkpɛ ɔbla. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Abafũ babɔkɛɛ sele lee dikyuu fosile, aye bamu kafɔɔ bibakple nwɔ balanle. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Nse dii nwu nkpo lewo, bibawi minkaalɛ lɛkyakaako minkyeko ɔka wɔ biediki ni nfũ. SAATE nwu kafɔɔ dilɔbatuna ata ye di dii nwu nkpo.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Kafɔɔ batii nwu lasĩ batakyɔɔ Samuel ɔlaa atoko, ni baabuɛ alɛ, “Oowo! Buomiɛ ɔka munta suoto. <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />Ni bubate fɛle nnle bamba mmuu, ku ɔka wɔ nimaleko wo ni katũ, anleko wo ni katũ, ankpɛ nkpɛ loo anta wo nii.”<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Di Samuel lanu ni sɛlaa se simuu di batii nwu labuɛ nii, ni aase sĩ dibuɛ ɔtɔkɔ SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Ni di SAATE nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nu ma ɔlaa, faata ma ɔka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 8:22">Ninfɛ di Samuel latɔkɔ Israel batii nwu alɛ, “Obiala lee akple aasifi okpoo nɔɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Lakyakako Samuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Benyamin otii saawɛntɛ onwii lawɛ, leyooto nɔɔ niale Kis. Ote niale Abiel, ɔwa nɔɔ niale Sero nɛ. Sero ote niale Bekorat, ote kafɔɔ niale Afia wɔ niakye ni Benyamin leyo kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Kis lawɛ obisuɔtɔbi onwii, leyooto nɔɔ niale Saul nɛ. Aale okosopo wɔ di okle-nɔɔ ditawɛ ni di Israel batii kamɛ-aakaana aalenkee otii biala.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Ninfɛ di Saul ote, Kis babɔkɛɛ nɔɔ ba nintuka ni atoo layu nɛ, ni di Kis latɔkɔ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Saul alɛ, “Kpaa kpɛmblatɛ onwii biɛkyɛ minko nwɔ bilawolaa babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo nwu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Nioso baafe di Efraim kale lekpenkpe, baafe di Salisa ntɛɛ nwu, kafɔɔ batanya ma. Baakple baabuo di Saalim kasɔ, kafɔɔ babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo ditawɛ ninfa. Ninfɛ baafe di Benyamin kasɔ suoto nɛ, kafɔɔ batanya ma.<verse eid="1SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Obe wɔ baadu ni Suf kasɔ suoto, Saul latɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ wɔ niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Wa buokple busifi, nse diele nkpo teemi kamadiɛ disi obu di babɔkɛɛ nwu suoto ankyako ɔyɛkɛ ɔta wo.”<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Kafɔɔ kpɛmblatɛ nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nyu lo, Yaa otii onwii nkpe di okpoo wɔ mmle; batii mbu nwɔ osie kanya, ɔlaa lele kafɔɔ eebuɛ nnwa kaanya. Ta bukyɛ nfa nunua. Loo bia abatuo wo osuku wɔ buoofe nii.”<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Ni di Saul lakaalɛ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nwu alɛ, “Nse buɔkyɛ, lɛ bubata osuɔtɔ nwu? Alesaa ya di atofo loo kamɛ ntooloo. Lɛkyɛsaa kuninwii nnaa wo buayɔ munkyɛnko ni Yaa otii nwu. Obe lɛsaa ninkpe wo?”<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Ni di kpɛmblatɛ nwu lakple aadiki kanya alɛ, “Nyu, nkle koto fututu dikyuu naafa. Kamayɔ ni nta Yaa otii nwu di mmle abatɔkɔ wo ni osuku wɔ buafe nii.” <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />(Saa di Israel, nse otii lɛkyɛ lɛsaa owolaa di Yaa nfũ yi, ambuɛ alɛ, “Biwa buɔkyɛ asaanyatɛ nfũ.” Diekye miɛ Yaa ɔlaa buɛtɛtɛ baatɔɔlɛɛ asaanyatɛ nɛ.)<verse eid="1SA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Ninfɛ di Saul latɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Kulɛ, wa buɔkyɛ.” Nioso baadie baasifi okpoo wɔ di Yaa otii nwu lawɛ nii.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Baatɔɔkata ni lekpenkpe baatoofe ni okpoo nwu, baakyakako basankobi bawo kɔwa ntu odu, ni baakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Nfũ di asaanyatɛ nwu nkpe nɛ?”<verse eid="1SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Akpe, akpe di sitũ lee. Bipɛsɛwa; kanunua nwu ɔɔwa okpoo loo nɛ. Diekye batii nwu nkpe oleɔta di olekatakɔ nwu. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Nse biebuo obuo okpoo nwu, bibanyɔɔ fiɛ abasifi olekatakɔ nwu anaale alesaa. Batii nwu dilɔbakye alesaa kalesɔ diɛlaase di obe wɔ abawa nii, diekye dikpeni eewii lɛtɔtrɔ di oleɔta nwu suoto; fiɛ sɛɛmaa, mba bɛɛlɛɛ ni kamale. Bikata bikyɛ nunua; bibanyɔɔ di obe wɔ mmle kamɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Ni baakata baasifi okpoo nwu nɛ. Baatoobuo nwu nii, Samuel nɛ, aatɔɔwa di anu lɛma, akyɛ di osuku nwu ɔɔkata anfe olekatakɔ nwu.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Fiɛ di kale kamasɛ ni dii le di Saul lawa nii, SAATE nwu ladiki nle mmle aatuo Samuel alɛ: <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Kɔsɛɛ fɛ nuakpa okle kamakyesee fɔ osuɔtɔ onwii eekye ni Benyamin kasɔ suoto. Pɛ nwɔ ɔfɔɔ, aale tunletɛ di batii nii Israel suoto; nnwɔɔ nimadiki batii nii ankyeko Filisti batii nnɛɛ nɛ. Ntɔɔnya batii nii dibuo, diekye kaku lɛma ntoodu mi.”<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Obe wɔ di Samuel anu layefe ni di Saul suoto, SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nnya osuɔtɔ wɔ suoto lakakatɛ lakyeko ni; nnwɔɔ nimale sɛka di batii nii suoto nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Ninfɛ di Saul latɛɛtɛɛ Samuel di okpoo nwu kasukunya aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Lekoto faafuo mi otuo lɛba le di asaanyatɛ nwu leyo nkpe ni.”<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Ninfɛ di Samuel ladiki kanya alɛ, “Ami ninle asaanyatɛ nwu nɛ, le mi katũ faakata fasifi olekatakɔ nwu, diekye miɛ fabale alesaa ku ami. Olesɛ kafɔɔ kamatɔkɔ fɔ kafɔɔ sɛlaa se simuu ninsi ni di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ, ninta fɔ fansifi. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Kafɔɔ di babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo ba nieyu ye ni miɛ dii tiɛfa suoto yi, tanta diabuo fɔ suoto di suoto lɛma; batɔɔnya ma. Ni owe ɔkyɛ nfɛ di Israel dibiesaa kamakyi ninfe, nse diele afɔ ku teefɔ leyo batii bamuu ɔkyɛ?”<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Ninfɛ di Saul ladiki kanya alɛ, “Kafɔɔ diele Benyamin otii nle, lekye ni Israel kɔna biibii kamɛ, kafaabi nii kafɔɔ ninle kabiibii di nfaabi be mmuu di Benyamin kɔna kamɛ? Be kanya oso fambuɛ ɔlaa nwu okle fantɔkɔ mi?”<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Ninfɛ di Samuel lakpaa Saul ku kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ aabuoko lɛkpata nwu kamɛ nɛ, aata ma baasiɛ di mba baalɛɛ ni di opunu katũ disi- lɛpɔ lɛma labla fɛ afosi-atiɛ. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Ni di Samuel latɔkɔ alesaa-wantɛ nwu alɛ, “Yɔ lɛnankudi le lata fɔ ni fawakoe, nle latɔkɔ fɔ nlɛ diki fatɛ ni lete.”<verse eid="1SA 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Nioso alesaa-wantɛ nwu layɔ kutĩ ku n-ya niakaa ni di suoto aabase di Saul anu. Ni di Samuel labuɛ alɛ, “Nnya lɛsaa le bɛɛyɔ bɛɛtɛ fɔ ni. Wee, diekye baadiki sĩ baatɛ lete baata fɔ, baata ni ɔsaabla wɔ mmle. Diayɔ ni di obe wɔ labuɛ ni nlɛ, ‘Nkpe ni bafɔɔ ba lɛkyakako nii.’ ” Ninfɛ di Saul lale alesaa ku Samuel di dii nwu nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Baasoo baakye ni olekatakɔ nwu baawa ni okpoo, Samuel lakakatɛko Saul di leyo nɔɔ lɛkya osi. <verse eid="1SA 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Baataka kolesɛtũ, ni di Samuel lalɛɛ Saul di lɛkya osi aatɔkɔ alɛ, “Lolaa suoto, kamata fɔ fanyefe osuku lɛfɔ.” Obe wɔ di Saul laloo ni suoto ololaa, ninfɛ di nnwɔɔ ku Samuel baadie baafe kayi banyɔ lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Baatoosoo baatoofe ni okpoo-lɔɔkɔ yi, ni di Samuel latɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Tɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nwu aale wo katũ”- ni di kpɛmblatɛ nwu labla nkpo nɛ- “Kafɔɔ afɔ siɛ ninfũ kɛɛkɛ, di mmle katɔkɔ fɔ ni kanya ka niekye ni Yaa nfũ.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel Lapɛ Saul Ɔfɔɔ Fɛ Ɔka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Ninfɛ di Samuel ladiki kakɔkɔɛ ku ɔfɔɔ aanyɛɛnɛ aakpete di Saul disi, ni aafĩfĩɔ nwɔ akpoo aabuɛ alɛ, “Diele SAATE nwu niɛpɛ fɔ ɔfɔɔ alɛ le tunletɛ di atesaa nɔɔ suoto?” <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Nse feediɛ mi miɛ feesifi, fabakyakako basuɔtɔ banyɔ di Rahel ɔkya ɔlɔɔkɔ di Selsa di Benyamin kasɔ kɔmɛ suoto. Babatɔkɔ fɔ alɛ, ‘Batɔɔnya babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo ba feedie fɛɛkyɛ foowolaa nii. Nioso nunua teefɔ ntoodiɛ ma disi obu. Afɔ disi nfɛ oobu. Teefɔ kɔkaalɛ alɛ, “Lɛ kamabla di obisuɔtɔbi nii suoto?” ’<verse eid="1SA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />“Ni fabadie ninfa fansifi ninaase di obe wɔ fablaadu ni Tabor kowoso kplɛ katũ. Basuɔtɔ batiɛ ba nikɔkata manfe ni Yaa nfũ di Betel makyakako fɔ ninfa. Onwii matuka kutiebii kutiɛ, ɔbamba bloblo akudi atiɛ, ɔbamba kafɔɔ nta dikuuku. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Babasɛɛsa fɔ manta fɔ bloblo akudi anyɔ, fabafũ nya fankyeko ni ɔkyɛ lɛma.<verse eid="1SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />“Nni sɛmaa faabakyɛ Gibea Yaa nfũ, lɛba le di Filisti batii kasiɛkɔ nkpe nii. Foobuo ni okpoo nwu yi, fabakyakako Yaa ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ dikudi kosoo mankye olekatakɔ nwu manwa ku basanku ku akasa ku kukyukyue ku bakyitaa, manle fɔ katũ mantɔɔfɛ nya, mantoobuɛ sɛlaa mantɔɔtɛ. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Nse SAATE nwu Ninwuna ntoobuo fɔ di suoto ku osie, fababuɛ sɛlaa fantɛ ku mma; babakyisa fɔ fambla otii bamba. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Nse atuosaa ya mmle ntɔɔwa kaanya, bla lɛsaa lele di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ lenyu alɛ diɔbla ni, diekye Yaa nsiko fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />“Le mi katũ faasoo fasifi Gilgal. Nwaako kamasoo nwa fɔ ɔkyɛ nimata ofiɛ asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta. Kafɔɔ dikpeni feesoko ayi akuɛnsĩ diɛlaase di obe wɔ lɛwa fɔ ni ɔkyɛ lɛbatɔkɔ fɔ ni lɛsaa le fababla nii.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Di Saul lamunikĩi alɛ oodiɛ Samuel ansifi nii, Yaa lakyɛlɛnsa nwɔ otu, ni di atuosaa ya mmle amuu lawa kaanya di dii nwu nkpo nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Obe wɔ baabuo ni Gibea, Yaa ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ dikudi nwu lakyakako nwɔ; Yaa Ninwuna labuo nwɔ di suoto ku osie, ni aakpɔtɔɔ di sɛlaa obuɛ ɔtɛ lɛma nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Obe wɔ di mba nin-ye nwɔ ni saa lanyɔɔ oobuɛ sɛlaa antɛ ni ku ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ nwu, baakaalɛ bawo alɛ, “Obe ninle nle nintɔɔwa ni di Kis obisuɔtɔbi nwu suoto? Saul kafɔɔ nsi di ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ kamɛ?”<verse eid="1SA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ onwii niakye ni nfa ladiki kanya alɛ, “Ni owe ninle ote lɛma?” Nioso diabakple ɔlaa dibuɛbi alɛ: “Saul kafɔɔ nsi di ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ kamɛ?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Di Saul ladiɛ ni sɛlaa obuɛ ɔtɛ ni sɛmaa, ni aasifi olekatakɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Ninfɛ di Saul ote bisɔnle lakaalɛ nwɔ ku kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nwu alɛ, “Ɔfɛ biekye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Ni di Saul ladiki kanya alɛ, “Babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo buɔlaawolaa. Kafɔɔ obe wɔ buanya bulɛ bulɔbanya ma nii, ni buasifi Samuel nfũ nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Ni di Saul ote obilɛma latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Tɔkɔ mi ɔlaa wɔ di Samuel latɔkɔ fɔ ni.”<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Saul ladiki kanya alɛ, “Aatɔkɔ wo aatikiti alɛ batɔɔnya babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo nwu.” Kafɔɔ atatɔkɔ ote bisɔnle ɔlaa wɔ di Samuel latɔkɔ nwɔ ni di sɛka ole suoto.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baadiki Saul Baatuo Fɛ Ɔka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Ni di Samuel lalɛɛ Israel batii di SAATE nwu nfũ di Mispa <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Ami niakpaa Israel ladieko di Egipte, ami kafɔɔ niadiki ye lakyeko Egipte osie nwu ku sɛka nlekɔ mmuu be niabla ye ni amumu kamɛ.’ <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Kafɔɔ kanunua bitoosĩ Yaa lee wɔ niafũ ye ni nkpa di dibuo ku amiina lee amuu kamɛ. Ni biebuɛ bilɛ, ‘Oowo, se ɔka fata wo.’ Nioso nunua biwa di SAATE nwu anu di ana ku nfaabi lee kanya.”<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Di Samuel lata Israel ana nwu amuu lakpukuti baatɛɛtɛɛ nii, Benyamin kɔna baadiki. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Ninfɛ di Samuel lata Benyamin kɔna lawa sitũ di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya, ni baadiki Matri kafaabi nɛ. Yɛntɛ, yɛntɛ Kis obisuɔtɔbi Saul baadiki. Kafɔɔ baawolaa nwɔ, batanyɔɔ. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Nioso baakple baase SAATE nwu ɔkaalɛ alɛ, “Osuɔtɔ nwu lɛwa nfũ fiɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Ni di SAATE nwu alɛ, “Yii, eewofasa suoto nɔɔ di atoo nwu kamɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Ni baatoso baalaadiki nwɔ baawako nɛ. Aabaayila ni di batii nwu kamɛ, aakaana diayɔ ni di amuusi nɔɔ aalenkee obiala lɛma. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Ni di Samuel latɔkɔ batii nwu bamuu alɛ, “Bitɔɔnya osuɔtɔ wɔ di SAATE nwu ntoodiki ni? Okle nɔɔ kuonwii nnaa di batii nwu bamuu kamɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Ninfɛ di batii nwu lataasiwidi baabuɛ alɛ, “Ɔka asiɛ nkpa aklɛ!”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Ni di Samuel ladiki sɛka ole afiofa kamɛ aata batii nwu nɛ. Aakpana nya di kukũ suoto aalaatɛ di SAATE nwu anu. Ninfɛ di Samuel ladiki batii nwu osuku, obiala lasifi leyo nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Saul kafɔɔ lasifi leyo nɔɔ di Gibea, basuɔtɔ ku sɛkambi ba situ di Yaa lakpanko ni latikanko nwɔ. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Kafɔɔ kudú bakpeetɛ labuɛ alɛ, “Lɛ di otii wɔ mmle kafuo wo odiki?” Baanyu nwɔ nyakatãa, batawako nwɔ lɛkyɛsaa kuniwii kafɔɔ. Kafɔɔ Saul lalo kanana.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Lalenkee Amon Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Ninfɛ di Amon otii Nahas lakata aakyɛ aalaamana Yabes Gilead aakyi nɛ. Ni di Yabes basuɔtɔ bamuu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Binii kanya ku awo, ni bubasiɛ ye kaalɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Kafɔɔ Nahas, Amon otii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Kamanii kanya ku aye di osuku wɔ mmle suoto alɛ kadiki obiala lee koletanɛɛ ninu, ninkpee Israel omuu sinunsɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Ni di Yabes banɔɔfo latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Ta wo ayi akuɛnsĩ buokpee batɔkyɛntɛ baakyi Israel omuu bafenko; nse kuonwii diɛwa abafũ wo yi, ni bubata disi.”<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Obe wɔ di batɔkyɛntɛ nwu lawa ni Gibea, nfũ di Saul nsi nii, baatɔkɔ ni batii nwu ɔlaa nwu yi, bamuu lɛma baawi kaku osie kanya. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Nfanwu Saul latooyie koofe, aatikanko banankyue nɔɔ, ni aakaalɛ alɛ, “Obe nikɔbla batii nwu? Be oso boowi kaku?” Ni baase kanya ka di Yabes basuɔtɔ nwu lababuɛ ni ɔtɔkɔ nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Di Saul lanu ni sɛlaa lɛma nwu, Yaa Ninwuna labuo nwɔ di suoto ku osie, ni di ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Ni aadiki banankyue banyɔ, aasasafɔ ma wɛkyɛwɛkyɛ, aayɔ kɔkyɛɛkɔkyɛɛ nwu aata batɔkyɛntɛ nwu baakyɛnko Israel omuu baatoobuɛ alɛ, “Nnya lɛsaa le bababla ni banankyue ba ninle ni otii lele ninantikanko ni Saul ku Samuel.” Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu difu lapɛ batii nwu, ni baadie fɛ otii onwii nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Obe wɔ di Saul lasiisa ma ni di Besek, Israel batii lɛpɔ labla nkpe alafa-atiɛ, Yuda batii kafɔɔ labla nkpe afosi-atiɛ.<verse eid="1SA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Ni baatɔkɔ batɔkyɛntɛ ba niawa ni alɛ, “Bitɔkɔ Yabes Gilead batii bilɛ, ‘Kɔsɛɛ obe wɔ kuufĩ ntoobe nii yi, babadiki ye.’ ” Di batɔkyɛntɛ nwu lakyɛ baalaabuɛ ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle baatɔkɔ ni Yabes batii, suoto layɔɔ ma. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Ni baatɔkɔ Amon batii alɛ, “Kɔsɛɛ bubayɔ suoto loo munkpee ye ninnɛɛ, mimbla wo kafɔɔ lɛsaa lele ninlɛ dita ye.”<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Kaleesɛ, Saul lasɛ batii nwu di akudi atiɛ nɛ; di kolesɛtũ baalaabuo Amon batii kasiɛkɔ, baaloloo ma dialaadu kakũ. Baasamiisa mba niabu baasiɛ ni nkpa kamɛ, alɛ batii banyɔ dilaasiɛ di lɛba ninwii.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Ninfɛ di batii latɔkɔ Samuel alɛ, “Bawe niakaalɛ alɛ, ‘Saul nimale sɛka di suoto loo?’ Bikpaa batii nwu biwako wo buolo ma.”<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Kafɔɔ Saul labuɛ alɛ, “Kuonwii dilɔbalo otii miɛ, diekye miɛ dii le mmle SAATE nwu ntoodiki Israel.”<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Ninfɛ di Samuel latɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ, “Biwa biɛta bukyɛ Gilgal buɔladiki sɛka nwu kayi ninfa.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Nioso batii nwu bamuu lakyɛ Gilgal, ni baalaadiki Saul kayi fɛ ɔka di SAATE nwu anu nɛ. Ni baata suoto lɛyɔɔ asaaɔta di SAATE nwu anu ninfa nɛ. Ni di Saul ku Israel batii bamuu lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ kplɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel Lakakatɛ Aata Batii Nwu Lɛyɛntɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Ninfɛ di Samuel latɔkɔ Israel omuu alɛ, “Ntoonu lɛsaa biala biatɔkɔ mi nii, ntoose ɔka kafɔɔ lɛta ye. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Kanunua nfɛ bikpe ɔka fɛ tunletɛ lee. Ami fɛ ami, ntoobe lɛkpasɔ, babisuɔtɔbi nii kafɔɔ nkpe ninfũ ku aye. Ntoole tunletɛ lee diayɔ ni di sekosopo nii diɛbase ni di dii le mmle. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Nnyɛɛ ninfũ. Bibuɛ bitika mi di suoto di SAATE nwu ku nnwɔ ɛɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ anu. Owe nankyue ntoodiyɔ? Owe bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo ntoodiyɔ? Owe ntooditafaa? Owe ntoodinyinka? Owe kɔnɛɛ ntoodifũ ditunu kamɛ lɛsaa, alɛ diatɛɛ lamaasa anu nii? Nse lɛbla n-ya mmle lewo, kamata ni koto.”<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Faatatafaa ee fanyinka wo, fatafũ lɛsalɛsaa kafɔɔ di kuonwii kɔnɛɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Ninfɛ di Samuel latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “SAATE nwu nle kamaayilatɛ di suoto lee, ku nnwɔ ɛɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ kafɔɔ nle kamaayilatɛ di dii le mmle, alɛ biɛnya lɛsaalɛsaa di kɔnɛɛ nii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Ni baatuna alɛ, “SAATE nwu ninle kamaayilatɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Ninfɛ di Samuel latɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ, “SAATE nwu niadiki Mose ku Aron, ni baakpaa bawa lee baadieko di Egipte kasɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Nunua, biyila ninfũ, diekye kamatɔkɔ ye di SAATE nwu anu ɔsaabla tinini omuu wɔ di SAATE nwu labla aata ye ni ku bawa lee.<verse eid="1SA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />“Di Yakob labuo ni Egipte sɛmaa, baawi baalɛɛ SAATE nwu alɛ akyakaako ma. Ni di SAATE nwu lakpee Mose ku Aron, baakpaa bawa lee baadieko di Egipte, ni baabasiɛsa ma di lɛba le mmle nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />“Kafɔɔ baayee SAATE, Yaa lɛma nwu; nioso aasunsũ ma aakpee di Hasor kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ Sisera nnɛɛ ku Filisti batii ku Moab ɔka nnɛɛ, ni baakpɛko ma nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Baawi baalɛɛ SAATE nwu baabuɛ alɛ, ‘Buɔbla okpile; buosĩ SAATE nwu, buɔkyɛ boosumu Baal ku Astarot. Kafɔɔ nunua diki wo di balo loo nnɛɛ, bubasumu fɔ.' <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lakpee Yeru-Baal ku Barak ku Yefta ku Samuel, ni aadiki ye di balo lee nnɛɛ di lɛkyɛ biala nɛ, di mmle biasiɛ ni di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.<verse eid="1SA 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />“Kafɔɔ obe wɔ bianya bilɛ Amon batii ɔka Nahas kɔtaka ni di suoto lee, biatɔkɔ mi bilɛ, ‘Oowo, buomiɛ ɔka wɔ nimale ni sɛka di suoto loo’- nu bia di SAATE Yaa nwu niale ɔka lee. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Nunua nnya ɔka nwu biediki ni, nnwɔ biɛkaalɛ nii; binyu, SAATE nwu ntoose ɔka ɛɛta ye. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Nse biɛyɛkɛ SAATE nwu biesumu nwɔ, bienu nwɔ ɔlaa, minaataka biyila di afiofa nɔɔ suoto, nse aye ku ɔka wɔ nikole ni sɛka di suoto lee, akyuu lee anyɔ bietikanko SAATE Yaa lee nwu yi- ni dilɛ! <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Kafɔɔ nse bienu SAATE nwu ɔlaa, biɛtaka bieyila di afiofa nɔɔ suoto, ni letoko nanfi nɔɔ kamawa di suoto lee, fɛ mmle diawa ni di bawa lee suoto.<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />“Nioso kanunua, biyila kloklo bienyu lɛsaa kplɛ le mmle di SAATE nwu kamabla ni di anu lee! <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Diele nunua ninle akpaa ofeebee nɛ? Kamalɛɛ SAATE nwu anta kanto-okpududuu ku kanto. Ni bibatofo lɛsaa kpile le biabla ni di SAATE nwu anu, di obe wɔ biakaalɛ bilɛ bata ye ni ɔka nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Ninfɛ di Samuel lalɛɛ SAATE nwu di dii nwu nkpo kale, SAATE nwu lata kanto-okpududuu ku kanto nɛ. Nioso batii nwu bamuu layɛkɛ SAATE nwu ku Samuel.<verse eid="1SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Ni di batii nwu bamuu latɔkɔ Samuel alɛ, “Pɛ ɔlaa fata SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu di bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ suoto, di mmle munamakpi ni. Diekye buɔbla sikpile buɔkyakaa di sikpile loo simuu bamba suoto alɛ buɔkaalɛ bulɛ bita wo ni ɔka.”<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Ninfɛ di Samuel latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bitanyɛkɛ, kuntɛ bitɔɔbla lɛsaa kpile le mmle nimuu yi, bitankyi di SAATE nwu kamaa. Kafɔɔ bisumu SAATE nwu ku otu lee omuu. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Bitankyi biatikanko afiɔ ya ninaa ni ɔnyɛɛ. Balaafuo ye dibiene kuninwii ɔbla ɔta, ee bafuo ye odiki, diekye banaa ɔnyɛɛ. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Ta leyooto kplɛ nɔɔ nwu oso yi, SAATE nwu dilɔbasĩ batii nɔɔ. Diekye diabuo SAATE nwu anu alɛ ɛɛbla ye bale nwɔ bamu. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Ami fɛ ami, dikyɛ lookyo alɛ kabla okpile di SAATE nwu suoto alɛ kasĩ nlɛ nɔɔpɛ ɔlaa nta ye. Kamatuo ye kafɔɔ osuku wɔ ninlɛ kuɔkyɛkyɛ ni kafɔɔ. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Kafɔɔ binyu nwaa bilɛ biɛyɛkɛ SAATE nwu, biesumu nwɔ kafɔɔ ku onukwale ku otu lee omuu. Binyuma asaa kplɛ ya atɔɔbla ɛɛta ye ni. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Kafɔɔ nse bienwini biɔbla sikpile yi, ni babafiɛ aye ku ɔka lee akyuu lee anyɔ mansifiko.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Batii Lakpɛko Filisti Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Saul lafũ alɛɛ afosi atiɛ fiɛ aabale ɔka, aale sɛka di Israel alɛɛ afosi-ana-anyɔ.<verse eid="1SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Ni di Saul ladiki basuɔtɔ nkpe ntiɛ aakyeko Israel; nkpe nnyɔ lawɛ di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di Mikmas ku Betel lekpenkpe kale nwu. Kakpe kanwii kafɔɔ ku Yonatan di Gibea di Benyamin kasɔ suoto. Aakplesa basuɔtɔ bule aasifiko ayo lɛma.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonatan lakpɛko Filisti batii kasikɔ nwu di Geba, ni di Filisti batii lanu nwu ole nɛ. Ninfɛ di Saul lata baafɛ dikukyoo baakyiko kasɔ nwu kamuu baabuɛ alɛ, “Bita Hebri batii banu!" <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Nioso Israel batii bamuu lanu ɔlaa nwu alɛ, “Saul kɔkpɛko Filisti batii kasikɔ, ni nunua Israel ntookple akpofoe bɛɛta Filisti batii.” Ni baalɛɛ batii nwu alɛ babakyakaa di Saul suoto di Gilgal nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Ni di Filisti batii lasi alɛ bɔɔkpɛ Israel ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni nkpe ntiɛ, bakeke bawantɛ nkpe nkuɔ ku bakpɛtɛ lɛpɔ fɛ lekpo kotoko ɔtɛnsia. Baakata baalaasiɛ di Mikmas, di Bet Awen kufĩ katunkɔ. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Obe wɔ di Israel batii lanya alɛ diɔwɛ ma ni osie, boomiina ni bakpɛtɛ lɛma osie kanya yi, baawofa di sifuɔntuu, abuu, afuɔ, abiɔ ku atubiɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Hebri batii bawo bia lawaalɛ Yordan baasifi Gad ku Gilead kasɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Saul laka di Gilgal, bakpɛtɛ ba bamuu ba kafɔɔ niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ latootũtũkũ ku lɛyɛkɛ. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Aasiɛ ayi akuɛnsĩ, di obe wɔ di Samuel latɛ nii; kafɔɔ Samuel ditawa Gilgal. Ni di Saul batii lakyako ɔsamii nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Nioso aabuɛ alɛ, “Biwakoe ofiɛ asaaɔta nwu ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta nwu.” Ni di Saul lata ofiɛ asaaɔta nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Aaloo oloo asaaɔta nwu ɔta, Samuel niamabuo, ni di Saul ladie aakyɛ aalaasɛɛsɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Ni di Samuel lakaalɛ alɛ, “Obe fatɔɔbla nɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Saul ladiki kanya alɛ, “Lanya nlɛ batii nwu nfɛ kɔsamii ni, di afɔ kafɔɔ faawa ni di obe wɔ fɛɛtɛ ni kamɛ, di Filisti batii kafɔɔ latoosi ni di Mikmas, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />lanyu nlɛ, ‘Nunua di Filisti batii kamasoo mamabuo mi di suoto di Gilgal, ninkaalɛ kafɔɔ SAATE nwu lɛkyakaako.’ Nioso layɔ latika di suoto nlɛ kɔta ofiɛ asaaɔta nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Ni di Samuel labuɛ alɛ, “Fɛɛbla dibuusaa, faale kufiofa ko di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lata fɔ nii. Nse fanle kufiofa nwu yi, nse atabatɛ sɛka kalekɔ lɛfɔ nwu di Israel suoto obe biala. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Kafɔɔ kanunua sɛka kalekɔ lɛfɔ dilɔbasinyila; SAATE nwu ntoomiɛ osuɔtɔ onwii di otu nɔɔ omu ntika nii. Atoodiki nwɔ tunletɛ ɛɛta batii nɔɔ, diekye faale SAATE nwu kufiofa.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Ninfɛ di Samuel ladie di Gilgal aakata aasifi Gibea di Benyamin kasɔ suoto nɛ. Ni di Saul laka basuɔtɔ ba niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ nɛ. Lɛpɔ lɛma labla fɛ alafa akuɔ.<verse eid="1SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Saul ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yonatan ku basuɔtɔ ba niawɛ ma ni di ɔkyɛ lasiɛ di Gibea di Benyamin kasɔ suoto. Filisti batii kafɔɔ lasi di Mikmas. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Ni di bakpɛtɛ akudi ladie di Filisti batii kasikɔ baasifi di akudi atiɛ kanya nɛ. Ninwii lakyɔɔ anu Ofra di Sual kasɔ suoto, <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />lɛbamba lakyɔɔ anu Bet Horon, ditiɛfa kafɔɔ lakyɔɔ anu kasɔ kɔmɛ ko mantɔɔnya ni di Seboim Ɔtaata wɔ niɛkyɔɔ ni ɔfaafuu anu.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Asaa-tukatɛ kuonwii ditawɛ di Israel kasɔ kamuu suoto. Diekye Filisti batii labuɛ alɛ, “Nse diele nkpo, Hebri batii nwu ntabatuka mpamii ee akplɔ!” <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Nioso Israel batii bamuu nsoo mankyɛ Filisti batii nfũ manaalɔɔfɔ anwa, nkyɔɔku, nnfɛ́ ku nsaka lɛma. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Manfũ bagram banɛ nse bɛɛlɔɔfɔ anwa ku nkyɔɔku, bagram bana kafɔɔ nse bɛɛlɔɔfɔ nsaka, nnfɛ́ ku akplɔ se beese nya dituka.<verse eid="1SA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Nioso di kakpɛ dii nwu suoto, bakpɛtɛ ba niawɛ ni ku Saul ku Yonatan ɔkyɛ kuonwii lɛma ditaklee kapamii ee lɛkplɔ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ. Saul ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yonatan lete niaklee nya.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Nioso Filisti batii bakpɛtɛ dikudi ninwii ladie baafe Mikmas osuku ɔla.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yonatan Disuɔtɔsaa Ɔbla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Dii ninwii Saul obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan latɔkɔ okosopo wɔ ninkle nwɔ ni akpɛsaa alɛ, “Wa buɔkyɛ Filisti batii kasikɔ di kakyɛ ka nyɔɔfa.” Kafɔɔ atatɔkɔ ote.<verse eid="1SA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Saul lasiɛ di Gibea kasukunya di blɔfɔ akotɔa kowoso kunwii kalɔ di Migron. Basuɔtɔ fɛ alafa-akuɔ lawɛ di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Ahiya lasiɛ ma kaamɛ aakpee simu akpeele. Ahiya ote niale Ikabod obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Ahitub obisuɔtɔbi, ote niale Pinehas wɔ di ote niale ni Eli wɔ niale ni SAATE nwu oletatɛ di Silo nɛ. Otii kuonwii ditatofo alɛ Yonatan ntoosifi.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Kɔwɛ lawɛ di osuku nkyɛ nwu nnyɔ be di Yonatan latɛ alɛ ɔɔwaalɛ anfe anaadu ni Filisti batii kasikɔ; kɔwɛ nwu kunwii leyooto niale Boses, kɔnyɔɔfa niale Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Kɔwɛ nwu kunwii lawɛ di katoo-kasɔ diofe ni Mikmas, kɔnyɔɔfa kafɔɔ lawɛ di kala-kasɔ diofe ni Geba.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonatan latɔkɔ okosopo akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Wa buɔkyɛ mba ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto kasikɔ. Loobia SAATE nwu kamadiki kɔkpaa anta wo. Lɛsalɛsaa dilɔbafuo SAATE nwu osuku di odiki loo suoto, kuntɛ batii kpinwu ee basɛɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Ni di akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Bla nle nimuu ninsi fɔ ni diisi kamɛ, bla ni; amii ntikanko fɔ ku otu ku ɔkla nii.”<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Ninfɛ di Yonatan labuɛ alɛ, “Ni wa; bubawaalɛ munfe batii nwu lɛkyɛ munta ma manya wo. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Nse bɛɛtɔkɔ wo alɛ, ‘Biyila ninfa dilaase di obe wɔ buɔwa ni ɔkyɛ lee,’ bubasiɛ di lɛba le bukpe ni, ni bulɔbakata bukyɛ ɔkyɛ lɛma. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Kafɔɔ nse beebuɛ alɛ, ‘Bikata biwa ɔkyɛ loo,’ni bubakata munkyɛ, diekye nni nimale wo dituosaa alɛ SAATE nwu ntɔɔyɔ ma eekpee wo ninnɛɛ nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Nioso banyɔ lɛma nwu ladiki suoto lɛma baatuo di Filisti batii kasikɔ nwu. Ni di Filisti batii nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Binyu! Hebri batii nwu kɔkpɔkɔ mandie di atuɛ ya kamɛ baawofa nii.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Ninfɛ di kasikɔ nwu batii lafaa baatɔkɔ Yonatan ku akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Bikata biwa ɔkyɛ loo, bubatuo ye lɛsaa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Nioso Yonatan latɔkɔ akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Kata fatikankoe; SAATE nwu ntɔɔyɔ ma eekpee di Israel nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Yonatan layɔ nnɛɛ ku nkpaa nɔɔ aakata aasifi, akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ latikanko nwɔ sɛmaa. Filisti batii lanɔɔnɔɔ di Yonatan katũ, ni di akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ latikanko nwɔ sɛɛmaa aatoolo ma nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Di kakpɛ nwu kasale kamɛ, Yonatan ku akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ lalo batii afosi-anyɔ bawo, di obo wɔ niate ni fɛle ekũ ɛnɔɔ okle.<verse eid="1SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Lalenkee Filisti Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Ninfɛ di difu lapɛ bakpɛtɛ bamuu-mba di kasikɔ nwu ku afe, ku mba di nsikɔ nwu ku sikuma bataatɛ akudi- ku kasɔ nwu latũkũ nɛ. Diale difu le di Yaa lakyesee nii.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Ni di Saul asaa banyuntɛ di Gibea di Benyamin kasɔ suoto lanya Filisti bakpɛtɛ kototoso manfe di sisuku simuu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Ninfɛ di Saul latɔkɔ batii ba niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Bika bakpɛtɛ nwu bienyu bawe niedie wo kaamɛ.” Baaka ni nkpo, Yonatan ku akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ nintawɛ.<verse eid="1SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Ni di Saul latɔkɔ Ahigya alɛ, “Yɔ Yaa lɛlakaa nwu fawako.” (Di obe nwu kamɛ diawɛ di Israel batii ɔkyɛ.) <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Di Saul latɔɔkakatɛko ni oletatɛ nwu yi, kudu kanya latɔɔtaka katoo osie kanya di Filisti batii kasikɔ nwu kamɛ. Nioso Saul latɔkɔ oletatɛ nwu alɛ, “Kplesa kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Ninfɛ di Saul ku batii nɔɔ bamuu lasi, ni baasifi kakpɛ nɛ. Baanya alɛ Filisti batii latɛ baakpɔkpɔtɔ, baatɔɔsasafɔ bawo ku mpamii lɛma. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Hebri batii ba niakata baasifi baalaawɛ ni ku Filisti batii ɔkyɛ di nsikɔ lɛma saa, lasifi Israel batii ba niawɛ ni di Saul ku Yonatan ɔkyɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Obe wɔ di Israel batii ba niawofa ni di Efraim kale lekpenkpe lanu alɛ Filisti batii kotoso nii, baalaakyakaa di Israel batii suoto baatikanko ma osie kanya. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Nioso SAATE nwu ladiki Israel di dii nwu nkpo, ni baakpɛ kakpɛ nwu baawaalɛ Bet Awen nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛsaabla Di Kakpɛ Nwu Sɛmaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Dii nwu nkpo, Israel batii lasiɛ di nimiina kamɛ. Diekye Saul layɔ batii nwu aakpee di ntam kalɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “Lɛkpaani kamatikanko otii lele niele alesaa fiɛ di kɔtɔɔfɔ lewo, fiɛ di ami omu lɛbla balo nii lekyisa!” Nioso bakpɛtɛ nwu kuonwii ditatu alesaa.<verse eid="1SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Ninfɛ di Israel bakpɛtɛ nwu bamuu labuo di lepoo ninwii kamɛ, ni baanya bablɔ nte kaasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Obe wɔ baakyɛ ni di lepoo nwu kamɛ, baanya alɛ bablɔ kodie, kafɔɔ kuonwii ditakpanko aakpee di kanya nɔɔ. Diekye baatɔɔyɛkɛ ntam nwu. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Kafɔɔ Yonatan ditanu alɛ ote layɔ ntam aanii batii nwu, nioso aayɔ ɔkyɛnwoso nɔɔ nwu aakpee di bablɔ kaflɛ kamɛ. Ni aatakatɛ kɔnɔɔ nɔɔ aakpee kaanya, ni di anu nɔɔ lakpa nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Ninfɛ di kpɛtɛ onwii latɔkɔ Yonatan alɛ, “Teefɔ lɛyɔ ntam eenii bakpɛtɛ nwu osie kanya aabuɛ alɛ, ‘Lɛkpaani kamatikanko otii lele niele alesaa miɛ!’ Nkpo oso di batii ntookpiɛkpiɛ nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Ni di Yonatan labuɛ alɛ, “Teemi ntɔɔta dibuo di kale nwu suoto. Nyu mmle di anu nii lɛkpa ni, di obe wɔ letu ni bablɔ ba mmle kafuii. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Nyu mmle ditabalɛ ninta ni batii nwu miɛ, nse fɛ manle asaa ya beefũ ni di balo lɛma nwu nfũ. Nse Filisti batii ba buolo di dilɔbapɔ bia balenkee?”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Dii nwu nkpo, di Israel batii lalo ni Filisti batii, diayɔ ni di Mikmas dialaadu ni Ayalon, diabuo Israel batii nwu. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Ni di bakpɛtɛ nwu latu baabuo di Filisti batii asaa suoto, baasasafɔ bafoso, banankyue ku anankyuebi, baawee ma baakpɔtɔɔsa ku ntɔ. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Ninfɛ di otii onwii latɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Nyu lo, batii nwu kɔbla okpile di SAATE nwu suoto ku sina se di ntɔ nsi ni owee.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Bitɔɔlalaasa ofũ-onu nwu, bimunusa difuɔ kplɛ bitɛ ninfũ wla.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Ninfɛ di Saul latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bitɔɔkyɛ batii nwu kamɛ biɛlaatɔkɔ ma bilɛ, ‘Obiala lee biyɔ banankyue ku bafoso lee biwakoe, biɛbalo ma ninfũ biwee. Bitambla okpile di SAATE nwu suoto alɛ biawee sina se di ntɔ lekple disi sĩ ni kaamɛ.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:34">Nioso otii biala layɔ nankyue nɔɔ aawako ku kakyɛ nwu aabalo ninfa. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Ninfɛ di Saul lapɛ oleɔta akyikye aata SAATE nwu; nni niale lɛkasale aabla ni nkpo nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Ni di Saul labuɛ alɛ, “Bita busoo buotikanko Filisti batii nwu ku kakyɛ ka mmle, buɔyɔ ma asaa dilaase koolesɛtũ. Bitanta buadiɛ kuonwii lɛma kafɔɔ asiɛ nkpa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Ni di batii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bla lɛsaa le feenyu falɛ dilɛ dita fɔ ni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Kafɔɔ oletatɛ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Bita buwolaa kamɛ di Yaa nfũ ninfũ.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Nioso Saul lakaalɛ Yaa alɛ, “Nsoo nkyɛ ninaakpɛko Filisti batii? Fabayɔ ma fankpee di Israel batii nnɛɛ?” Kafɔɔ dii nwu nkpo Yaa ditatuna aatɔɔ.<verse eid="1SA 14:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Nioso Saul labuɛ alɛ, “Biwa ninfũ, aye ba bamuu ninle ni bakpɛtɛ batunletɛ, biɛta buwolaa okpile wɔ buɔbla ni miɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Nwaako, di SAATE wɔ nindiki ni Israel lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, bia kuntɛ obisuɔtɔbi nii Yonatan nfũ diekye, dikpeni eekpi.” Kafɔɔ otii kuonwii ditabɛ kanya.<verse eid="1SA 14:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Saul nfɛ latɔkɔ Israel bakpɛtɛ batunletɛ nwu bamuu alɛ. “Aye biyila ninfa; ami ku obisuɔtɔbi nii Yonatan bubayila ninfũ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Ni di bakpɛtɛ batunletɛ nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bla lɛsaa le feenyu falɛ diɛtɛ dilɛ dita fɔ ni.”<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Ninfɛ di Saul lapɛ ɔlaa aata SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu alɛ, “Diki kanya biene fatɛɛ.” Ni di atrebi owii nwu latika di Yonatan ku Saul suoto nɛ, batii nwu ladie kaamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Ninfɛ di Saul labuɛ alɛ, “Biwii atrebi di ami ku obisuɔtɔbi nii Yonatan ntɛɛ.” Ni diatika di Yonatan suoto nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Ninfɛ di Saul latɔkɔ Yonatan alɛ, “Tɔkɔ mi lɛsaa le fɛɛbla ni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Nioso Yonatan latɔkɔ ote alɛ, “Otù ko latu bablɔ kɛɛkɛɛ ku ɔkyɛnwoso nii ɔnya. Ni nunua, dikpeni lekpi?”<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Ni di Saul labuɛ alɛ, “Yaa ananfi mi kootoko, bia ditɛ diwɛ osie, Yonatan, nse faakpi.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Kafɔɔ bakpɛtɛ batunletɛ nwu latɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Yonatan akpi- di nnwɔɔ nintɔɔwako ni didiki kplɛ le mmle di Israel? Diidii! Nwaako, di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, onwini nɔɔ kuonwii dilɔbakpa kupɛ kaasɔ. Diekye ɛɛbla nle mmle miɛ ku Yaa lɛkyakaako.” Nioso batii nwu ladiki Yonatan, batansinlo nwɔ.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Ninfɛ di Saul ladiɛ Filisti batii nwu otikanko, ni baakple baasifi kasɔ lɛma kamu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul Sɛka Ole Ku Leyo Nɔɔ Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Di Saul labale ni sɛka di Israel suoto kamaa, aakpɛko balo lɛma di ɔfankyi biala: Moab batii, Amon batii, Edom batii, Soba baka ku Filisti batii. Kakɔlele aamunikĩi, aata ma letoko nanfi. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Aakpɛ osie kanya aalenkee Amalek batii, aadiki Israel aakyeko mba niafũ ni asaa lɛma nnɛɛ.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Saul babisuɔtɔbi niale Yonatan, Isui ku Malki-Sua. Obisankobi nɔɔfole leyooto niale Merab, obisɔnle niale Mikal. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Saul ɔsɔfɔ leyooto niale Ahinoam, Ahimaas obisankobi aale. Saul bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ niale Abner, Saul ote obilɛma Ner obisuɔtɔbi aale. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Saul ote Kis ku Abner ote Ner lale Abiel babisuɔtɔbi.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Saul ayi amuu lale kakpɛ siene ku Filisti batii, nioso nse Saul lɛnya osuɔtɔ kyokyodikyo ee nnwɔ ninkpe ni sɛkambi, ankpaa nwɔ ankpee di bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Kakpɛ Ku Amalek Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Ninfɛ di Samuel latɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Ami ninle nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lakpee laba pɛ fɔ ni ɔfɔɔ fɛ ɔka di Israel batii nɔɔ suoto; nioso kanunua nu kanya ka niekye ni SAATE nwu nfũ. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Kamananfi Amalek batii kootoko ta lɛsaa le baabla ni Israel batii, baadieko ma ni di osuku, di obe wɔ baadie ni di Egipte. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Kanunua tɔɔkyɛ faalaakpɛko Amalek batii, faawɔɔsa lɛsaa biala ninle ma ni lele fɛɛ. Tandiɛ ma; lo basuɔtɔ ku basanko, babisɔ ku babifɔɔle, banankyue ku bafoso, kapubapɔnkɔ ku babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Nioso Saul lalɛɛ batii nwu, ni aaka ma di Telaim-bakpɛtɛ ba ninkyɛ ni ninkpaa labla nkpe alafa anyɔ ku bakpɛtɛ nkpe lefosi niakye ni Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Ni di Saul lakyɛ Amalek okpoo kplɛ aalaate kala di kɔwɛ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Ninfɛ di Saul latɔkɔ Ken batii alɛ, “Bidie biediɛ Amalek batii ta mmle ninamawɔɔsa ye nkpɔtɔɔsa ni ku mma. Diekye biale Israel batii bamuu sifutulɛ di obe wɔ baadie ni di Egipte.” Nioso Ken batii ladie di Amalek batii suoto.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Ninfɛ di Saul lakpɛko Amalek batii diayɔ ni di Hawila dialaadu Sur di Egipte kufĩ katunkɔ. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Aamufũ Amalek ɔka Agag ku nkpa, ni aawɔɔsa batii nɔɔ bamuu fɛɛ ku kapamii nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Kafɔɔ Saul ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ ladiɛ Agag ku bafoso ku banankyue nwaa, anankyuebi ku afosobi ya niasiɛ ni lɛla-lɛsaa biala nialɛ onyu. N-ya mmle nya batatɛ alɛ bɔɔwɔɔsa nya fɛɛ. Kafɔɔ baawɔɔsa lɛsaa biala nitalɛ ni onyu ku n-ya nintawɛ ni osie amuu.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lasĩ Saul Fɛ Ɔka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa di Samuel ɔkyɛ alɛ: <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Diebuo mi suoto alɛ lɛbla Saul ɔka, diekye atookyi mi kamaa, aale kafɔɔ afiofa nii.” Ni di Samuel labuo nyaami, ni aapɛ ɔlaa aata SAATE nwu ku kakyɛ nwu kamuu nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Kolesɛtũ Samuel lataka aakyɛ Saul ɔkyɛ, kafɔɔ baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Saul lefe Karmel. Nfa eetofo ninyumasaa ɛɛta suoto nɔɔ dibu nɛ, kafɔɔ atookple eesoo eefe eesifi Gilgal.”<verse eid="1SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Obe wɔ di Samuel ladu ni Saul nfũ, Saul latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, <char style="nd">“Saate</char> nwu awii fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ! Ntɔɔbla di SAATE nwu kufiofa kanya.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Kafɔɔ Samuel lakaalɛ alɛ, “Obe nfɛ ninle bafoso ba mmle diwi di atoko nii kamɛ nkpo? Obe ninle banankyue ba mmle diwi konu ni nkpo?”<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Ni di Saul ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bakpɛtɛ niakyeko ma Amalek batii nfũ baawako. Baadiɛ bafoso ku banankyue biene alɛ babayɔ manta SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ ole. Kafɔɔ buawɔɔsa babule fɛɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Ninfɛ di Samuel latɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Yila! Tɛɛ ntɔkɔ fɔ ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi ni kakyɛ ka mmle.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Ni di Saul alɛ, “Tɔkɔ mi.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Ninfɛ di Samuel lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Kuntɛ faate biibii di afɔ omu anu, fadibakple disi fata ana nwu di Israel? SAATE nwu lase fɔ ɔka di Israel suoto. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Ni aakpee fɔ osuku aabuɛ alɛ, ‘Kyɛ faalaawɔɔsa amumu batii nwu fɛɛ, Amalek batii nwu; kpɛko ma diɛlaase di obe wɔ feelo ma ni bamuu.’  <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Be oso fanaanu SAATE nwu ɔlaa? Be oso fɛɛlɛ asaa nwu, fɛɛbla okpile di SAATE nwu anu?<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Ninfɛ di Saul labuɛ alɛ, “Kafɔɔ lakyɔɔ SAATE nwu ɔlaa kotoko. Lakyɛ osuku wɔ di SAATE nwu lakpee mi nii. Lawɔɔsa Amalek batii nwu, ni lakpaa ɔka lɛma Agag lawako nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Bakpɛtɛ nwu niayɔ kakpɛ kamɛ bafoso ku banankyue ku asaa nwaa ya beediki bɛɛta ni Yaa, alɛ bɔɔyɔ nya manta oleɔta manta ni SAATE nwu di Gilgal.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Kafɔɔ Samuel ladiki kanya alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">“SAATE nwu nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ di ofiɛ asaaɔta ku oleɔta suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">ninlenkee mmle baakyɔɔ ni SAATE nwu sɛlɔ kotoko?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">Kotoko ɔkyɔɔ nlɛ dilenke oleɔta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">ɔlaa onu kafɔɔ nlɛ dilenke akunumuu lɛla.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Diekye ɔtaka oyila di otii suoto nte fɛle sɛbɔ ɔpɛ okpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">suoto katoo ɔtakatɛsa kafɔɔ nte fɛle afiɔ ɔtɔ okpile.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">Ta feesĩ ni SAATE nwu ɔlaa oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">atoosĩ fɔ fɛ ɔka.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Ninfɛ di Saul latɔkɔ Samuel alɛ, “Lɛbla okpile. Lɛwaalɛ SAATE nwu kufiofa ku sɛlɔ lɛfɔ ɔtannu. Latɔɔyɛkɛ batii nwu oso latuna lata ma nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Nunua lekoto kotikiti fɔ, yɔ sikpile nii fakyɛ mi, faakple fawa buɔkyɛ ku ami, alɛ kalaasumu SAATE nwu.”<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Kafɔɔ Samuel latɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Namakple nkyɛ ku afɔ. Fatoosĩ SAATE nwu ɔlaa, SAATE nwu kafɔɔ ntoosĩ fɔ fɛ ɔka di Israel batii suoto!”<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Di Samuel lamunikĩi alɛ oosifi nii, Saul lamumfũ Samuel awukyɔ nwu kotokosi, ni aabɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Ninfɛ di Samuel latɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “SAATE nwu ntɔɔbɛ Israel sɛka kalekɔ nwu di suoto lɛfɔ miɛ. Atɔɔyɔ ka kafɔɔ ɛɛta owo lɛfɔ onwii-nnwɔ ninlɛ alenke fɔ nii. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Nnwɔ ninle ni Israel Lɛkpa ninlaa ee akyɛlɛnsa disibu nɔɔ; diekye aale otii, alɛ aakyɛlɛnsa disibu nɔɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Ni di Saul ladiki kanya alɛ, “Lɛbla okpile. Kafɔɔ lɛkoto tɛɛ dibu di batii nii banɔɔfo ku Israel anu; kple fawa buɔkyɛ ku ami alɛ kalaasumu SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ nwu.” <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Nioso Samuel lakple aasifi ku Saul, ni di Saul lasumu SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Ninfɛ di Samuel labuɛ alɛ, “Bikpaa Amalek batii ɔka Agag biwakoe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:32">Ni di Agag lawa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ, aatoonyu alɛ, “Nwaako kukpi dibuo nwu ntoofe.”<verse eid="1SA 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Kafɔɔ Samuel labuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:33">“Fɛ mmle di kapamii lɛfɔ lɛta basanko ditawɛ ni babi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:33">nkpo di yaafɔ dilɔbawɛ obi di basanko kamɛ nɛ.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1SA 15:33">Ninfɛ di Samuel lalo Agag di SAATE nwu anu di Gilgal nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Ninfɛ di Samuel ladie aasifi Rama, kafɔɔ Saul lasifi leyo nɔɔ di Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Diɛlaase ni di dii le di Samuel lakpi nii, atasinkyɛ aalaanya Saul fiɛ aakpi, nu di Samuel lawi aatɔɔ. Ni diabuo SAATE nwu suoto alɛ aabla Saul ɔka di Israel suoto nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Baapɛ Dawid Ɔfɔɔ Fɛ Ɔka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lakaalɛ Samuel alɛ, “Omɛmbe fabawi Saul fanaase, di ami ntoosĩ nwɔ ni fɛ ɔka di Israel suoto? Kpete ɔfɔɔ di bɔkɛɛ lɛkya lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ, faayefe osuku; kokpee fɔ Yese nfũ di Betlehem. Ntoodiki obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ onwii nlɛ ale ɔka.”<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Kafɔɔ Samuel labuɛ alɛ, “Lɛ kamafuo ɔkyɛ? Saul kamanu nwu ole, anlo mi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kpaa nankyue dibi-sanko le ninadilofo ni faklee faalaabuɛ falɛ, ‘Lɛwa oleɔta ɔta SAATE nwu.’ <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Lɛɛ Yese aawa oleɔta katakɔ nwu. Kamatuo fɔ lɛsaa le faabla nii. Faapɛ nnwɔ letuo ni ɔfɔɔ fatɛɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samuel labla fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ nii. Aabuo ni Betlehem, okpoo banɔɔfo latũtũkũ di obe wɔ baakyakako nwu nii. Ni baakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Fɛɛwa di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ?”<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Ni di Samuel latuna alɛ, “Yii, di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ lɛwa; Lɛwa oleɔta ɔta SAATE nwu. Bikleklesa suoto lee, biɛwa oleɔta katakɔ nwu ku ami.” Ninfɛ aakleklesa Yese ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ suoto, ni aalɛɛ ma aawako oleɔta katakɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Obe wɔ baababuo nii, Samuel lanya Eliab ni aanyu alɛ, “Nwaako, nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ nin-yɛ ninfũ di SAATE nwu anu nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Samuel alɛ, “Tannyu letembi nɔɔ ee lɛkaana nɔɔ, diekye lesĩ nwɔ. SAATE nwu ninnyu asaa fɛ mmle di batii nnyu nii. Otii nnyu di suoto letembi, kafɔɔ SAATE nwu nnwɔɔ, otu kamɛ aannyu.”<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Ninfɛ di Yese lalɛɛ Abinadab, aatɔɔ abafe di Samuel anu nɛ. Kafɔɔ Samuel labuɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu diediki nnwɔ mmle kafɔɔ.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Ni di Yese lata Sama labafe, kafɔɔ Samuel labuɛ alɛ, “Nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ SAATE nwu diediki nwɔ.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yese lata babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ bakuɛnsĩ labafe di Samuel anu, kafɔɔ Samuel latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “SAATE nwu diediki mba mmle.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Nkpo oso aakaalɛ Yese alɛ, “Mba mmle ninle babisuɔtɔbi ba bamuu ninkpe fɔ ni nɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Ni di Yese labuɛ alɛ, “Diekple diebu obisɔnle, kafɔɔ ɔɔkpa bafoso.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Ninfɛ di Samuel labuɛ alɛ, “Kpee baalaalɛɛ nwɔ bawako; bulɔbasiɛ kaasɔ diɛlaase di obe wɔ ɛɛwa nii.”<verse eid="1SA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Nioso Yese lakpee baalaakpaa nwɔ baawako. Aale otii sɛɛle, suoto nɔɔ lalɛ otoonyu, aalɛ kafɔɔ sekosopo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:12">Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Samuel alɛ, “Taka faapɛ nwɔ ɔfɔɔ; nnwɔɔ ninle nnwɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Nioso Samuel layɔ ɔfɔɔ lɛkya nwu, ni aapɛ nwɔ ɔfɔɔ di babilɛma suɔtɔbi anu nɛ, diayɔ ni di dii nwu kamaa SAATE nwu Ninwuna labuo di Dawid suoto di osie kamɛ. Ninfɛ di Samuel lakple aasifi Rama nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lasifi Saul Leyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu Ninwuna ladie di Saul suoto, ni di ninwuna kpile ninwii niakye ni SAATE nwu nfũ lakpɛko nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Ni di Saul bakpɛmblatɛ latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nyu lo, ninwuna kpile ninwii niekye ni Yaa nfũ kɔkpɛko fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Bita saate loo adiki bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ kanya ninfũ baalaamiɛ otii wɔ nin-ye ni kyitaa ɔpɛ. Nse ninwuna kpile le niekye ni Yaa nfũ lɛwa di suoto lɛfɔ yi, abapɛ kyitaa nwu, nse ditɔyɔɔ fɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Nioso Saul latɔkɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Bimiɛ otii wɔ nin-ye ni kyitaa ɔpɛ nwaa biɛkpaa nwɔ biwakoe.”<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Ni di bakpɛmblatɛ nwu onwii labuɛ alɛ, “Ntɔɔnya Yese wɔ di Betlehem obisuɔtɔbi onwii nin-ye ni kyitaa ɔpɛ. Ale osuɔtɔ wɔ ninkpe ni sɛkambi, ale kafɔɔ kpɛtɛ. Aye lɛkakatɛ nwaa, alɛ sekosopo kafɔɔ. SAATE nwu kafɔɔ nsiko nwɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Ninfɛ di Saul lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ Yese nfũ alɛ, “Ta obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ Dawid wɔ nikonyu ni bafoso awa ɔkyɛ nii.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Nioso Yese layɔ bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo, aatukasɔɔ alesaa, nta dikuuku ku tie kabitɛ aayɔ nya ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Dawid aakyesee Saul.<verse eid="1SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Ni di Dawid lawa Saul ɔkyɛ, ni aakyako nwɔ osumu nɛ. Saul labɔmbɔ nwɔ osie kanya, nioso Dawid labakple akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ onwii lɛma. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Ninfɛ di Saul lata Yese kanya aabuɛ alɛ, “Ta Dawid osuku aasiɛ atoosumu mi, diekye oobuo mi anu.”<verse eid="1SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Obe lele di ninwuna le niekye ni Yaa nfũ lɛwa di Saul suoto yi, Dawid n-yɔ kyitaa nɔɔ ampɛ. Nse ditoobudi Saul; ninkpa nwɔ, ninwuna kpile nwu kafɔɔ ndie nwɔ kaamɛ.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Goliat Lakpɛko Israel Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Ninfɛ di Filisti batii lasiisa bakpɛtɛ lɛma baata kakpɛ nɛ, baasi di Soko di Yuda kasɔ suoto. Baatɛ kasikɔ lɛma di Efes Damim, di Soko ku Aseka obo. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Saul ku Israel batii kafɔɔ lasi baabla kasikɔ di Ela Ɔtaata, ni baatɛ lebo lɛma alɛ manko Filisti batii babakpɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Filisti batii layila di lekpenkpe ninwii, Israel batii kafɔɔ layila di lɛbamba di ɔtaata late ma ni di obo.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Ni di osuɔtɔ kyokyodikyo onwii bɔɔlɛɛ ni Goliat, aakye ni Gat ladie di Filisti batii kasikɔ aawa nɛ. Lɛkaana nɔɔ lalenkee nkpaa nnaasĩ. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Aatũkũ abɔɔsaa lekoto di disi nɔɔ, aakpee ntɛɛ kubidifunsaa, di onutũ ninya lawo ni bakilo afosi-anɔɔ bakuɛnsĩ; <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />aakpee sekonto abɔɔsaa, aatika abɔɔsaa ɔkyɔɛ di nimuusi nɔɔ. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Lɛkplɔ nɔɔ kakleekɔ late fɛle abula losotɛ kawesee, lɛbɔɔsaa nini kanya onutũ lawo bakilo bakuɛnsĩ. Kubidifunsaa kleetɛ nɔɔ lale nwɔ katũ.<verse eid="1SA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliat layila aafaa aalɛɛ Israel bakpɛtɛ alɛ, “Be oso biedie biɛwa kakpɛ? Diele Filisti otii nle, aye kafɔɔ diele Saul bakpɛmblatɛ bile? Bidiki osuɔtɔ onwii, biɛtɔɔ asoo awa ɔkyɛ nii. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Nse eefuo ɔkpɛ eelo mi, bubasiɛ kaalɔ lee. Kafɔɔ nse ami nielenkee nwɔ, lelo nwɔ, bibasiɛ kaalɔ loo minsumu wo.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Ninfɛ di Filisti otii nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Miɛ dii le mmle lebiɛ Israel bakpɛtɛ nɔɔfo nyilakɔ nwu! Bitɛɛ osuɔtɔ onwii, aata bukpɛko bawo.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Di Saul ku Israel batii bamuu lanu ni Filisti otii nwu sɛlaa se mmle yi, nnɛɛ lafee ma, baayɛkɛ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lakyɛ Saul Kasikɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Dawid lale Efrate otii wɔ baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Yese obisuɔtɔbi, nnwɔ niakye ni Betlehem di Yuda kasɔ suoto. Yese lawɛ babisuɔtɔbi banɛ. Di Saul obe nwu kamɛ, Yese ntoobe, ɛɛkyɛ sitũ di alɛɛ kamɛ nwaa. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Yese babisuɔtɔbi batiɛ nɔɔfole latikanko Saul baakyɛ kakpɛ: Obisuɔtɔbi kasale niale Eliab; ɔnyɔɔfa, Abinadab; otiɛfa kafɔɔ niale Sama. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Dawid niale obisɔnle. Banɔɔfole batiɛ nwu latikanko Saul, <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />kafɔɔ Dawid ndie di Saul nfũ ankyɛ, antookple anaatɔɔkpa ote bafoso di Betlehem.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Di ayi afosi-ana amu, Filisti otii nwu ndie amayila di kayilakɔ nɔɔ olesɛ ku kɔtɔɔfɔ biala.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Ninfɛ di Yese latɔkɔ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Dawid alɛ, “Yɔ atitabi sɛnle bakilo lefosi ku bloblo akudi lefosi ya mmle faapɛsɛwa fayɔ fakyɛnko babilee suɔtɔbi di kasikɔ lɛma. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Yɔ nankyue nnyɛɛtu niile oboo lefosi ya mmle fakyɛnko dikudi lɛma kanyayilatɛ, faanyu mmle di babilee nte ni, faafũ kanya biene kawo di ɔkyɛ lɛma fawako. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Bakpe di Saul ku Israel batii bamuu ɔkyɛ di Ela Ɔtaata bɔɔkpɛko Filisti batii.”<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Di kolesɛtũ, Dawid ladiɛ bafoso nwu di bafosokpatɛ onwii nnɛɛ, aakpee atoo, aayefe osuku fɛ mmle di Yese labuɛ ni kanya. Aalaadu kasikɔ nwu di obe wɔ di bakpɛtɛ nwu latoodie baatoofe ni kakpɛkɔ, baatooyiisa ni kakpɛ kudu. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Israel ku Filisti batii latɔɔkya sele lɛma baatɔɔkyɔɔ bawo anu. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Ni di Dawid ladiɛ asaa nɔɔ nwu di nnwɔ ninnyu ni kakpɛ asaa ɔkyɛ nɛ, aatoso aasifi kakpɛkɔ nwu aalaasɛɛsa babilɛma. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Di Dawid latɔɔkakatɛko ni babilɛma, Goliat, ninle ni Filisti batii sientɛ nwu niakye ni Gat niadie di ole nɔɔ, aafaa aabuɛ afunaa nɔɔ nwu, ni di Dawid lanu sĩ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Obe wɔ di Israel batii lanya ni osuɔtɔ nwu, lɛyɛkɛ kplɛ lapɛ bamuu lɛma baatoso.<verse eid="1SA 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Israel batii ntoobuɛ alɛ, “Biɔnya mmle di osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle ndie antɔɔwa ni ɔwa? Andie anwa alɛ ɔɔbakpee Israel sinunsɔ. Ɔka kamata otii wɔ nimalo nwɔ ni lɛsaawɛ kplɛ. Abayɔ kafɔɔ obisankobi nɔɔ antɔɔ an-yɔ. Babadiki ote leyo kamɛ batii kafɔɔ di akpooto ɔta kamɛ di Israel.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Ni di Dawid lakaalɛ basuɔtɔ ba niayila baakaako nwɔ ni alɛ, “Obe bababla manta osuɔtɔ wɔ nimalo ni Filisti otii wɔ mmle, antekete ni sinunsɔ se mmle di Israel suoto? Owe ninle Filisti otii wɔ mmle ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto, alɛ aakpee Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni nkpa bakpɛtɛ sinunsɔ?”<verse eid="1SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Ni baakple baase ɔlaa wɔ mantoobuɛ ni ɔtɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Nnya lɛsaa le bababla manta ni osuɔtɔ wɔ nimalo nwɔ ni.”<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Obe wɔ di Dawid obilɛma nɔɔfole Eliab, lanu nwɔ ɔɔkakatɛko ni basuɔtɔ nwu yi, ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwu di suoto nɔɔ, ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Be oso feesoo fɛɛwa nfũ? Owe kafɔɔ nfũ feediɛ bafoso basɛ́ɛ nwu di ɔfaafuu? N-ye mmle fankanta ni ku mmle fakpe ni amumu di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ; nni oso feesoo fɛɛwa falɛ fɔɔbanyu kakpɛ nwu nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Ninfɛ di Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Obe lɛsaa lɛbla kanunua? Naafuo ɔkakatɛ kafɔɔ?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Ni aamunikĩi aasifi otii bamba ɔkyɛ, ni aakple aawako ɔlaa nwu onwii nwu, ni di basuɔtɔ nwu ladiki kanya fɛ mmle baatɔkɔ nwɔ ni nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Baanu sɛlaa se di Dawid labuɛ nii, ni baalaatɔkɔ Saul, ni di Saul lakpee baalaalɛɛ nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Bitanta kuonwii otu lakpa ta Filisti otii wɔ mmle oso; kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamakyɛ annaakpɛko nwɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Ninfɛ di Saul ladiki kanya alɛ, “Flɔbafuo odie ɔkyɛ ɔɔlaakpɛko Filisti otii wɔ mmle; okosopo ko fale, kafɔɔ nnwɔɔ ɔɔkpɛ kakpɛ diayɔ ni di sibisɔ nɔɔ obe.”<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Kafɔɔ Dawid latɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ntɔɔkpa ote bafoso. Nse kyata ee okiti lɛbamufũ foso di bafoso kamɛ yi, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />ntikanko nwɔ nnaapɛ nwɔ, nklee foso nwu ndiki di kanya nɔɔ. Nse eemunikĩi eebuo mi di suoto, mmufũ nwɔ sinwini, mpɛ nwɔ ntɛ kaasɔ nlo nwɔ. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ntoolo kyata ku okiti banyɔ lɛma nwu. Filisti otii wɔ mmle ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto kamate fɛle onwii lɛma. Diekye atɔɔkpɔnɔfɔsa Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni nkpa bakpɛtɛ. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />SAATE wɔ niadiki mi aakyeko ni kyata ku okiti sɛnɛɛfɔɔ kamɛ kamadiki mi ankyeko Filisti otii wɔ mmle nnɛɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Ni di Saul latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ, di SAATE nwu asiɛko fɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Ninfɛ di Saul layɔ nnwɔɔ omu kakpɛ asaa aakpee Dawid nɛ. Aakpee nwɔ kakpɛ akpeele, aatũkũsɔɔ abɔɔsaa lɛkoto. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Dawid lanii Saul kapamii aakaasa di kakpɛ akpeele suoto, ni alɛ ɔɔkyɛ ankyi annyu nɛ, diekye adikpee nya anya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:39">Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Namafuo ɔkyɛ di asaa ya mmle kamɛ, diekye ninkpee nya nnya.” Nioso aadiki nya aatɛ. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Ninfɛ aayɔ ɔkyɛnwoso nɔɔ kɔɔnɛɛ nɔɔ, aasɛsɛɛ afuɔbi kylɔkylɔ anɔɔ di kaklenyii kamɛ, aayɔ aakpee di katofoe kamɛ di bafosokpatɛ kotofo nɔɔ kamɛ, ku difuɔbi le beenii ni ku okũ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ, ni aakyɛ Filisti otii nwu katũ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lalenkee Goliat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ, Filisti otii nwu ku kubidifunsaa nɔɔ kleetɛ nle katũ bookpukuti mantɛɛtɛɛ Dawid. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Di Filisti otii nwu lanyu Dawid aafenko nii, aanya alɛ obisɔ aale, aasɛɛ, aalɛ sekosopo kafɔɔ, nioso aanyu nwɔ nyakatãa. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Ni aakaalɛ Dawid alɛ, “Weewee nle, oso fɔɔwa ɔkyɛ nii ku kowesee?” Ni di Filisti otii nwu lakpaani Dawid ku afiɔ nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Wa ninfũ, kamayɔ sina lɛfɔ nta bakansiɛ ba kɔɔfɛɛfɔ ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ!”<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ Filisti otii nwu alɛ, “Afɔ fɔɔwa ɔkyɛ nii ku kapamii ku lɛkplɔ ku ɔkyɔɛ, kafɔɔ ami kɔwa fɔ suoto di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke leyooto kamɛ, Israel Yaa bakpɛtɛ ba fatɔɔkpee ni sinunsɔ. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Miɛ dii le mmle SAATE nwu kamayɔ fɔ ankpee di nnɛɛ nii, mpɛ fɔ ntɛ kaasɔ, mbudi fɔ disi. Miɛ kamayɔ Filisti batii bakpɛtɛ bakpi nta bakansiɛ ba kɔɔfɛɛfɔ ku babɔkɛɛ ba kaasɔ. Ni di kayi kamuu kamatofo alɛ Yaa nkpe di Israel nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Mba bamuu niesi ni ninfũ kamatofo alɛ diele kapamii ee lɛkplɔ di SAATE nwu n-yɔ andiki batii. Diekye kakpɛ yi, SAATE nwu kalekale, abayɔ bamuu lee ankpee di nnɛɛ loo kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Di Filisti otii nwu lakpukuti aatɛɛtɛɛ alɛ ɔɔbakpɛko nwɔ nii, ni di Dawid latoso wla aafe kakpɛ kanya aalaakyakako nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lakpee kɔnɛɛ aadiki difuɔ di kotofo nɔɔ kamɛ, aanwanyisa ni aasafɔ Filisti otii nwu di katũ nɛ. Difuɔ nwu ladufɔ katũ nɔɔ diakyɛ kamɛ, ni aanɔɔ aafuusa anu kaasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 17:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Nioso Dawid lalenkee Filisti otii nwu ku okũ ku difuɔbi; di kapamii ditasiɛ nwɔ ni kɔɔnɛɛ, aapɛ Filisti otii nwu aatɛ kaasɔ aalo nwɔ.<verse eid="1SA 17:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Ni di Dawid latoso aalaayila nwɔ di lɔɔkɔ nɛ. Aadiki Filisti otii nwu kapamii, aabɔkɔtɛ ka koopoo aalo nwɔ. Aalo nwɔ aaloo nii, aabudi nwɔ disi ku kapamii nwu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Obe wɔ di Filisti batii lanya alɛ sientɛ lɛma nwu ntookpi nii, baamunikĩi baatoso. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Ninfɛ di Israel ku Yuda batii latu baafe sitũ ku kudú baatikanko Filisti batii nwu baalaadu Gat kasukunya ku Ekron n-yoko nɛ. Bakpi lɛma latente di Saaraim osuku baalaadu Gat ku Ekron. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Obe wɔ di Israel batii lakple ni di Filisti batii sɛmaa, baalaalɛ Filisti batii asaa di kasikɔ lɛma nwu. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Dawid layɔ Filisti otii nwu disi aawako Yerusalem, aayɔ Filisti otii nwu akpɛsaa aatɛ di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ lɛkpaayo kamɛ.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baadiki Dawid Baatuo Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Di Saul latoonyu ni Dawid kodie anfe anaakyakako ni Filisti otii nwu yi, ni aakaalɛ bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ Abner alɛ, “Abner, owe obisuɔtɔbi ninle okosopo wɔ mmle?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abner ladiki kanya alɛ, “Oo ɔka, nwaako fɛɛnya fakpe ni nkpa yi, nin-ye.”<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Wolaa otii wɔ obisuɔtɔbi di okosopo wɔ mmle nle ni.”<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Di Dawid lakple okple di Filiati otii nwu kalokɔ, ni di Abner lakpaa nwɔ aakyɛnko Saul anu nɛ. Dawid lakple aaklee Filisti otii nwu disi.<verse eid="1SA 17:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Ni di Saul lakaalɛ Dawid alɛ, “Okosopo, owe obisuɔtɔbi fale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">Ni di Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Yese di Betlehem obisuɔtɔbi nle.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Lasɛɛsa Anu Di Dawid Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Di Dawid laloo ni ɔkakatɛ ku Saul, Yonatan lababla onwii ku Dawid, ni aabɔmbɔ nwɔ fɛ nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Diayɔ ni di dii nwu nkpo, Saul lata Dawid lawɛ di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, atatɔɔ aakple aasifi ote leyo. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Ni di Yonatan lanii kanya ku Dawid nɛ, ta aabɔmbɔ nwɔ ni fɛ nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ suoto oso. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Yonatan ladiki akpeele wua nɔɔ ya aakpee ni ku akpɛsaa nɔɔ, bia ku kapamii, kɔtaa ku ofiamɛ nɔɔ aata Dawid.<verse eid="1SA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Kɔtɔ lele di Saul lakpee nwɔ ɔbla yi, Dawid ntɛ anlolaa ambla nwaa, nioso, Saul latɔɔ kayilakɔ kplɛ di bakpɛtɛ nwu kamɛ. Nle mmle labuo batii nwu bamuu ku Saul banɔɔfotii anu.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Obe wɔ di Dawid lalo ni Filisti otii nwu kamaa, di basuɔtɔ nwu latookple baatoofe ni leyo yi, basanko ladie di Israel sekpoo simuu kamɛ baabakyakako Ɔka Saul ku sinu ɔsa ku katũ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu ku akasa ateate. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Bootũ nii, baasa alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">“Saul lalo nkpe nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 18:7">kafɔɔ Dawid nkpe afosi nɔɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Saul lanya ɔblɔ osie kanya; nle mmle ditawɛ nwɔ ɔmɛnɛfɛ, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Bɛɛtakatɛsa Dawid katoo ku nkpe afosi, kafɔɔ ami nkpe, nkpe lete. Ɔbe lɛsaa abakple anwɛ, nse diele sɛka kalekɔ nwu?’  <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Nioso diayɔ ni di obe nwu diasifi nii, Saul layɔ onunsɛɛ di Dawid suoto.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Kaleesɛ ninwuna kpile ninwii niakye ni Yaa nfũ labuo di Saul suoto ku osie. Aatɔɔbla asaa fɛ otii wɔ ditate ni nwaa di leyo nɔɔ kamɛ, di obe nwu kamɛ Dawid latɔɔpɛ kyitaa, fɛ mmle ambla ni obe lele. Saul laklee lɛkplɔ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ, <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />ni aayu ni, aatɔɔtɔkɔ suoto alɛ, “Kamamiinasa Dawid nkaasa di oyoyiɛ.” Kafɔɔ Dawid latà suoto aadie di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ sɛnyɔ.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Saul layɛkɛ Dawid, diekye SAATE nwu lasiɛko Dawid, kafɔɔ atoodie di Saul kamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Nioso Saul latososa Dawid di suoto nɔɔ, ni aabla nwɔ bakpɛtɛ kakpe kanyayilatɛ nɛ. Dawid kafɔɔ laleko bakpɛtɛ katũ baakyɛ nkpɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Lɛsaa lele di Dawid lɛbla, ninlɛ nintɔɔ osie kanya, diekye SAATE nwu lasiɛko nwɔ. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Di Saul lanya ni mmle di asaa latɔɔlɛ ni Dawid ɔkyɛ yi, aayɛkɛ nwɔ. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Kafɔɔ Israel ku Yuda omuu labɔmbɔ Dawid, diekye aaleko ma katũ di nkpɛ lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Layɔ Saul Obisankobi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Ni di Saul latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Nnya obisankobi nii nɔɔfole Merab. Kamayɔ nwɔ nta fɔ fan-yɔ; sumu mi ku sɛkambi lete, faakpɛ SAATE nwu nkpɛ.” Diekye Saul latɔkɔ suoto nɔɔ alɛ, “Namatakatɛ kɔnɛɛ nii di suoto nɔɔ. Bita Filisti batii babla ninkpo!”<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Kafɔɔ Dawid latɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Owe nle, obe kafɔɔ di leyo nii ee teemi kafaabi di Israel nle, alɛ ami kakple ɔka ɔlɔ?” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Kafɔɔ di obe lawo alɛ bɔɔyɔ Saul obisankobi Merab manta ni Dawid yi, ni baayɔ Merab baata Adriel wɔ niakye ni Mehola aayɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Kafɔɔ Saul obisankobi Mikal ku Dawid lasiɛ, obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Saul ɔlaa nwu, diayɔɔ nwɔ kafutu. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Ni di Saul lanyu alɛ, "Kamayɔ nwɔ ntɔɔ, alɛ aale dikyi anta alɛ Dawid kamakpanko Filisti batii nnɛɛ.” Nioso Saul latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Nunua fatookple fɛɛwɛ osuku lɛnyɔɔfa alɛ fabakple ɔlɔ nii.”<verse eid="1SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Ninfɛ di Saul lakpee bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Bikakatɛko Dawid di lewofa kamɛ bilɛ, 'Nyu lo, diɛyɔɔ ɔka kafutu di suoto lɛfɔ, bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ bamuu kafɔɔ mbɔmbɔ fɔ. Nioso nunua bale ɔlɔ nɔɔ.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Ni baalaase Dawid sɛlaa se mmle ɔtɔkɔ nɛ. Kafɔɔ Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Bienyu bilɛ lɛsaa biibii dile alɛ faale ɔka ɔlɔ? Ami osuɔtɔ piitɛ lete nle, ninsiɛko kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Obe wɔ di Saul bakpɛmblatɛ lalaatɔkɔ nwɔ ni ɔlaa wɔ di Dawid labuɛ nii, <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Saul labuɛ alɛ, “Bitɔkɔ Dawid bilɛ, 'Ɔka diloomiɛ disi asaa bamba kuanwii dilenkee Filisti batii kɔlafa sisuɔtɔ apoo, nikale ni ɔbla okyisa di balo nɔɔ suoto.’ ” Saul disibu niale alɛ Dawid kabuo Filisti batii nnɛɛ.<verse eid="1SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Nioso obe wɔ di bakpɛmblatɛ nwu lalaatɔkɔ ni Dawid sɛlaa se mmle yi, diayɔɔ nwɔ kafutu alɛ abale ɔka ɔlɔ. Nioso fiɛ di obe wɔ baatɛ ni lawo nii, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lakyɛ baalaalo Filisti batii alafa anyɔ. Ni aayɔ sisuɔtɔ apoo lɛma lɛpɔ nwu amuu aawako ɔka, di mmle aale ni ɔka ɔlɔ kanya. Ninfɛ di Saul layɔ obisankobi nɔɔ Mikal aata Dawid layɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Di Saul lanya alɛ SAATE nwu lasiɛko ni Dawid, obisankobi nɔɔ Mikal kafɔɔ mbɔmbɔ ni Dawid yi, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Saul lakple aatɔɔyɛkɛ nwɔ, ni aakple lo nɔɔ di ayi nɔɔ bule kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Filisti batii bakpɛtɛ kanya bayilatɛ lakple baatɔɔkyɛ kakpɛ, fɛ mmle mantɔɔbla ni ɔbla, Dawid latɔɔwɛ lelenkee kplɛ aatoolenkee Saul banɔɔfotii bule. Nioso Dawid labafũ leyooto nwaa.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Latikanko Dawid Alɛ Oolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Ni di Saul latɔkɔ obi nɔɔ Yonatan ku bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ bamuu alɛ balo Dawid nɛ. Kafɔɔ Yonatan latɛ aabɔmbɔ Dawid ɔlaa. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Nioso Yonatan latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Teemi Saul komiɛ osuku wɔ abafe anlo fɔ nii. Nioso lolaa suoto fanyu; kɔsɛɛ ku olesɛ die falaawofa di lɛba lewo. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Kamadie nkyɛ ninaayila ku teemi di kofe ko kamɛ fakpe nii. Kamakakatɛ di suoto lɛfɔ ntɔɔ, nintɔkɔ fɔ olele lɛnya.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Ninfɛ di Yonatan lalaakakatɛ di Dawid suoto nwaa aata ote Saul nɛ. Aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Tanta ɔka labla kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Dawid dikpile kuninwii; aabla fɔ okpile kuonwii, lɛsaa le kafɔɔ ɛɛbla ni lɛta fɔ dibu osie kanya. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Aayɔ nkpa nɔɔ aata di obe wɔ aalo ni Filisti otii nwu. SAATE nwu lafũ lelenkee kplɛ aata Israel omuu. Faanya ni, suoto kafɔɔ layɔɔ fɔ. Ni obe oso falɛ fababla otii wɔ ninambla ni lɛsaalɛsaa fɛle Dawid okle dikpile, alɛ faalo nwɔ kasakasa?”<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Saul lanu Yonatan ɔlaa, ni aaka ntam be mmle alɛ: “Nwaako, di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, blɔbalo Dawid.”<verse eid="1SA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Nioso Yonatan lalɛɛ Dawid aatɔkɔ nwɔ lɛkakatɛ nwu nimuu. Ni aakpaa nwɔ aawako Saul ɔkyɛ, ni di Dawid lawɛ ku Saul fɛ saa nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Obe onwii kamɛ, kakpɛ lakple kaadie, ni di Dawid lakyɛ aalaakpɛko Filisti batii nɛ. Aalo ma ku osie alɛ baatoso di anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Kafɔɔ ninwuna kpile le niakye ni SAATE nwu nfũ labuo di Saul suoto, di obe wɔ aaklee ni lɛkplɔ nɔɔ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ, aasiɛ ni di leyo nɔɔ. Obe nwu Dawid kafɔɔ latɔɔpɛ sanku. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Ni di Saul lamiɛ alɛ ootofo nwɔ ku lɛkplɔ nɔɔ nwu ankaasa di oyoyiɛ nɛ. Kafɔɔ Dawid latà suoto di Saul layu ni lɛkplɔ aatofo ni di oyoyiɛ. Kakyɛ nwu Dawid latoso aasifi.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Saul lakpee batii alɛ balaala Dawid leyo, baalo nwɔ ku olesɛ. Kafɔɔ Dawid ɔsɔfɔ Mikal latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nse faatoso ku kakyɛ ka mmle fata nkpa lɛfɔ disi, kɔsɛɛ babalo fɔ.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Nioso Mikal lasoosa Dawid aafenko di sɛfle suoto, ni aatoso aasifi nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Ninfɛ di Mikal layɔ afiɔ aatɛ di atensaa suoto, aatĩi nya ku dibula, aayɔ tie sinwini sewo aatika di disi ninya nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Obe wɔ di Saul lakpee batii alɛ balaamufũ ni Dawid, Mikal latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Oofiɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Ninfɛ di Saul lakple aakpee batii nwu alɛ bakyɛ baalaanyu Dawid, ni, aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bikpaa nwɔ di atensaa nɔɔ kamɛ biwakoe ninlo nwɔ.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Kafɔɔ obe wɔ di batii nwu labuo nii, afiɔ niate di atensaa suoto, tie sinwini sewo latika di disi nɔɔ.<verse eid="1SA 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Ni di Saul lakaalɛ Mikal alɛ, “Be oso fɛɛkyɔnkyɔ mi nkpo fɛɛta lo nii letoso eesifi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Ninfɛ di Mikal latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, ‘Tɛɛ nsifi. Nse diele nkpo kamalo fɔ.ʼ ”<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Obe wɔ di Dawid latoso aasifi nii, aalaasifi Samuel nfũ di Rama aalaatɔkɔ nwɔ asaa ya amuu di Saul labla nwɔ nii. Ninfɛ di nnwɔɔ ku Samuel lasifi baalaasiɛ di Naiot nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Ni baatɔkɔ Saul alɛ: “Dawid nkpe di Naiot di Rama”; <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />nioso aakpee batii alɛ balaamufũ nwɔ. Kafɔɔ baanya ni ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ dikudi kobuɛ sɛlaa mantɛ nii, di Samuel n-yɛ ni ninfa fɛ kanyayilatɛ lɛma yi, Yaa Ninwuna labuo di Saul batii nwu suoto, mma kafɔɔ baabuɛ sɛlaa baatɛ. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Ni baatɔkɔ Saul nɛ, ni aakpee batii ditiɛfa, mma kafɔɔ ni baabuɛ sɛlaa baatɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Lɛyɛntɛle, nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ aasifi Rama, ni aakyɛ ditubiɔ kplɛ katũ di Seku nɛ. Ni aalaakaalɛ alɛ, “Ɔfɛ di Samuel ku Dawid nkpe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:22">Ni baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Bakpe di Naiot di Rama.”<verse eid="1SA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Nioso Saul lasifi Naiot di Rama. Kafɔɔ bia Yaa Ninwuna nwu labuo nwɔ di suoto. Ni aakyɛ aatoobuɛ sɛlaa aatɔɔtɛ dialaase di obe wɔ aabuo ni Naiot. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Aadiki akpeele nɔɔ aatɛ, ni aabuɛ sɛlaa aatɛ di Samuel anu kafɔɔ nɛ. Nkpo nwu aasiɛ kakũ ku kakyɛ kamuu nɛ. Nkpo oso di batii ankaalɛ alɛ, “Saul kafɔɔ nsi di Yaa ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ kamɛ?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yonatan Lakyakaako Dawid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latoso di Naiot di Rama aasifi Yonatan nfũ aalakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Obe lɛsaa lɛbla? Obe ninle okpile nii? Lɛ lɛbla teefɔ okpile oso oomiɛ alɛ alo mi?”<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Ni di Yonatan ladiki kanya alɛ, “Diidii! Flɔbakpi! Nyu, teemi nimbla lɛsaalɛsaa, lɛkplɛ ee dibiibii alɛ aakpee mi kootoko. Be oso abayɔ nle mmle ankookaa mi? Diele nkpo kute!”<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Kafɔɔ Dawid laka ntam aabuɛ alɛ, “Teefɔ n-ye nwaa alɛ fanle mi sibualɛ di anu lɛfɔ, oso eebuɛ ɛɛtɔkɔ suoto nɔɔ alɛ, ‘Diɛkaatɛ Yonatan letofo nle mmle, se diele nkpo, ababuo sɛnyaami.’ Kafɔɔ nwaako, di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, di afɔɔ fakpe ni nkpa yi, lɛkpaakyala ninwii lete ninsi di ami ku kukpi ntɛɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Ni di Yonatan latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Lɛsaa lele foomiɛ falɛ mbla, kamabla nta fɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Nioso Dawid latɔkɔ Yonatan alɛ, “Nyu, kɔsɛɛ nimale Kɔwɛntɛ Fɔle dii ole, nse dikaatɛ alɛ kale ni alesaa ku ɔka, kafɔɔ tɛɛ nnaawofa di lepoo kamɛ dilaase di sakale kɔtɔɔfɔ. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Nse teefɔ diɛnyɛɛ yi, tɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ, ‘Nwaako, Dawid lakaalɛ mi osuku alɛ ootoso ankyɛ okpoo nɔɔ Betlehem. Diekye bɔɔbla lɛlɛɛ biala oleɔta ninfa manta kafaabi nɔɔ kamuu.’  <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Nse eebuɛ alɛ, ‘Dilɛ,’ ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nkpe nkpa. Kafɔɔ nse ɔblɔ lɛfiɛ nwɔ, ni fabafũ fannu falɛ ɛɛtɛ alɛ ɔɔbla mi dikpile. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Afɔ yi, le kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ sifutulɛ. Diekye faatɔɔ aabla kanya ninii ku afɔ di SAATE nwu anu. Nse lɛbla okpile, ni lo mi afɔ omu lɛfɔ! Be oso fankpee mi di teefɔ nnɛɛ?”<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Ninfɛ di Yonatan labuɛ alɛ, “Diidii! Nse nnu kafui nlɛ teemi komiɛ alɛ abla fɔ dikpile, ntabatɔkɔ fɔ?”<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Ni di Dawid lakaalɛ Yonatan alɛ, “Owe nimatɔkɔ mi, nse ɔblɔ kanya di teefɔ ladiki kanya?”<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Ninfɛ di Yonatan latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Wa faata busifi lepoo nwu kamɛ.” Nioso baasifi nfa banyɔ lɛma nwu.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Ninfɛ di Yonatan latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, <char style="nd">“Saate</char>, Israel Yaa nwu ale wo kamaayilatɛ, nwaako kamawolaa teemi kanya ɔlaa sakale nuaakpa okle! Nse akpe lɛbɔmbɔ ɛɛta fɔ, naakpee otii abata fɔ letofo? <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Kafɔɔ nse teemi lɛtɛ alɛ ɔɔbla fɔ dikpile, fiɛ ninata fɔ letofo, nta fɔ fasifi di atoko ɔkyɔ ole kamɛ yi, ni SAATE nwu ananfi mi kootoko, bia osie kanya. SAATE nwu asiɛko fɔ, fɛ mmle aasiɛko ni teemi. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Kafɔɔ lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, tuomi sifutulɛ se ninaa ni kaloo fɛle SAATE nwu sele okle, di mmle manamalo mi ni. <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />Tanta sifutulɛ lɛfɔ nwu kafɔɔ labudi di leyo nii batii suoto- nse SAATE nwu ntooloo Dawid balo bamuu olo di kasɔ suoto.”<verse eid="1SA 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Nioso Yonatan lanii kanya ku Dawid leyo batii aabuɛ alɛ, <char style="nd">“Saate</char> nwu ananfi Dawid balo kootoko.” <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Ni di Yonatan lata Dawid lase ntam ɔka di lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ le akpe atɔɔ ni suoto nɛ. Diekye Yonatan mbɔmbɔ Dawid fɛ mmle ambɔmbɔ ni suoto nɔɔ.<verse eid="1SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Ninfɛ di Yonatan latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ: “Kɔsɛɛ nimale Kɔwɛntɛ Fɔle dii ole nɛ. Babakaalɛ fɔ disi, diekye kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ kamate kafukuti. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Sakale, diofe ni kɔtɔɔfɔ lebe kamɛ, kyɛ faalaawɛ di lɛba le faawofa ni di obe wɔ di dibuo le mmle lakye ni kasɔ, siɛ di difuɔ le bɔɔlɛɛ ni Esel ɔlɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Kamataa ataa atiɛ di ɔlɔɔkɔ nini, fɛle lɛsaa lewo kɔklapoosa. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Nse ntookpee osuɔtɔbi onwii lɛtɔkɔ nwɔ nlɛ, ‘Kyɛ faalawolaa ataa nwu.’ Nse lɛtɔkɔ nwɔ nlɛ, ‘Nyu, ataa nwu nte di kakyɛ lɛfɔ ka; yɔ kũ fawako ninfũ,’ ni faadie fawa. Diekye, nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, ni fakpe nkpa; okpile kuonwii nnaa nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Kafɔɔ nse lɛtɔkɔ osuɔtɔbi nwu nlɛ, ‘Nyu, ataa nwu nte di sitũ lɛfɔ,’ ni dikpeni feesifi. Diekye SAATE nwu niɛta fɔ feesifi. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Ɔlaa wɔ di ami ku afɔ buabuɛ nii- nyuma, kafɔɔ falɛ SAATE nwu ninle kamaayilatɛ di ami ku afɔ ntɛɛ dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Nioso Dawid lalaawofa di lepoo kamɛ. Ninfɛ di Kɔwɛntɛ Fɔle dii ole lawo nii, ɔka lasiɛ kaasɔ alɛ oole alesaa. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Asiɛ di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ di oyoyiɛ ɔlɔɔkɔ, aakyɔɔ anu Yonatan, Abner lasiɛ aakaako Saul, kafɔɔ Dawid kasiɛkɔ late kafukuti. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Kafɔɔ dii nwu Saul ditabuɛ lɛsalɛsa, diekye aanyu alɛ, “Loo lɛsaa lewo niabla Dawid oso di suoto nɔɔ diɛbla klekle-nwaako suoto nɔɔ diɛbla klekle.” <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Kafɔɔ kaleesɛ, kɔwɛntɛ nwu dii nyɔɔfa, Dawid kasiɛkɔ lakple kaate kafukuti. Ninfɛ di Saul lakaalɛ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yonatan alɛ, “Be oso di Yese obisuɔtɔbi nwu diɛwa alesaa kalekɔ, bia kɔsa ee miɛ?”<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Ni di Yonatan ladiki kanya alɛ, “Dawid lakaalɛ mi osuku osie kanya alɛ ootoso ankyɛ Betlehem. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Aabuɛ alɛ, ‘Tɛɛ nkyɛ, diekye leyo loo kamɛ batii kɔta oleɔta di okpoo nwu, ni di obiloo alɛ dikaatɛ alɛ lɛwɛ ninfa nɛ. Nse fabale mi sibualɛ, tɛɛ nkyɛ ninaanya babiloo.’ Nkpo oso ananwa ɔka alesaa kalekɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Saul lanya ɔblɔ aakpeeko Yonatan aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Afɔ ɔsanko laatɛ ku tokopĩtɛ obisuɔtɔbi! Nin-ye nlɛ fɛɛbla onwii ku Yese obisuɔtɔbi fɛɛta sinunsɔ lɛfɔ simu ku yaafɔ wɔ nialofo fɔ ni sinunsɔ? <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Di Yese obisuɔtɔbi nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa di kasɔ ka mmle suoto, afɔ ee sɛka kalekɔ lɛfɔ dilɔbayila. Nioso kpee baalaakpaa nwɔ bawakoe, diekye dikpeni eekpi!”<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Ninfɛ di Yonatan lakaalɛ ote alɛ, “Be oso baalo nwɔ? Obe ɛɛbla?” <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Kafɔɔ Saul layu lɛkplɔ nɔɔ aakpee nwɔ alɛ oolo nwɔ. Nioso Yonatan latofo alɛ ote lɛtɛ alɛ oolo Dawid.<verse eid="1SA 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Ni di Yonatan lataka di alesaa nwu kalekɔ ku ɔblɔ yakayaka nɛ. Di kɔwɛntɛ nwu dii nyɔɔfa suoto atale alesaa, diekye aabuo sɛnyaami ta ote anunsɔsaa ya ɔɔbla ni Dawid oso.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Yonatan ladie ku olesɛ aafe lepoo nwu kamɛ alɛ bɔɔlaakpee asi baawo ku Dawid. Aaklee osuɔtɔbi onwii, <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />ni aatɔkɔ osuɔtɔbi nwu alɛ, “Toso faalaawolaa ataa ya lɛtaa ni.” Di osuɔtɔbi nwu kotoso nii, aataa ataa nwu di sitũ nɔɔ. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Obe wɔ di osuɔtɔbi nwu ladu ni lɛba le di Yonatan kɔtaa nwu lanɔɔ nii, Yonatan lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Diele kɔtaa nwu ninte fɔ siitũ nɛ?” <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Ni di Yonatan lafaa aabuɛ alɛ, "Pɛsɛwa! Kyɛ wla! Tan-yila!” Nioso osuɔtɔbi nwu layɔ kɔtaa nwu aakple aawa saate nɔɔ nfũ. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />(Osuɔtɔbi nwu ditatofo nle mmle kuniwii; Yonatan ku Dawid lete niatofo.) <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Ninfɛ di Yonatan layɔ akpɛsaa nɔɔ aata osuɔtɔbi nwu aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ, tuka nya fasifiko okpoo.”<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Di osuɔtɔbi nwu lasifi ni kamaa, Dawid lataka di difuɔ nwu kala kasɔ, ni aawakasɔ di Yonatan anu sitiɛ, aase katũ nɔɔ kaasɔ nɛ. Ni baafĩfiɔ bawo akpoo, baawi kaku banyɔ lɛma- kafɔɔ Dawid lawi aalenkee.<verse eid="1SA 20:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Ninfɛ di Yonatan latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ, diekye buɔka ntam di basiɛwo ole suoto buɔta bawo di SAATE nwu leyooto kamɛ buobuɛ bulɛ, ‘SAATE nwu ninle kamaayilatɛ di afɔ ku ami ntɛɛ, ku banantii lɛfɔ ku banantii nii ntɛɛ dinaa ni kaloo.’ ” Ninfɛ di Dawid lasifi nɛ, Yonatan kafɔɔ lakple aasifi okpoo.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Latoso Aadiɛ Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lasifi Nob, di oletatɛ Ahimelek ɔkyɛ nɛ. Difu lapɛ Ahimelek di obe wɔ aakyakako nwɔ nii, ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Be oso di lete lɛfɔ dile? Be oso di kuonwii dietikanko fɔ?”<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ oletatɛ Ahimelek alɛ, “Ɔka lekpee mi kɔtɔ ku sɛlaa sewo, aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, ‘Otii kuonwii atantofo lɛsalɛsaa di ɔkpɛ lɛfɔ ku afiofa lɛfɔ suoto.’ Batii nii mma, lɛtɔkɔ ma nlɛ bakyakako mi di lɛba ninwii. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Nunua, obe ninkpe fɔ? Tɛɛ bloblo akudi anɔɔ ee lɛsaa lele fɛɛwɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Kafɔɔ oletatɛ nwu latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Nnaa bloblo nwaa kuonwii nunua; kafɔɔ, bloblo wɔ beekleklesa ni owo nte ninfũ- nse basuɔtɔ nwu diete ɛfankyi ɛnyɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Ninfɛ di Dawid ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nwaako, bɛɛblasa basanko di suoto loo, di obe lele ledie. Basuɔtɔ nwu suoto lɛbla Klekle, bia di sɛkpɛ se ninambla ni Klekle suoto. Fiɛ dibawa alɛ miɛ nfɛ!” <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Nioso oletatɛ nwu latɔɔ bloblo klekle nwu. Diekye bloblo kuonwii ditate diediki bloblo wɔ di SAATE nwu Opunu suoto baadiki ni di SAATE nwu anu, mankplesa kafɔɔ bloblo kpankpa manaatɛ di dii le bɛɛyɔ nwɔ nii.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Di dii nwu nkpo, Saul kpɛmblatɛ onwii lawɛ ninfa, baatɔɔ aasiɛ di SAATE nwu anu. Saul bafoso bakpatɛ ɔnɔɔfo aale, leyooto nɔɔ niale Doeg, Edom otii aale.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lakaalɛ Ahimelek alɛ, “Fanaa lɛkplɔ ee kapamii ninfũ? Ninwako kapamii ee lɛkpɛsaa nii kuninwii, diekye ɔka ɔkpɛ nwu labla kpatakpata.”<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Ni di oletatɛ nwu latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Goliat, Filisti otii wɔ faalo ni di Ela Ɔtaata kapamii nte ninfũ. Beeninii ka di dibula kamɛ kate di simu akpeele nwu sɛmaa. Nse nka foomiɛ, yɔ ka; kapamii kukanwii diete ninfũ diediki nkankpo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">Ni di Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Kukanwii diete fɛle nka-nkpo; yɔ ka fatɛɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Dii nwu nkpo Dawid latoso aadiɛ Saul aasifi Gat ɔka Akis nfũ. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Kafɔɔ Akis bakpɛmblatɛ lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Diele Dawid nɛ, kasɔ nwu ɔka nɛ? Diele nnwɔ suoto sinu bɔɔsa ni di ntũ lɛma kamɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 21:11">“ ‘Saul lalo nkpe nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 21:11">Dawid kafɔɔ nkpe afosi nɔɔ’?”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Dawid lamufũ sɛlaa se mmle aakpee di otu, nioso aatɔɔyɛkɛ Gat ɔka Akis osie kanya. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Nioso aakũ aabla fɛ diete nwɔ nwaa di anu lɛma; aawɛ ma ni ninnɛɛ aatɔɔbla fɛle fiibuotɛ. Aatɔɔkyankya n-yoko akloo suoto, aatoosoosa anyakyɔ aatookpete di okusu nɔɔ.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Ninfɛ di Akis latɔkɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Binyu osuɔtɔ nwu! Diete nwɔ nwaa! Be oso biɛkpaa nwɔ biɛwakoe? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Bafiibuotɛ ninaa mi ni oso dikaatɛ alɛ biɛkpaa otii wɔ mmle biɛwako nfũ alɛ abatɔɔbla asaa ya mmle di anu nii? Dikaatɛ osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle kawa leyo nii?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Olebatatɛ Nwu Ololoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Ni di Dawid ladie di Gat, ni aatoso aasifi Adulam ofuɔntuu nɛ. Obe wɔ di babilɛma-suɔtɔbi ku ote leyo kamɛ batii lanu nwu ni ole, baasoo baakyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ninfa. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Mba bamuu niasiɛ ni di nimiina kamɛ ee baasiɛko ni ato ee suoto ditatɔɔyɔɔ ma ni lamana nwɔ baakyi, ni aabakple kanyayilatɛ lɛma nɛ. Baabla fɛ basuɔtɔ alafa-ana di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Aadie ni ninfa, Dawid lakyɛ Mispa di Moab, ni aalaakaalɛ Moab ɔka alɛ, “Fabata teemi ku yaami nnwa mammasiɛ di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ ninaase di obe wɔ kamatofo ni lɛsaa le di Yaa kamabla antɛɛ ni?" <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Nioso aadiɛ ma di Moab ɔka ɔkyɛ, ni baasiɛ di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di obe wɔ di Dawid lasiɛ ni di ofuɔntuu nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Kafɔɔ Yaa ɔlaa buɛtɛtɛ Gad latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Tansiɛ di ofuɔntuu nwu kamɛ. Tɔɔkyɛ Yuda kasɔ suoto.” Nioso Dawid ladie aasifi Heret lepoo kamɛ.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Ninfɛ di Saul lanu alɛ batɔɔnya Dawid ku batii nɔɔ nɛ. Saul laklee lɛkplɔ kɔɔnɛɛ, aasiɛ di kowoso ko manlɛɛ ni tamarisk kalɔ di lekpenkpe osi di Gibea. Banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu kafɔɔ layila baakyi nwɔ. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Ninfɛ di Saul latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Benyamin basuɔtɔ, binu! Yese obisuɔtɔbi nwu kamata bamuu lee afe ku nta awosobi afe? Ababla bamuu lee kakpɛ kanya bayilatɛ anta di nkpe ku alafa kanya? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Nkpo oso di bamuu lee biekũ kanwumbe di suoto nii nɛ? Kuonwii diɛtɔkɔ mi obe wɔ di obisuɔtɔbi nii kɔbla ni kanya ninii ku Yese obisuɔtɔbi. Kuonwii lee diɛyɔ nwu ole di suoto nii ee atɔkɔ mi alɛ obisuɔtɔbi nii lekpee kpɛmblatɛ nii alɛ ate asoko mi, fɛ mmle ɔɔbla ni miɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Kafɔɔ Doeg, Edom otii nwu niayila ni ku Saul banɔɔfotii nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Lanya Yese obisuɔtɔbi nwu lawa Ahitub obisuɔtɔbi Ahimelek ɔkyɛ di Nob. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ni di Ahimelek lawolaa kamɛ aakyeko SAATE nwu nfũ aata Dawid nɛ; aatɔɔ kafɔɔ alesaa asaa ku Goliat, Filisti otii nwu kapamii nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Nioso ɔka lakpee baalɛɛ Ahitub obisuɔtɔbi Ahimelek oletatɛ nwu ku ote leyo kamɛ batii bamuu ba niale ni olebatatɛ di Nob. Ni di bamuu lɛma baawa ɔka nfũ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Saul latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Ahitub obisuɔtɔbi, kyɔɔ atoko nunua.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">Ni aatuna alɛ, “Yioo, saate nii.”<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Ninfɛ di Saul lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Be oso biekũ kanwumbe di suoto nii, afɔ ku Yese obisuɔtɔbi. Fɛɛtɔɔ bloblo ku kapamii, feewolaa kafɔɔ asaa kamɛ di Yaa nfũ fɛɛtɔɔ, diɛta alɛ atɔɔtaka ayɛ mi di suoto, ate asoko mi, fɛ mmle ɔɔbla ni miɛ?”<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ni di Ahimelek ladiki kanya alɛ, “Owe di bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ bamuu kamɛ ninkpe onukwale fɛ Dawid, ɔka ɔlɔ nwu, banyuntɛ lɛfɔ kanyayilatɛ, boobu nwɔ ni nwaa di leyo lɛfɔ batii kamɛ? <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Dii nwu lete niale lɛkasale lawolaa ni asaa kamɛ di Yaa nfũ latɔɔ ni nɛ? Nwaako, oowo! Ɔka atan-yɔ ɔlaa aatika di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ suoto ee ote leyo kamɛ otii kuonwii suoto. Diekye kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ dieye lɛsaalɛsaa di nle mmle nimuu suoto saa.”<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Kafɔɔ ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Ahimelek, nwaako fabakpi, afɔ ku teefɔ leyo kamɛ batii bamuu.”<verse eid="1SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Ninfɛ di ɔka ladiki banyuntɛ ba di ɔlɔɔkɔ nɔɔ kanya alɛ: “Bimunikĩi bielo SAATE nwu olebatatɛ, diekye mma kafɔɔ bɛɛbla kanya kanwii ku Dawid. Baatofo alɛ otoso aatootoso, kafɔɔ batatɔkɔ mi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:17">Kafɔɔ ɔka banɔɔfotii nwu ditamiɛ alɛ boodiki kɔnɛɛ mankpanko SAATE nwu olebatatɛ.<verse eid="1SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Ninfɛ di ɔka ladiki Doeg kanya alɛ, “Afɔ munikĩi faalo olebatatɛ nwu.” Nioso Doeg, Edom otii nwu lamunikĩi aalo ma. Dii nwu nkpo, aalo basuɔtɔ afosi-anɛ-banɔɔ ba niakpee ni simu akpeele fɛnɛnɛɛ. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Aalo kafɔɔ Nob, olebatatɛ okpoo nwu ku basuɔtɔ ku basanko lɛma, babisɔ, babifɔɔle ku banankyue, babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo ku bafoso lɛma ku kapamii.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Kafɔɔ Ahitub obisuɔtɔbi obi Ahimelek obisuɔtɔbi Abiatar ladie aatoso aalaakyakaa di Dawid suoto. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Ni aatɔkɔ Dawid alɛ Saul ntoolo SAATE nwu olebatatɛ. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ Abiatar alɛ: “Di dii nwu nkpo, di Doeg, Edom otii nwu lawɛ ni ninfa, latofo nlɛ nwaako abatɔkɔ Saul. Ami ninkyɛnko di teefɔ leyo kamɛ batii bamuu kukpi kamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Siɛ di ɔkyɛ nii; tan-yɛkɛ; osuɔtɔ wɔ nikomiɛ alɛ alo fɔ nii, oomiɛ alɛ alo mi kafɔɔ. Fabawɛ nkpa di ɔkyɛ nii.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lafũ Keila Okpoo Nkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Obe onwii kamɛ baatɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Nyu, Filisti batii nwu nfɛ kɔkpɛko Keila okpoo, man-yu asaa di kakpaa,” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />ni aawolaa kamɛ di SAATE nwu nfũ, aakaalɛ alɛ, “Nkyɛ ninaakpɛko Filisti batii ba mmle?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kyɛ falaakpɛko Filisti batii nwu faafũ Keila nkpa.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Kafɔɔ Dawid batii latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Yuda ninfũ buɔyɛkɛ nɛ. Ni lɛ nfɛ dibate, nse buɔkyɛ Keila buɔlaakpɛko Filisti bakpɛtɛ!”<verse eid="1SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lakple aawolaa kamɛ di SAATE nwu nfũ, ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Soo fakyɛ Keila, diekye kamanaayɔ Filisti batii nwu nkpee fɔ ninnɛɛ.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Nioso Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lakyɛ Keila baalaakpɛko Filisti batii, baakpaa babɔkɛɛ sele lɛma baasifiko. Aalo Filisti batii kpinwu, ni aafũ Keila batii nkpa nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />(Ahimelek obisuɔtɔbi Abiatar layɔ simu akpeele aawako, di obe wɔ aatoso aasifi ni Dawid nfũ di Keila.)<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Ni baatɔkɔ Saul alɛ Dawid ntoosifi Keila, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Yaa ntɔɔyɔ nwɔ eekpee mi ninnɛɛ. Diekye Dawid ntɔɔtɛ suoto nɔɔ leeyo, ta atoobuo ni di okpoo wɔ ninkpe ni n-yoko ku abɔɔsaa kamɛ oso.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Ninfɛ di Saul lalɛɛ bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu aasiisa alɛ basoo bakyɛ Keila baalaakpɛ Dawid ku batii nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Di Dawid lanu alɛ Saul kokũ ni kawumbe di suoto nɔɔ, ni aatɔkɔ oletatɛ Abiatar alɛ, “Yɔ simu akpeele nwu fawako.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Ni di Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Oo SAATE, Israel Yaa, kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ntɔɔtɛ eenu alɛ Saul komiɛ alɛ ɔɔwa Keila amaawɔɔsa okpoo nwu ta ami oso. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Keila okpoo nwu batii kamadiki mi mantɔɔ? Saul kamasoo anwa, fɛ mmle di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ntoonu ni? Oo SAATE, Israel Yaa, tɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Ninfɛ di SAATEnwu labuɛ alɛ, “Abawa.”<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Dawid lakple aakaalɛ alɛ, “Keila batii kamadiki ami ku batii nii manta Saul?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">Ni di SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Babadiki ye manta.”<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Nioso Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lɛpɔ labla ni fɛ alafa-akuɔ, ladie di Keila baakyɛ baatookyi aba, aba. Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Saul alɛ Dawid ntootoso ni di Keila yi, atasinkyɛ nfa.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lasiɛ Di Lekpenkpe Kale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Dawid lasiɛ di ɔfaafuu sifuɔntuu kamɛ ku Sif Ɔfaafuu akpenkpe suoto. Dii biala Saul nwolaa nwɔ, kafɔɔ Yaa ditayɔ Dawid aakpee di nnɛɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="1SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Obe wɔ di Dawid lawɛ ni di Hores di Sif Ɔfaafuu nwu yi, aanu alɛ Saul ntoodie alɛ ɔɔbalo nwɔ. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Ni di Saul obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan lakyɛ Dawid ɔkyɛ di Hores aalaakyakaako nwɔ aakpee nwɔ osie di Yaa kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Tan-yɛkɛ, teemi Saul dilɔbadiki kɔnɛɛ akpanko fɔ. Fabale ɔka di Israel suoto, afɔ kamaa, ami. Bia teemi Saul n-ye nle mmle.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Banyɔ lɛma nwu labla kanya ninii di SAATE nwu anu. Ninfɛ di Yonatan lasifi leyo nɛ, kafɔɔ Dawid lasiɛ di Hores.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Ni di Sif batii lakata baakyɛ Saul nfũ di Gibea baalaakaalɛ alɛ, “Diele Dawid niewofa kaamɛ loo di sifuɔntuu kamɛ di Hores di Hakila lekpenkpe di Yesimon kala-kasɔ nɛ? <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Oo ɔka, nunua soo fawa, obe lele dilɛ fɔ, awo bubadiki nwɔ munkpee di ɔka nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Ni di Saul labuɛ alɛ, <char style="nd">“Saate</char> nwu awii ye lɛyɔɔ ku mmle biɛyɔ nwu ni ole di suoto nii. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Bitɔɔkyɛ biɛlaawolaa kamɛ nwaa. Biwolaa nfũ di Dawid ndie ankyɛ ni obe lele ku otii wɔ niɛnyɔɔ ni ninfa. Bɛɛtɔkɔ mi alɛ ɛɛtɛ eebe anu. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Biwolaa nwofakɔ nɔɔ mmuu anwofa ni, biekple biwa bibatɛɛ letofo nwaa. See ntɔɔkyɛ ku aye; nse asi di obo nwu, kamatɛtɛɛ nwɔ di Yuda nfaabi nwu mmuu kamɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Nioso baale Saul katũ baasifi Sif. Obe nwu kamɛ Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lawɛ di Maon Ɔfaafuu di Araba di Yesimon kala-kasɔ. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Saul ku batii nɔɔ lakye nwɔ owlaa kasɔ. Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Dawid, ni aasoo aasifi difuɔnkpaa nwu aalaasiɛ di Maon Ɔfaafuu nɛ. Di Saul lanu nwu nii, aasifi Maon Ɔfaafuu nwu alɛ ɔɔlaawolaa Dawid.<verse eid="1SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Saul latoofe di kobokote nwu lɛkyɛ ninwii, Dawid ku batii nɔɔ kafɔɔ di lɛkyɛ bamba, batɔɔpɛsɛwa alɛ boosifi mandiɛ Saul. Di Saul ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ latɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ ni Dawid ku batii nɔɔ alɛ boomufũ ma nii, <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />tɔkyɛntɛ onwii lawa Saul nfũ aabatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Wa wla! Filisti batii ntɔɔwa kale nwu ɔkpɛko.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Ninfɛ di Saul ladiɛ Dawid owolaa nwu nɛ, aasifi aalaakyakako Filisti batii. Nkpo oso bɔɔlɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ Sela Hamahlekot nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Ni di Dawid ladie ninfa aakata aasifi aalaasiɛ di En Gedi sifuɔntuu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lafũ Saul Nkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Di Saul lalaakpɛko Filisti batii aakple aawa ni kamaa, baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Dawid nkpe di En Gedi Ɔfaafuu.” <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Nioso Saul ladiki bakpɛtɛ nkpe ntiɛ di Israel omuu kamɛ, aakpaa ma alɛ bɔɔlaawolaa Dawid ku batii nɔɔ di lɛba le bɔɔlɛɛ ni Lepoo Batie Difuɔnkpaa ɔlɔɔkɔ.<verse eid="1SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Aabadu afoso-yo le niawɛ ni di osuku-lɔɔkɔ; ofuɔntuu onwii late ninfa, ni di Saul labuo aalaakyɛ ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ. Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lawɛ di ofuɔntuu nwu kamɛ sɛɛmaa fanfa. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Ninfɛ di Dawid batii nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Nle mmle ninle dii le suoto di SAATE nwu lakakatɛ ni di obe wɔ aatɔkɔ fɔ ni alɛ, ‘Kamayɔ lo lɛfɔ nkpee fɔ ni ninnɛɛ alɛ faabla nwɔ nle ninlɛ fɔ ni nɛ.’ ”Ni di Dawid lamaa buɛɛ aalaabudi Saul akpeele wua nwu kotokosi nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Nni kamaa, diabuo Dawid suoto alɛ aabudi Saul akpeele kotokosi. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Ni aatɔkɔ batii nɔɔ alɛ, <char style="nd">“Saate</char> nwu atanta labla saate nii lɛsaa kpile kuninwii, nnwɔ suoto di SAATE nwu lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ ee ntakatɛsa kɔnɛɛ nii di suoto nɔɔ. Diekye nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ ale.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Ku sɛlaa se mmle oso, Dawid lasĩ ɔlaa aata batii nɔɔ, atata ma osuku baakpɛko Saul. Ni di Saul ladie di ofuɔntuu nwu kamɛ aasifi osuku nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Ninfɛ di Dawid ladie di ofuɔntuu nwu kamɛ, ni aalɛɛ Saul alɛ, “Ɔka, saate nii!” Di Saul lamunikĩi aanyu ni sɛmaa nɔɔ, Dawid niawakosa suoto kasɔ, aase katũ nɔɔ kaasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Ni aatɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Be oso fannu batii sɛlaa se boobuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Dawid komiɛ alɛ aabla fɔ ni dikpile’? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Miɛ dii le mmle fatɔɔnya ku anu lɛfɔ amu mmle di SAATE nwu ntoodiki fɔ eekpee ni di nnɛɛ nii di ofuɔntuu nwu kamɛ. Batii bawo alɛ nlo fɔ, kafɔɔ lediɛ fɔ; ni labuɛ nlɛ, ‘Namatakatɛsa kɔnɛɛ nii di saate nii suoto, diekye nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ ale.’ <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Nyu, Teete nii, nyu akpeele lɛfɔ kakyɛɛ ka mmle di kɔnɛɛ nii! Labudi akpeele lɛfɔ kotokosi, kafɔɔ ntalo fɔ. Nunua nu kasɔ faatofo kafɔɔ falɛ ninkpi lɛpɔɔ di okpile ɔbla ee ɔtaka oyila suoto. Nimbla fɔ okpile, kafɔɔ fɔɔkpɛ mi falɛ foolo mi. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />SAATE nwu aka ata ami ku afɔ. SAATE nwu kafɔɔ ata fɔ koto di asaa kpile ya fatɔɔbla mi ni suoto. Kafɔɔ kɔnɛɛ nii dilɔbakpanko fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Fɛ mmle di banɔɔfo lebuɛ nii alɛ, ‘Kpileblatɛ nfũ di sikpile ole nkyɛ,’ nioso kɔnɛɛ nii dilɔbakpanko fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />“Owe suoto di Israel ɔka nwu ledie ɛɛwa? Owe fatikanko foowalaa? Weewee wɔ niekpi ni? Ee nyɔ? <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />SAATE nwu ale kantɛ ata wo, aabuɛ nwu kafɔɔ ata wo. Abuo di ɔlaa nii kamɛ, aabuɛ nwu; aatɛɛ lɛbɛ, aadiki mi di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Di Dawid laloo ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle obuɛ, Saul lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Obi nii Dawid, sɛlɔ lɛfɔ nɛ?” Ni di Saul lawi kaku osie kanya nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Ni aatɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Fɛɛtɛ fɛɛbla tinini falenke mi. Feelolaa mi fɛɛbla nwaa, kafɔɔ ami lɛbla fɔ dikpilesa osie kanya. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Kanunua nwu fɔɔtɔkɔ mi dibiene le fɛɛbla mi ni nɛ; SAATE nwu lediki mi eekpee di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ, kafɔɔ faalo mi. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Nse otii lɛnya lo nɔɔ, andiɛ nwɔ ansifi alɛ aablɔɔ dikpilesaa? SAATE nwu ata fɔ letota biene, di mmle kanya fɛɛbla mi ni miɛ. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />N-ye nlɛ nwaako fabale ɔka, nnɛɛ lɛfɔ kamɛ kafɔɔ babatɛ Israel sɛka kalekɔ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Nunua, ka ntam fatɛɛ di SAATE nwu suoto falɛ, flɔbabudi banantii nii fayu ee fayɛɛsa leyooto nii di teemi leyo batii kamɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Nioso Dawid laka ntam aata Saul. Ninfɛ di Saul lakple aasifi leyo nɛ. Kafɔɔ Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lakata baasifi ofuɔntuu lɛma nwu.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Ninfɛ di Samuel lakpi, Israel batii bamuu lasi baawi nwɔ; ni baakookaa nwɔ di okpoo nɔɔ Rama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1SA 25:1">Dawid Ku Abigail</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Ni di Dawid ladie aasifi Maon Ɔfaafuu nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Osuɔtɔ onwii niawɛ ni di Karmel ninfa, latɛ aale saawɛntɛ. Aawɛ batie kakpe ku bafoso nkpe ntiɛ aatoonwiɛ ma ni sinwini di Karmel. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Leyooto nɔɔ niale Nabal, ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ leyooto niale Abigail nɛ. Abigail lale ɔsanko wɔ niatofo ni lɛsaa, aalɛ ni kafɔɔ sekpeele. Kafɔɔ ɔsa nɔɔ, Kaleb otii nwu lawɛ kakuo ku amumu di ɔsaabla nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1SA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Di Dawid lawɛ ni di ɔfaafuu, aanu alɛ Nabal latoonwiɛ bafoso sinwini. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Nioso aakpee bakosopo lefosi kɔtɔ aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bikata bikyɛ Nabal nfũ di Karmel biɛlaasɛɛsɔɔ bitɛɛ di leyooto nii kanya. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Bitɔkɔ nwɔ bilɛ: ‘Siɛ nkpa faklɛ! Biwɛ suoto osie afɔ ku leyo lɛfɔ batii! Asaa ya amuu kafɔɔ ninle fɔ ni ale awɛ suoto osie!<verse eid="1SA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />“ ‘Nunua lenu nlɛ bafoso sinwini onwiɛbee nɛ. Obe wɔ di bafoso bakpatɛ lɛfɔ lawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ loo, butabla ma amumu. Obe wɔ omuu kafɔɔ baawɛ ni di Karmel, lɛsaa lɛma kuninwii ditayu. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Kaalɛ bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ bamu, babatɔkɔ fɔ kafɔɔ. Nioso le bakosopo nii ba mmle sibualɛ, di obe wɔ buɔwa ni di dii olebee kamɛ. Lekoto, ta bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ku obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ Dawid lɛsaa lele fabawɛ fanta ma.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Obe wɔ di Dawid batii nwu labuo nii, baayɔ kanya nwu baata Nabal di Dawid leyooto kanya. Ni baasoko nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Ninfɛ di Nabal latɔkɔ Dawid bakpɛmblatɛ nwu alɛ, “Owe ninle Dawid wɔ mmle? Owe ninle Yese obisuɔtɔbi wɔ mmle? Bakpɛmblatɛ kpinwu nfɛ kɔblá di basaate lɛma suoto di ayi ya mmle kamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Be oso kayɔ alesaa ku ntu nii, babɔkɛɛ ba lelo lɛta ni bafoso sinwini banwiɛtɛ nii nta batii ba niekye ni nfũ di otii dieye ni?”<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Ni di Dawid batii nwu lamunikĩi baakple baasifi nɛ. Baalaabuo nii, baabuɛ ɔlaa biala. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ batii nɔɔ alɛ, “Bikpakũ mpamii lee!” Nioso baakpakũ mpamii lɛma, ni di Dawid kafɔɔ lakpakũ kale nwɔ nɛ. Bakpɛtɛ fɛle alafa ana niakyɛ ku Dawid, alafa anyɔ kafɔɔ lawɛ ku asaa lɛma.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Ninfɛ di Nabal kpɛmblatɛ onwii latɔkɔ Nabal ɔsɔfɔ Abigail alɛ: “Dawid lakpee batɔnkyɛntɛ baakye ɔfaafuu alɛ babasɛɛsa saate loo batɔɔ, kafɔɔ aatutufa ma. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Kafɔɔ batii ba mmle latɛ baabla wo dibiene. Batabla wo amumu, obe biala buɔkyɛ lepoo kamɛ di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma, lɛsalɛsaa loo nin-yu. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Kakũ ku kakyɛ, baate fɛ oyoyiɛ baakyisa wo di obe biala buɔkpa bafoso loo di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Kanunua bu nwu disi, faanyu nle fabafuo ni ɔbla. Diekye ɔlaa kpile kɔwa ɔbaawa di saate loo ku leyo nɔɔ batii bamuu suoto. Otii kpile onwii ale, ni oso kuonwii ninfuo nwɔ ɔkakatɛ ɔta.”<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigail ditalalaasaa obe. Ni aayɔ bloblo akudi alafa anyɔ, nta akuuku anyɔ, bafoso banɔɔ bɛɛfiɛ ni sina, atitabi sɛnle bakilo lefosi bakuɛnsĩ, nta awosobi kosole bɛɛpɛ ni aboo kɔlafa ku abue ya bɛɛpɛ ni aboo alafa anyɔ, aayɔ aatukasa babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu latɔkɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Bile katũ; kamatikanko ye.” Kafɔɔ atatɔkɔ ɔsa Nabal.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Aasiɛ di bɔkɛɛ nɔɔ wɔ nintuka ni atoo suoto oofe ni kobokote kunwii kɔwɛ yi, Dawid ku batii nɔɔ kafɔɔ latoososoo baatɔɔwa nwɔ ɔkyɛ, ni aakyakako ma nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Ninfɛ di Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Diabla kasakasa-alɛ ninyu nii le kpe lanyu ni otii wɔ mmle asaa di ɔfaafuu, alɛ lɛsaalɛsaa nɔɔ ditayu nii, ɛɛyɔ dikpile ɛɛtɛɛ dibiene koto. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Yaa ananfi Dawid kootoko, atɛ atɔɔ ni osie kanya alɛ, nse di oyita lediɛ osuɔtɔ onwii eesiɛ nkpa di mba bamuu ninle nwɔ ni bale kamɛ!”<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Di Abigail lanya ni Dawid, aapɛsɛwa aasoo di bɔkɛɛ nɔɔ wɔ nintuka ni atoo suoto, ni aawakasɔ aase katũ kaasɔ di Dawid anu nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Ni aapɛ akunkyi di nkpaatũ nɔɔ aabuɛ alɛ: “Saate nii, yɔ lɛpɔɔ okpi nwu fatika di lete nii suoto. Lekoto ta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ akakatɛ; nu ɔlaa wɔ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamabuɛ ni. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Tanta saate nii lakyɔɔ atoko di Nabal, otii kpile nwu suoto. Ote ate fɛle leyooto nɔɔ-leyooto nɔɔ ninle Dibuu nɛ, sibuu kafɔɔ n-kyɛ ku nnwɔɔ. Kafɔɔ ami fɛ ami, kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, ntanya batii ba di saate nii lakpee ni kɔtɔ.<verse eid="1SA 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />“Nunua di SAATE nwu ntootĩi fɔ ni osuku, alɛ saate nii atan-wii ni ntɔ kaasɔ, alɛ fabla fakyisa ni ku nnɛɛ lɛfɔ mmu yi, nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, di afɔɔ fakpe ni nkpa, ta balo lɛfɔ ku mba bamuu niɛtɛ alɛ bɔɔbla ni saate nii dikpile bate fɛle Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Fũ akyɛsaa ya mmle di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lɛwako ni saate nii fata batii ba nintikanko fɔ ni. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Lekoto yɔ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ okpile fakyɛ nwɔ, diekye nwaako SAATE nwu kamata saate nii Dawid banatii nle sɛkaa. Diekye ankpɛ SAATE nwu nkpɛ. Fɛɛnya fakpe ni okpe nkpa, tanta baanya okpile kuonwii di suoto lɛfɔ. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Bia kuntɛ otii owo ntikanko fɔ alɛ oolo fɔ yi, SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ kamanyu saate Dawid nii nkpa disi nwaa, di nkpa basiɛtɛ kamɛ. Kafɔɔ babafuki balo lɛfɔ nkpa man-yu fɛ difuɔbi le beenii ni beediki ni di kotofo kamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Nse SAATE nwu ntɔɔbla lɛsaa biene biala aaka ntam aata ni saate nii ɛɛtɔɔ, atɔɔbla nwɔ tunletɛ di Israel suoto yi, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />ni saate nii dilɔbawɛ disibu le nimatɔɔkpɛko nwɔ ni alɛ aawii ntɔ be ninanfĩ ni kaasɔ ee nnwɔɔ omu aabla ankyisa nii. Ni nse SAATE nwu ntɔɔta saate nii lɛlɛ̀ yi, nyuma kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ Abigail alɛ, “Batansa SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa nwu, nnwɔ niekpee fɔ alɛ bakyakako mi ni miɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Awii fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ di kɔkpaa biene ko feediki ni, fanantɛɛ nnaawii ni ntɔ kaasɔ miɛ wɔ mmle, alɛ ami omu ninambla nkyisa ni ku nnɛɛ nii mmu. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Nse diele nkpo, nwaako, di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ nietĩi mi ni osuku alɛ ntambla fɔ ni dikpilesaa, nse fɛ fatanwa wla fabatũ mi, nse osuɔtɔ kuonwii ninle ni Nabal ole ditababu asiɛ nkpa fiɛ kaale ntabasɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lafũ asaa ya di ɔsanko nwu lawako nwɔ ni di nnɛɛ nɔɔ, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ leyo di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ. Ntoonu ɔlaa lɛfɔ, letuna di ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Obe wɔ di Abigail lakyɛ ni leyo, Nabal latũ opunu fɛle ɔka ole okle. Aatoosiɛ nta osie kanya, aatɔɔnya suoto lɛyɔɔ. Nioso Abigail ditatɔkɔ nwɔ ɔlaa kuonwii dialaase kaleesɛ fiɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Kaleesɛ oyita, obe wɔ di nta ntoobudi ni di Nabal anu, ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ latɔkɔ nwɔ sɛlaa se mmle simuu, ni di otu nɔɔ lakpa, aaklee aabla fɛle difuɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Fɛle ayi lefosi sɛmaa, SAATE nwu lapɛ Nabal, ni aakpi nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Di Dawid lanu alɛ Nabal ntookpi nii, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Batansa SAATE nwu, nnwɔ nietufu koto ɛɛtɛɛ ni di Nabal suoto, ta mmle aanyu mi ni nyakatãa oso. Atootĩi kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ di dikpile ɔbla suoto, ɛɛta ni Nabal okpile ɔbla letika ni di nnwɔɔ omu nsintɛɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Ninfɛ di Dawid lakpee baalaatɔkɔ Abigail alɛ abale ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Ni di Dawid bakpɛmblatɛ lakyɛ Karmel baalaatɔkɔ Abigail alɛ, “Dawid niekpee wo alɛ bubakpaa fɔ faabale ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Ni di Abigail lawakasɔ, aase katũ nɔɔ kaasɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “Nnya kpɛmblatɛ-sanko lɛfɔ ninfũ, letuna nlɛ kosumu fɔ, ninfoto kafɔɔ saate nii bakpɛmblatɛ nkpaa.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Ni di Abigail lataka wla, bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ banɔɔ lakyakaako nwɔ, aasiɛ di bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo suoto, aasifi ku Dawid batɔkyɛntɛ nwu ni aakple Dawid ɔsɔfɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Dawid kafɔɔ layɔ Ahinoam wɔ niakye ni Yesreel, ni di banyɔ lɛma nwu baale nwɔ basɔfɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Kafɔɔ obe nwu, Saul ntɔɔyɔ obisankobi nɔɔ Mikal, Dawid ɔsɔfɔ nwu ɛɛta Lais wɔ niakye ni Dalim, obisuɔtɔbi Palti ɛɛyɔ.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lakple Aafũ Saul Nkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Ninfɛ di Sif batii lalaakaalɛ Saul di Gibea alɛ, “Diele Dawid niewofa di Hakila lekpenkpe le niɛkyɔɔ ni anu Yesimon nɛ?”<verse eid="1SA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Nioso Saul lasoo aakyɛ Sif Ɔfaafuu ku Israel bakpɛtɛ alafa atiɛ ba aadiki nii, alɛ bɔɔlaawolaa Dawid ninfa. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Saul labla kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ di osuku kotoko di Hakila lekpenkpe, diakyɔɔ ni Yesimon anu, kafɔɔ Dawid lasiɛ di ɔfaafuu. Obe wɔ di Dawid lanya alɛ Saul ntootikanko nwɔ ɛɛwa ni nfa, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />ni aakpee kasɔ balantɛ baakyɛ, ni baakple baabatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ nwaako Saul ntɔɔwa nfa.<verse eid="1SA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Ninfɛ di Dawid ladie aakyɛ lɛba le di Saul lasiɛ ni nɛ. Aanya nfũ di Saul ku Ner obisuɔtɔbi Abner wɔ niale ni bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ late nii. Saul late di kasikɔ nwu kamɛ, di bakpɛtɛ nwu late baakyi nwɔ nii.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lakaalɛ Ahimelek, Hiti otii nwu ku Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Abisai, Yoab obilɛma-suɔtɔbi alɛ, “Owe nimawa munsoo munkyɛ Saul kasikɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Ni di Abisai labuɛ alɛ, “Kamakyɛ ku afɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Nioso Dawid ku Abisai lakyɛ bakpɛtɛ nwu nfũ ku kakyɛ. Saul late di kasikɔ nwu kamɛ, aatofo lɛkplɔ nɔɔ aase kaasɔ di disi nɔɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ. Abner ku bakpɛtɛ nwu late baakyi nwɔ.<verse eid="1SA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Ni di Abisai latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Miɛ Yaa ntoodiki balo lɛfɔ eekpee di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ. Nunua tɛɛ ntofo nwɔ nkaasa kaasɔ ku lɛkplɔ nii, letofo ninwii; namatofo nwɔ sɛnyɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Kafɔɔ Dawid latɔkɔ Abisai alɛ, “Tanwɔɔsɔɔ! Owe nimadiki kɔnɛɛ ankpanko nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ, alɛ ɔlɔbakpi lɛpɔɔ? <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa yi, SAATE nwu omu nimapɛ nwɔ antɛ kaasɔ; loobia obe nɔɔ nimawo fiɛ abakpi, ee abakyɛ kakpɛ anaaka. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu atanta alɛ ami, ndiki kɔnɛɛ nkpanko nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ. Nunua yɔ lɛkplɔ ku ntu kakuikui nwu di disi nɔɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ, faata busifi.”<verse eid="1SA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Nioso Dawid layɔ lɛkplɔ ku ntu kakuikui di Saul disi ɔlɔɔkɔ ni baasifi nɛ. Kuonwii ditanya ee atofo nwu ole, ee kuonwii asɛnkɛ. Baatɔɔkyɔsĩi bamuu lɛma, diekye SAATE nwu lakpee ma di sɛkyɔsĩ kamɛ osie kanya.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lawaalɛ aafɛ kakyɛ ka nyɔɔfa aalaayila di lekpenkpe osi di obo owo late nii. Obo late ma nintɛɛ kuablɛfɛ. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Ni di Dawid lalɛɛ bakpɛtɛ nwu ku Ner obisuɔtɔbi Abner alɛ, “Abner, floodiki kanya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Ni di Abner ladiki kanya alɛ, “Owe fale, fɔɔlɛɛ ɔka nkpo?”<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Ninfɛ di Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Diele osuɔtɔ fale? Owe kafɔɔ ninte fɛle afɔ di Israel? Obe oso fatanyu saate lɛfɔ ɔka nwu? Otii onwii lawa alɛ ɔɔbawɔɔsa saate lɛfɔ ɔka nwu. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Lɛsaa le fɛɛbla ni diɛlɛ. Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, diesiɛko alɛ afɔ ku batii lɛfɔ kakpi. Diekye bitanyu saate lee, nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lapɛ ni ɔfɔɔ. Nyunyu fafenko. Ɔka lɛkplɔ ku ntu kakuikui nwu niayila ni di disi nɔɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ mɔ?”<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Saul latofo Dawid sɛlɔ, ni aakaalɛ alɛ, “Obisuɔtɔbi nii Dawid, sɛlɔ lɛfɔ nɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Dawid latuna alɛ, “Yii nsĩ nɛ, saate nii ɔka.”<verse eid="1SA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Ni aakple aabuɛ alɛ, “Be oso di saate nii ntikanko kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nkpo? Obe lɛsaa lɛbla, ɔmɛnkpile lɛpɔɔ lekpi? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Nunua saate nii ɔka, akyɔɔ kotoko aanu kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ sɛlaa. Nse SAATE nwu niɛtɔɔ fɔ eekpee mi yi, ni ta afũ asaaɔta. Kafɔɔ, nse batii niɛbla ni, ni bakpaani ma di SAATE nwu anu! Batootososɛɛ nunua di kalekɔ nii di SAATE nwu atesaa kamɛ beebuɛ alɛ, ‘Tɔɔkyɛ faalaasumu bayaa bamba.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Nunua tanta ntɔ nii lawii kaasɔ fanfa di SAATE nwu anu. Israel ɔka nwu ntoodie kayi ale oowolaa nyɔ-fɛ mmle di otii nkpa ni kakyinkyinkpakala di abokote suoto.”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Ninfɛ di Saul labuɛ alɛ, “Lɛbla okpile. Obisuɔtɔbi nii Dawid, kple fawa. Diekye feetuo miɛ falɛ nkpa nii lefũ kɔya, namasintɔkɔ nlɛ kɔbla fɔ dikpilesaa. Nwaako lɛbla asaa fɛle buutɛ, lɛbla okpile dibinte.”<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Ni di Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔka nwu lɛkplɔ ninfũ. Ta okosopo lɛfɔ onwii abafũ ni. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />SAATE nwu nta otii biala letota, ta ɔsaabla tinini ku onukwale nɔɔ oso. SAATE nwu lɛyɔ fɔ eekpee di nnɛɛ nii miɛ, kafɔɔ namadiki kɔnɛɛ nkpanko nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Nwaako, fɛ mmle di nkpa lɛfɔ lefũ mi ni kɔya miɛ yi, nkpo di SAATE nwu kamata nkpa nii nfũ kɔya, andiki mi kafɔɔ di dibuo nimuu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Ninfɛ di Saul latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Obisuɔtɔbi nii Dawid, Yaa awii fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ; nwaako fababla asaa kplɛ, faanlenkee kafɔɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Nioso Dawid lasifi osuku nɔɔ, Saul kafɔɔ lakple aasifi leyo.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lasiɛ Di Filisti Batii Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Kafɔɔ Dawid labuɛ aatɔɔkɔ suoto nɔɔ alɛ, “Dii lewo di ayi ya mmle kamɛ Saul kɔnɛɛ kamalo mi. Lɛsaa le lete kamafuo ni ɔbla ninle alɛ kamatoso nsifi Filisti batii kasɔ suoto. Ni Saul kamadiɛ mi owolaa di kakɔ biala di Israel, ni kamadie di nnɛɛ nɔɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Nioso Dawid ku batii alafa akuɔ ladie baasifi Gat ɔka, Maok obisuɔtɔbi Akis nfũ. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Ni di Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lasiɛ di Gat ku Akis nɛ. Osuɔtɔ biala leyo batii lawɛ di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ. Dawid lawɛ basɔfɔ nɔɔ banyɔ: Ahinoam wɔ niakye ni Yesreel ku Abigail wɔ niakye ni Karmel, Nabal kpisɔfɔ nwu. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Saul alɛ Dawid ntootoso eesifi ni Gat, aadiɛ nwɔ owowolaa.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ Akis alɛ, “Nse faale mi sibualɛ di anu lɛfɔ, ni faata batɛɛ lɛba di kale nwu sekpoo onwii kamɛ, alɛ kasiɛ ninfa. Lɛ nfɛ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kasiɛ di ɔka okpoo kplɛ kamɛ ku afɔ?”<verse eid="1SA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Nioso dii nwu nkpo, Akis layɔ Siklag aatɔɔ. Nkpo oso Siklag lakple Yuda baka okpoo bia miɛ. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Dawid lasiɛ di Filisti batii kasɔ lɛlɛɛ ku awɛntɛ ana.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Ninfɛ di Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lakata baakyɛ baalaadieko Gasur batii, Girsi batii ku Amalek batii nɛ. (Diayɔ ni di okofobee, batii ba mmle lasiɛ di kasɔ ka nialaadu ni Sur ku Egipte.) <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Nse Dawid ledieko lɛba lewo, ann-diɛ osuɔtɔ ee ɔsanko kuonwii asiɛ nkpa. Kafɔɔ an-yɔ bafoso ku banankyue, babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo, kapu bapɔnkɔ ku akleesaa lɛma. Nse atookple eesifi Akis.<verse eid="1SA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Nse Akis lɛkaalɛ alɛ, “Ɔfɛ fɛɛkyɛ fɛɛlaadieko miɛ? Dawid mbuɛ alɛ, “Lɛlaadieko Yuda Kala kasɔ” ee “Yerahmeel Kala kasɔ” ee “Keni batii Kala kasɔ.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Atadiɛ osuɔtɔ ee ɔsanko ku nkpa aakpaa awako Gat, diekye aanyu alɛ, “Lo bababuɛ suoto loo ɔlaa alɛ, 'Nnya lɛsaa le di Dawid lɛbla ni.’ ” Nkpo kafɔɔ aatɔɔbla di obe wɔ aasiɛ ni di Filisti batii kasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Akis lafũ Dawid aanu ni aatɔkɔ suoto nɔɔ alɛ, “Atootuudi batii nɔɔ, Israel batii oso, abakple kpɛmblatɛ nii dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Di ayi nwu kamɛ, Filisti batii lasiisa bakpɛtɛ lɛma alɛ bɔɔlaakpɛko Israel. Ni di Akis latɔkɔ Dawid alɛ, “Dikpeni feenu kasɔ falɛ afɔ ku batii lɛfɔ kamakyakaa di bakpɛtɛ nii kamɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Ni di Dawid latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Ni afɔ omu fabanyu lɛsaa le di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamafuo ni ɔbla.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Akis ladiki kanya alɛ, “Dilɛ nwaa, kamabla fɔ suoto nii nyuntɛ di nkpa nii mmuu kamɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul Lalaapɛ Sɛbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Samuel lakpi, ni di Israel omuu lawi nwɔ nɛ, baalaakookaa nwɔ di okpoo nɔɔ omu Rama. Ni di Saul latososa babɔmpɛtɛ ku bafatɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Ninfɛ di Filisti batii lasi baatɛ kasikɔ di Sunem, Saul kafɔɔ lasiisa Israel batii bamuu baatɛ kasikɔ di Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Di Saul lanya ni Filisti batii bakpɛtɛ yi, aayɛkɛ; ɔfɔɔ lasifi nwɔ. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Ni aawolaa kamɛ di SAATE nwu nfũ, kafɔɔ atatuna aatɔɔ di alaafɔ ee Urim ee Yaa ɔlaa bubuɛtɛtɛ suoto. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Ninfɛ di Saul latɔkɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Bimiɛ ɔsanko wɔ ninle ni bɔmpɛtɛ bitɛɛ, ninkyɛ ninaawolaa kamɛ di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Ni baabuɛ alɛ, “Onwii nkpe di Endor.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Nioso Saul lakpee aklesaa bamba alɛ batantofo nwɔ, ni di nnwɔɔ ku basuɔtɔ banyɔ baakyɛ ɔsanko nwu nfũ ku kakyɛ nɛ. Ni aatɔkɔ ɔsanko nwu alɛ, “Kaalɛ asaa fatɛɛ, faata nnwɔ leyooto kamalɛɛ ni adie awa.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Kafɔɔ ɔsanko nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nwaako, faye lɛsaa le di Saul lɛbla nii. Atoodiki babɔmpɛtɛ ku bafatɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto. Be oso fɛɛkyɔɔ mi okũ alɛ kuyɔ kukpi kuwakoe?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Ni di Saul layɔ SAATE nwu aaka ntam aatɔɔ alɛ, “Nwaako, di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, blɔbananfi fɔ kootoko di nle mmle suoto.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu lakaalɛ alɛ, “Owe ninta adie awa ata fɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Samuel faata awa.”<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Di ɔsanko nwu lanya ni Samuel, aafaa ku sɛlɔ osie kanya aatɔkɔ Saul alɛ, “Be oso fɛɛkyɔnkyɔ mi? Afɔ ninle Saul!”<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Ni di ɔka nwu latɔkɔ ɔsanko nwu alɛ, “Tan-yɛkɛ. Obe fɛɛnya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">Ni di ɔsanko nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Lɛnya kpi onwii kɔtaka andie kaasɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Ni di Saul lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Lɛ okle ate?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Ni di ɔsanko nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Osuɔtɔ nɔɔfɔ niekpee ni akpeele wua nikodie anwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Ninfɛ di Saul latofo alɛ Samuel diale, ni aawakasɔ, aate wlɔlɔ aafuusa anu nɔɔ kaasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Ni di Samuel lakaalɛ Saul alɛ, “Be oso fookpee mi kubuɛ fantakatɛsɛɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Ni di Saul labuɛ alɛ, “Nsi di nimiina kplɛ kamɛ. Filisti batii kɔkpɛkoe, Yaa kafɔɔ ntɔɔkyɛ eediɛ mi. Olosinkpee mi kanya, diefe ni di Yaa ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ ee alaafɔ suoto. Nioso kɔlɛɛ fɔ nlɛ tɔkɔ mi lɛsaa le nimbla ni nɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Ni di Samuel labuɛ alɛ, “Be oso di ami fɔɔkaalɛ, nunua di SAATE nwu ntɔɔkyɛ eediɛ fɔ, atookple fɔ ni lo? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />SAATE nwu ntɔɔbla lɛsaa le aabuɛ aafenko ni di suoto nii. SAATE nwu ntoofiɛ sɛka kalekɔ nwu di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ, ɛɛyɔ ɛɛta owo lɛfɔ onwii-ɛɛta Dawid. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Diekye fatanu SAATE nwu ɔlaa ee fabla di ɔblɔ yakayaka nɔɔ kanya di Amalek batii suoto, oso di SAATE nwu ntɔɔbla fɔ nle mmle miɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />SAATE nwu kamayɔ banyɔ lee, Israel ku afɔ ankpee di Filisti batii nnɛɛ. Kɔsɛɛ afɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ nwu kamawɛ ku ami. SAATE nwu kafɔɔ kamayɔ Israel bakpɛtɛ ankpee di Filisti batii nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Nfanwu, Saul nianɔɔ aate wlɔlɔ kaasɔ, lɛyɛkɛ layii nwu kamɛ, ta Samuel sɛlaa nwu oso. Ɔnyɛɛ laloo nwɔ, diekye atale lɛsalɛsaa dii nwu nimuu ku kakyɛ nwu kamuu.<verse eid="1SA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Di ɔsanko nwu lawa ni Saul nfũ, aabanya alɛ ootũtũkũ ni osie kanya, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Nyu, kpɛmblatɛ-sanko lɛfɔ lɛkyɔɔ ɔlaa lɛfɔ kotoko. Lɛyɔ nkpa nii lɛta, lɛbla kafɔɔ lɛsaa le fɛɛtɔkɔ mi falɛ mbla nii. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Lekoto, nunua nu kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ɔlaa, ninta fɔ alesaa awo fale, alɛ faawɛ osie fansifi osuku lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Saul lasĩ, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Noole.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:23">Kafɔɔ batii nɔɔ lakyakaako ɔsanko nwu baatɔɔtɔkɔ nwɔ, ni aanu ma ɔlaa nɛ. Aataka kaasɔ aasiɛ di mpa suoto.<verse eid="1SA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Ɔsanko nwu lawɛ lɛnankyuebi le niasiɛ ni lɛla di leyo nɔɔ, ni aapɛsɛwa aalo ni nɛ. Ni aakusii nnaafũ nwo, aanwɔtɔ ni aafiɛ bloblo wɔ manankpee ni lɛnyankasaa nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu layɔ aase di Saul ku batii nɔɔ katũ, ni baale nɛ. Di kakyɛ nwu, baataka baasifi.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Filisti Batii Lasĩ Dawid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Ninfɛ di Filisti batii lasiisa bakpɛtɛ lɛma bamuu di Afek nɛ. Israel kafɔɔ lasiɛ di ntu kataakɔ di Yesreel. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Di Filisti batii batunletɛ nkyɛ ni ku akudi lɛma di alafa ku nkpe kanya yi, Dawid ku batii nɔɔ kafɔɔ latɔɔkyɛ sɛɛmaa ku Akis. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Ninfɛ di Filisti batii bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ lakaalɛ alɛ, “Ni Hebri batii ba mmle mɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Ni di Akis ladiki kanya alɛ, “Diele Dawid wɔ niale ni ɔka Saul ɔnɔɔfotii onwii di Israel nɛ?” Atoosiɛ di ɔkyɛ nii dielenkee lɛlɛɛ. Diayɔ ni kafɔɔ di dii le aadie ni di Saul nfũ diɛbase ni nunua, ninnya okpile kuonwii di suoto nɔɔ.”<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Kafɔɔ Filisti batii kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ lanya ɔblɔ baakpeeko Akis baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kplesa osuɔtɔ nwu, aakple asifi lɛba le fɛɛtɔɔ ni. Diɛkaatɛ alɛ ɛɛkyɛ kakpɛ ku awo, se diele nkpo, abamunikĩi ankpɛko wo di kakpɛ nwu kamɛ. Ɔmɛnsuku biene suoto abafe ankple anwɛ saate nɔɔ sibualɛ, ninlekee batii loo bamu asi obudi?” <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Diele Dawid nwu suoto baasa sinu, baatũ ntũ lɛma alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 29:5">“ ‘Saul lalo nkpe nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 29:5">kafɔɔ Dawid nkpe afosi nɔɔ’?”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Nioso Akis lalɛɛ Dawid aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, fakpe onukwale, nioso dibayɔɔ mi kafutu alɛ faasiɛ ku ami di bakpɛtɛ kamɛ. Diayɔ ni di dii le faawa ni ɔkyɛ nii diɛbaase di nunua, ninnya okpile kuonwii di suoto lɛfɔ, kafɔɔ batunletɛ nwu diefũ fɔ bakpee. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Munikĩi, faatɔɔkyɛ ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole; tambla lɛsaalɛsaa nimabuo ni Filisti batii batunletɛ suoto.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Ni di Dawid lakaalɛ alɛ, “Kafɔɔ obe lɛbla? Obe fɛɛnya di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ suoto diayɔ ni di dii le lawa ni ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ diɛbase ni di nua? Be oso ninankyɛ nnaakpɛko saate nii ɔka balo?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Ni di Akis ladiki kanya alɛ, “N-ye nlɛ foobuo mi anu fɛ Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ; kafɔɔ, Filisti batii kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ niebuɛ alɛ, ‘Diɛkaatɛ alɛ ɛɛkata ɛɛkyɛ kakpɛ ku awo.’ <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Nunua taka ku olesɛ, minko saate lɛfɔ bakpɛmblatɛ ba niawa ni ku afɔ, biedie ku kolesɛtũ nse kayi lɛkpa ɔkpa.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Nioso Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lataka ku kolesɛtũ alɛ bookple mansifi Filisti batii kasɔ suoto, ni di Filisti batii lakata baasifi Yesreel nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lakpɛ Ku Amalek Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lalaadu Siklag di dii tiɛfa suoto. Obe nwu Amalek batii ntɔɔbadieko Kala kasɔ nwu ku Siklag. Batoodieko Siklag beekpee nwu ɔtɔ, <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />baamufũ basanko ku mba bamuu niawɛ nwu ni kaamɛ, babisɔ ku banɔɔfo, akyuu lɛma anyɔ. Batalo kuonwii lɛma, kafɔɔ baayefe ni osuku, baakpaa ma baasifiko.<verse eid="1SA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Di Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lawa ni Siklag, baanya alɛ batɔɔwɔɔsa nwu ku ɔtɔ, beemufũ basɔfɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛma beesifiko. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Nioso Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lawi osie kanya dialaase di obe wɔ basinnaa ni ɔnyɛɛ baawi nii. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Baamufũ Dawid basɔfɔ nwu banyɔ- Ahinoam niakye ni Yesreel ku Abigail, Nabal kpisɔfɔ niakye ni Karmel. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Dawid lasiɛ di nimiina kplɛ kamɛ, diekye bakpɛtɛ nwu latoobuɛ alɛ babasafɔ nwɔ afuɔ. Ɔblɔ lafiɛ obiala lɛma di otu kamɛ, ta babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛma oso. Kafɔɔ Dawid lawɛ osie di SAATE Yaa nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ Ahimelek obisuɔtɔbi Abiatar oletatɛ nwu alɛ, “Yɔ simu akpeele nwu fawakoe.” Ni di Abiatar layɔ nya aawako nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Ninfɛ di Dawid lawolaa kamɛ di SAATE nwu nfũ alɛ, “Ntikanko batii ba mmle niadieko wo ni? Kamawɛ ma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">Ni aatuna alɛ, “Tikanko ma. Nwaako fabawɛ ma, fanfũ batii nwu nkpa.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Nioso Dawid ku bakpɛtɛ alafa akuɔ nwu di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ lawa Besor Kɔwɛ, nfa di bawo lasiɛ sɛɛmaa nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Diekye di obe nwu ditoobuo bakpɛtɛ alafa anyɔ, baawaalɛ ni kɔwɛ nwu. Kafɔɔ Dawid ku bakpɛtɛ alafa ana lanwini baatikanko ma.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Ni baanya Egipte otii onwii di lepoo nwu kamɛ, ni baakpaa nwɔ baawako Dawid nɛ. Baatɔɔ alesaa aale ku ntu aanyi- <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />abue ya baapɛ ni aboo kakyɛɛ ku nta awosobi anyɔ. Aale nya, ni aawɛ osie nɛ, diekye atale alesaa kuanwii ee anyi ntu kunwii fɛ ayi atiɛ ku nkyɛ ntiɛ.<verse eid="1SA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Ni di Dawid lakaalɛ osuɔtɔ nwu alɛ, “Owe ole fale, ɔfɛ kafɔɔ feekye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Egipte otii nle, Amalek otii onwii ɔlanle nle. Ni di saate nii ladiɛ mi aatɛ, labuo ni ofiɛ di ayi atiɛ ya nintɔbafe ni kamɛ nfɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Buadieko Keret batii Kala kasɔ ku kasɔ ka ninle ni Yuda ku Kaleb Kala kasɔ kale. Buafiɛ kafɔɔ Siklag okpoo.”<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Ni di Dawid lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Fabafuo mi katũ oleko munsoo munkyɛ batii ba mmle niadieko ni batii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Ka ntam fatɛɛ di Yaa anu falɛ flɔbalo mi ee fayɔ mi fakpee di saate nii nnɛɛ. Ni kamakpaa fɔ nsooko nkyɛnko ma.”<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Ni aaleko Dawid katũ baasoo baalaanya nfũ baawɛ nii, baakyaka lɛba nwu nimuu, boole, mannyi, mantũ, ta kakpɛ asaa kplɛ ya baayɔ baakyeko ni Filisti batii ku Yuda kasɔ oso. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Dawid lakpɛko ma diayɔ ni kɔɔtɔɔfɔ dialaadu kaleesɛ kɔtɔɔfɔ. Kuonwii lɛma ditasifi, diediki bakosopo alafa ana ya niasiɛ ni kapu bapɔnkɔ baatoso baasifi nii. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Dawid lafũ lɛsaa biala di Amalek batii layɔ nii, di basɔfɔ nɔɔ banyɔ lasiɛ ni kaamɛ. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Lɛsalɛsaa ditayu: obisɔ ee ɔnɔɔfo, osuɔtɔbi ee ɔsankobi, kakpɛ asaa ee lɛsaa lele baayɔ nii. Dawid lakplesa lɛsaa biala aawako. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Aakpaa bafoso ku banankyue bamuu, ni di batii nɔɔ laka ma baaleko babɔkɛɛ sele bamba katũ baatoobuɛ alɛ, “Nnya Dawid kakpɛ kamɛ asaa.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Ninfɛ di Dawid labadu bakpɛtɛ alafa anyɔ ba diabuo ni, batatikanko nwɔ ni, aadiɛ ma aatɛ ni sɛɛmaa di Besor Kɔwɛ nɛ. Ni baadie babakyakako Dawid ku batii ba di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ nɛ. Di Dawid ku batii nɔɔ ladu ma nii, aasɛɛsa ma. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Kafɔɔ batii kpile ku adubakpeetɛ ba niasiɛ ni di Dawid batikankotɛ kamɛ labuɛ alɛ, “Ta batakyɛ ni ku awo oso, bulɔbasɛ kakpɛ asaa nwu buafũ ni ku mma. Kafɔɔ osuɔtɔ biala kafuo ɔsɔfɔ ku babi nɔɔ ɔkpaa mansifi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Ni di Dawid ladiki kanya alɛ, “Oowo, babiloo, diɛkaatɛ mimbla nkpo ku lɛsaa le di SAATE nwu lɛta wo ni suoto. Aanyu wo, aayɔ bakpɛtɛ ba niataka wo ni di suoto aakpee wo ninnɛɛ. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Owe nimanu ye ɔlaa wɔ biobuɛ ni? Lɛsaa le di otii wɔ niasiɛ aanyu ni asaa mafũ nii, nni okle di nnwɔ niasoo aakyɛ ni kakpɛ kamafũ nɛ. Bamuu kamasɛ nya kyɛkyɛ.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Dawid layɔ nle mmle aabla ɔsaabla ku kufiofa aata Israel diayɔ ni di dii nwu diɛbadu miɛ.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Di Dawid labuo ni Siklag, aadiki kakpɛ asaa nwu awo aakyɛnko Yuda banɔɔfo ba niale nwɔ ni basiɛwo aabuɛ alɛ, “Nnya lɛsaa le lɛwako ye ni di kakpɛ asaa ya niekye ni SAATE nwu balo nfũ.”<verse eid="1SA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Aakyɛnko mba niawɛ ni di Betel, Ramot Kala kasɔ ku Yatir; <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />aata mba di Aroer, Sifmot, Estemoa <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />ku Rakal; aata mba di Yerahmeel batii ku Ken batii sekpoo, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />aata mba di Horma, Bor Asan, Atak, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />ku Hebron; ku mba bamuu di aba bamba ya di Dawid ku batii nɔɔ lakyɛ baakyi nii.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Ku Babisuɔtɔbi Nɔɔ Kukpi</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro.10.1-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Ninfɛ di Filisti batii lakpɛko Israel; ni di Israel batii latoso di anu lɛma nɛ, baalo ma kpinwu di Gilbea Kobokote suoto. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Filisti batii lanwini baatikanko Saul ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ, ni baalo babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yonatan, Abinadab ku Malki-Sua nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Kakpɛ nwu kanya labawɛ osie kaamana Saul kaakyi, obe wɔ di akplɔ bataatɛ ladu nwɔ nii, baatika nwɔ nkɔ osie kanya.<verse eid="1SA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Ninfɛ di Saul latɔkɔ akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Diki kapamii lɛfɔ faalo mi, nse diele nkpo batii ba mmle ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto kamawa mamalo mi mantɔɔma mi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 31:4">Kafɔɔ lɛyɛkɛ lapɛ akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ oso atabla nkpo; nioso Saul labɔkɔtɛ kapamii nɔɔ kamu, ni aanɔɔ ka di suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Di akpɛsaa-kleetɛ lanya alɛ Saul ntookpi nii, ninfɛ di nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ aanɔɔ di kapamii nɔɔ suoto aakpi ku nnwɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Nioso Saul ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ batiɛ ku akpɛsaa-kleetɛ nɔɔ ku batii nɔɔ bamuu lakyɛkyɛ baakpi dii ninwii.<verse eid="1SA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Obe wɔ di Israel batii ba di ɔtaata kotoko ku mba di Yordan sɛmaa lanya alɛ Israel batii bakpɛtɛ ntootoso nii, Saul ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ kafɔɔ ntookpi nii, baadie di sekpoo lɛma baatoso baasifi. Ni di Filisti batii labasiɛ di sekpoo nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Kaleesɛ, di Filisti batii lakyɛ alɛ bɔɔlaadiki ni asaa di bakpi nwu suoto, baanya Saul ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ batiɛ nwu lakpi di Gilboa Kobokote suoto. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Baabudi Saul disi, baadiki aakpɛsaa nɔɔ, ni baakpee batɔkyɛntɛ di Filisti batii kasɔ kamuu alɛ bayie lɛkya bafenko di afiɔ-yo lɛma ku batii lɛma kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Baayɔ akpɛsaa nɔɔ baatɛ di Astoret difiɔ-yo, baayɔ kpi nɔɔ baasaka di Bet San oyoyiɛ.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Di Yabes Gilead batii lanu ni lɛsaa le di Filisti batii labla ni Saul, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />sɛkambi basuɔtɔ lɛma bamuu lakyɛ kakyɛ nwu kamuu baakyɛ Bet San. Baalaayɔ Saul kpi ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ bakpi nwu di Bet San seyoyiɛ baasifiko Yabes baalaafiɛ ma ninfa. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Ninfɛ baayɔ akufi lɛma baakookaa di kowoso ko manlɛɛ ni tamarisk kalɔ di Yabes, ni baanii kanya ayi akuɛnsĩ nɛ.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>